events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/commits/1a3b1947703f3143280df84ee757d7b724c7e892/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T17:58:02Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T17:58:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(live-panel): canlı analiz aksiyonunu platforma görev olarak ata (dilim-3) (#127)\n\n* feat(live-panel): assign an analyzer action item as a platform task (Faz 24 Görevler dilim-3)\n\nThe live panel''s action items gain an ''Ata'' affordance: inline\nassignee search (GET /api/v1/users) + optional due date + create\nthrough the same admin CRUD the web Görevler panel uses\n(POST /api/v1/admin/meetings/{id}/actions), via new IPC channels\nmeeting:action-create / meeting:assignee-search using the existing\nPKCE access token.\n\nCreate is deliberately NOT retried (endpoint is not idempotent — a\nduplicated task is worse than a surfaced failure). Analyzer payload\nstays read-only; created state is keyed by action text so identical\nre-rendered partials keep their ''Görev oluşturuldu'' badge.\n\nEvidence: vitest 53 files / 630 tests pass (3 new panel tests,\n3 new IPC boundary tests), tsc renderer+electron clean, eslint clean.\n\nRefs: platform-k8s-gitops#3486\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: drop stray node_modules symlink; js-yaml 4.3.1 (audit CVE-2026-59870)\n\nThe .gitignore ''node_modules/'' dir pattern does not match a symlink, so\nthe test-scaffold link slipped into the previous commit — untracked.\nnpm audit fix bumps js-yaml past the !!omap quadratic-CPU advisory.\n\n* style: prettier on slice-3 files\n\n* feat(live-panel): assign by directory userId (gitops#3507)\n\nThe public directory has no kcSubject by design; options now carry the\nnumeric id and create sends assigneeUserId — platform-backend#1120\nresolves it to the stable KC subject server-side (both forms at once\nwould be a 400, so the subject is nulled when an id is picked).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62e7405108f774027eecd34c3522ed47c31572c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/git/trees/62e7405108f774027eecd34c3522ed47c31572c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/git/commits/1a3b1947703f3143280df84ee757d7b724c7e892","verification":{"payload":"tree 62e7405108f774027eecd34c3522ed47c31572c2\nparent 0534ae89b2151842b5da3930f8e0861210683a2e\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1788026282 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788026282 +0300\n\nfeat(live-panel): canlı analiz aksiyonunu platforma görev olarak ata (dilim-3) (#127)\n\n* feat(live-panel): assign an analyzer action item as a platform task (Faz 24 Görevler dilim-3)\n\nThe live panel''s action items gain an ''Ata'' affordance: inline\nassignee search (GET /api/v1/users) + optional due date + create\nthrough the same admin CRUD the web Görevler panel uses\n(POST /api/v1/admin/meetings/{id}/actions), via new IPC channels\nmeeting:action-create / meeting:assignee-search using the existing\nPKCE access token.\n\nCreate is deliberately NOT retried (endpoint is not idempotent — a\nduplicated task is worse than a surfaced failure). Analyzer payload\nstays read-only; created state is keyed by action text so identical\nre-rendered partials keep their ''Görev oluşturuldu'' badge.\n\nEvidence: vitest 53 files / 630 tests pass (3 new panel tests,\n3 new IPC boundary tests), tsc renderer+electron clean, eslint clean.\n\nRefs: platform-k8s-gitops#3486\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: drop stray node_modules symlink; js-yaml 4.3.1 (audit CVE-2026-59870)\n\nThe .gitignore ''node_modules/'' dir pattern does not match a symlink, so\nthe test-scaffold link slipped into the previous commit — untracked.\nnpm audit fix bumps js-yaml past the !!omap quadratic-CPU advisory.\n\n* style: prettier on slice-3 files\n\n* feat(live-panel): assign by directory userId (gitops#3507)\n\nThe public directory has no kcSubject by design; options now carry the\nnumeric id and create sends assigneeUserId — platform-backend#1120\nresolves it to the stable KC subject server-side (both forms at once\nwould be a 400, so the subject is nulled when an id is picked).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkx2qCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARzUQACJjcFrH5jBJhcNXNOVrGVc9\nr+zVMiGAWozfEb7B4GzSPufo57LFaebkBM/hcOEgZzL8pEIJ/TLkSTsis1xyhpFX\nRiuqHkHMQhQX+M7pcIZiMsprCARV06HS5Tq89CUJ+rZLWQTOWHLuBJYkyspmytEL\ntjGmakoQGZqumhHoqQDHNkYzlfdH9BaizvBNQnK0t4sBngqhzjBrYYgCQVwyZ12t\nwvGqaq/4rdFRjODTidICk8Pdzd5L4jnpdW6zFOuVZ8OyQLEN1dNb9ahypgpCFNoC\n7M+UZwcFH+c1taq39mQvHBWQvcuLLHvdkNhKt4R28FvhDeMFaDSIhBmKOvNbLc2f\ntD4Wc5UTfFDtagGUtB6dj0+ONSqCVlBorKvZjrHt65x7s3JTC3nJ7FIin8ozCMmw\nQLGQAAkDB08k7bB+JCh+pj3jBxENOqHaUlHBcw4WPnxkRTZjbsVd9FLcPQ2Ne3FB\nLoNgXK67yv/A9AT7Lee9/RkrlyyKZdm38hTVXMMo4zaJVeoMmkJ6HUWKPqT88rz2\n7f6Lrc/mhp7UtqB7r9DmKTDBzi+6gxI2EoshrSdScV/UoIwr1lTsqHGH1o