Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/commits/82ee9d9dfef24c281d6168edc03945ee4f8b3afb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T20:59:27Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T20:59:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(live-stream): time out on silence, not on elapsed time (Faz 24 Bulgu 3-F) (#85)\n\nRecorder ready icin duz 10 saniye bekleyip soketi kapatiyordu. Ama o kapatma tam da bekledigi seyi iptal ediyor: upstream STT model yuklemesi bu baglantiyla tetikleniyor ve soguk yukleme dakikalar suruyor.\n\nGPU host logu:\n  23:08:18  Loading streaming Whisper model\n  23:08:28  connection lost            <- tam 10 sn sonra, yukleme iptal\n  23:12:31  Stream connected -> reset  <- sonraki deneme, ayni dongu\n\nServisin kendi logu: ''WS disconnected during model load''. Her deneme sifirdan basliyordu; hicbir canli oturum baslayamazdi. Ariza degil, kilitlenme.\n\nFix: upstream zaten loading kareleriyle ilerleme bildiriyordu, istemci onlari yok sayiyordu. Artik her loading karesi sessizlik penceresini yeniden baslatiyor — butce toplam sureye degil sessizlige uygulaniyor. OPEN_MAX_WAIT_MS (5 dk) mutlak tavan.\n\nHazirlik semantigi degismedi: ses hala dogrulanmis ready gelene kadar fail-closed, sessiz upstream hala hata veriyor.\n\nTestler: 10 sn''yi asan tekrarli loading kareleri boyunca sabir + kareler kesilince fail-closed. Ikisi de fix''siz kaynaga karsi kirmizi dogrulandi. Suite 499 passed, typecheck + lint + format temiz.\n\nSunucu tarafi eslikci: Halildeu/platform-ai#272 (MERGED) modelleri boot''ta yukluyor.\n\nNot: bu PR #83''un yerine acildi; rebase force-push eski head''i erisilemez birakip PR''i kapatmisti.\n\nCross-AI: Implementer Claude (Anthropic); Codex kotasi Jul 26''ya kadar kapali, retro-review pending.\n\nRefs: Halildeu/platform-k8s-gitops#2761","tree":{"sha":"4686160bad72e4a158ee7de612780a7a16d4965d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/git/trees/4686160bad72e4a158ee7de612780a7a16d4965d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/git/commits/82ee9d9dfef24c281d6168edc03945ee4f8b3afb","verification":{"payload":"tree 4686160bad72e4a158ee7de612780a7a16d4965d\nparent 393128faf493c635c8464e6abb65572a0356cfdd\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1784667567 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784667567 +0300\n\nfix(live-stream): time out on silence, not on elapsed time (Faz 24 Bulgu 3-F) (#85)\n\nRecorder ready icin duz 10 saniye bekleyip soketi kapatiyordu. Ama o kapatma tam da bekledigi seyi iptal ediyor: upstream STT model yuklemesi bu baglantiyla tetikleniyor ve soguk yukleme dakikalar suruyor.\n\nGPU host logu:\n  23:08:18  Loading streaming Whisper model\n  23:08:28  connection lost            <- tam 10 sn sonra, yukleme iptal\n  23:12:31  Stream connected -> reset  <- sonraki deneme, ayni dongu\n\nServisin kendi logu: ''WS disconnected during model load''. Her deneme sifirdan basliyordu; hicbir canli oturum baslayamazdi. Ariza degil, kilitlenme.\n\nFix: upstream zaten loading kareleriyle ilerleme bildiriyordu, istemci onlari yok sayiyordu. Artik her loading karesi sessizlik penceresini yeniden baslatiyor — butce toplam sureye degil sessizlige uygulaniyor. OPEN_MAX_WAIT_MS (5 dk) mutlak tavan.\n\nHazirlik semantigi degismedi: ses hala dogrulanmis ready gelene kadar fail-closed, sessiz upstream hala hata veriyor.\n\nTestler: 10 sn''yi asan tekrarli loading kareleri boyunca sabir + kareler kesilince fail-closed. Ikisi de fix''siz kaynaga karsi kirmizi dogrulandi. Suite 499 passed, typecheck + lint + format temiz.\n\nSunucu tarafi eslikci: Halildeu/platform-ai#272 (MERGED) modelleri boot''ta yukluyor.\n\nNot: bu PR #83''un yerine acildi; rebase force-push eski head''i erisilemez birakip PR''i kapatmisti.\n\nCross-AI: Implementer Claude (Anthropic); Codex kotasi Jul 26''ya kadar kapali, retro-review pending.\n\nRefs: Halildeu/platform-k8s-gitops#2761","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqX92vCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApuAQAGFiMahgasS4cD/ggUOrGttU\nZRaWUVrT1lxZbkHxczUnx5PUvZxAdgC4+hzrm82BO7BYrXJLU+32NBTbwwb2ahz8\n54YASeSX1AATlcAWJ5BoW7Tyz4HRcUNQ4vofF8+j8UfSUaKMG372aMWYK9ryZ5v7\n9nGx8i68s+daw8qGW9thFm8ilQJTiP8gBaOdsNJHp6dgT+RdK9oVJKV55ttI3Qpm\niRdItgA9yqlaQuVD52IS+zYFje5NRRk7TzSZjqz634UZMee8il4hHuwp0j0RoGdG\nThN8Qp9CM6CC7CGXpZ+gjcOWicyUXTWKYgautbJCvMfZNWKbSk9XjX/YPrUh7qvb\n4zs2zqu+1TCAs4HcjTJxk7Z7G5JgXtO0fI3zDFXA14nUg4e+QgPOKhGno3OLAt6x\nMfG/B2dz/FD0TOxp7gswg0z4UMVI55Ovz7jBsZqkWNrpLOuwYGjyd9Z/snTssZdZ\nrxHCjrRrdSekOwzXjOr8y+MkUVg6A3zAd2E3cSfXsSWk5kR/RNGYBcrG36eg5/j2\nq7yPs1cqK4on7jxhtMVT+KlMB/DMup/WrkkiUbNBrzYW2JLHrsDQnouJ2Yahs4aS\nzJk/boix+ax3R2SkE2mQYOSgj0LKXfTOYA4TG/Lj4UhvUr8FjkFrMPsd+QC/MMqf\nAOSlkrGmvln4JTny5QG4\n=puj1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T20:59:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/