1ae0beea09ffdd8a0af2fe5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/commits/fd39ea12641b3cf7c1ae0beea09ffdd8a0af2fe5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/commits/efd24b22d3f654cfa829b9ea1bdb65e58054cff0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T22:13:10Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T22:13:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(build): Windows package workflow (unsigned dev/smoke) — Bulgu 2/3-C smoke enabler (#63)\n\n* feat(build): unsigned Windows package workflow (dev/smoke)\n\nAdds .github/workflows/package-windows.yml, a Linux-runner cross-build\nfor the Windows target so agent-side we can produce a fresh installer\nfor Zeynep''s Bulgu 2 (recorder-lock terminal, #61 merged) and Bulgu 3-C\n(host-nginx WS upgrade, gitops#2711 merged) smoke without waiting on a\nWindows box.\n\nDesign:\n- runs-on: ubuntu-latest — GitHub-hosted (billing check may apply);\n  self-hosted staging-sw-desktop-ci already exists for the Linux/CI\n  workflow and can be re-labelled for Windows if we later want a\n  self-hosted path.\n- wine + wine32:i386 + nsis; unsigned (CSC_IDENTITY_AUTO_DISCOVERY=false,\n  forceCodeSigning=false) — this is a dev/smoke track, NOT a signed\n  release. SmartScreen will warn on first launch; that is expected.\n- Emits NSIS installer + portable .exe under\n  release/windows-x64-<sha>/; verifies size + sha256; uploads as\n  workflow artifact for 14 days.\n- workflow_dispatch input `ref` allows building any branch/tag;\n  tag `v*` push auto-builds.\n\nSigned Windows release stays a separate workflow when the platform-desktop\nside of the AG-018 osslsigncode + internal CA setup lands.\n\nRef: platform-desktop#61 (Bulgu 2), gitops#2711 (Bulgu 3-C)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(deps): npm audit fix — brace-expansion + js-yaml high sev\n\nPre-existing transitive vulnerabilities blocked CI on this PR\n(`security:audit` runs `npm audit --audit-level=moderate`). npm audit fix\nresolved both via lock-file only updates (no direct dep changes, no\nmajor bumps); post-fix `npm audit` reports 0 vulnerabilities.\n\n- brace-expansion GHSA-3jxr-9vmj-r5cp (10 nested paths)\n- js-yaml GHSA-52cp-r559-cp3m (1 direct)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"010c9839d9cd49eb526c8bd5b1876d85ce756f3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/git/trees/010c9839d9cd49eb526c8bd5b1876d85ce756f3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/git/commits/efd24b22d3f654cfa829b9ea1bdb65e58054cff0","verification":{"payload":"tree 010c9839d9cd49eb526c8bd5b1876d85ce756f3a\nparent f095a0f5b08dce0c12c9f02edf6f2bac066665f0\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1784585590 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784585590 +0300\n\nfeat(build): Windows package workflow (unsigned dev/smoke) — Bulgu 2/3-C smoke enabler (#63)\n\n* feat(build): unsigned Windows package workflow (dev/smoke)\n\nAdds .github/workflows/package-windows.yml, a Linux-runner cross-build\nfor the Windows target so agent-side we can produce a fresh installer\nfor Zeynep''s Bulgu 2 (recorder-lock terminal, #61 merged) and Bulgu 3-C\n(host-nginx WS upgrade, gitops#2711 merged) smoke without waiting on a\nWindows box.\n\nDesign:\n- runs-on: ubuntu-latest — GitHub-hosted (billing check may apply);\n  self-hosted staging-sw-desktop-ci already exists for the Linux/CI\n  workflow and can be re-labelled for Windows if we later want a\n  self-hosted path.\n- wine + wine32:i386 + nsis; unsigned (CSC_IDENTITY_AUTO_DISCOVERY=false,\n  forceCodeSigning=false) — this is a dev/smoke track, NOT a signed\n  release. SmartScreen will warn on first launch; that is expected.\n- Emits NSIS installer + portable .exe under\n  release/windows-x64-<sha>/; verifies size + sha256; uploads as\n  workflow artifact for 14 days.\n- workflow_dispatch input `ref` allows building any branch/tag;\n  tag `v*` push auto-builds.\n\nSigned Windows release stays a separate workflow when the platform-desktop\nside of the AG-018 osslsigncode + internal CA setup lands.\n\nRef: platform-desktop#61 (Bulgu 2), gitops#2711 (Bulgu 3-C)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(deps): npm audit fix — brace-expansion + js-yaml high sev\n\nPre-existing transitive vulnerabilities blocked CI on this PR\n(`security:audit` runs `npm audit --audit-level=moderate`). npm audit fix\nresolved both via lock-file only updates (no direct dep changes, no\nmajor bumps); post-fix `npm audit` reports 0 vulnerabilities.\n\n- brace-expansion GHSA-3jxr-9vmj-r5cp (10 nested paths)\n- js-yaml GHSA-52cp-r559-cp3m (1 direct)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXp1