api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zeynep-serban","id":244165292,"login":"zeynep-serban","node_id":"U_kgDODo2qrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/commits/0b8a1702cea409870f51841de9816faf4566fbff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T16:12:15Z","email":"zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr","name":"zeynep-serban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T16:12:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(tray): recording pause/resume — capture primitive + tray menu (#37) (#47)\n\ndesktop#6 follow-up: PR #35 delivered tray/notifications/auto-launch but\ndeliberately left pause/resume out because the capture pipeline had no\npause primitive. This wires it end to end:\n\n1. Capture pipeline pause primitive (src/audio/capture.ts): Recorder gains\n   pause()/resume()/isPaused(). While paused, each worklet frame is dropped\n   entirely — no gateway chunk is sent, the live-STT stream is silent, and\n   nothing is buffered, so resuming never flushes pause-gap audio and the\n   gateway chunk sequence stays contiguous. pause/resume are no-ops after\n   stop().\n2. Tray menu (electron/services/tray-manager.ts): a \"Kaydı Duraklat\" /\n   \"Kaydı Sürdür\" item appears only during an active recording, with\n   onPauseRecording/onResumeRecording callbacks and a paused tooltip;\n   stopping a recording clears the paused state. Wired through preload\n   (tray.setPaused + onPauseRequested/onResumeRequested) and main\n   (tray:set-paused + tray:pause-requested/tray:resume-requested).\n3. Renderer (src/App.tsx): paused state + handlePause/handleResume drive\n   the recorder and reflect to the tray; a Duraklat/Sürdür button sits\n   beside Bitir; paused resets on start/stop/error.\n\nTests: capture pipeline sends no chunk while paused and resumes a\ncontiguous sequence + pause/resume no-op after stop; tray menu swaps\nDuraklat<->Sürdür and fires the callbacks; App-level tray pause/resume\ndrives the recorder and toggles the UI. typecheck/lint/format clean,\n33 files / 306 tests pass, build ok.","tree":{"sha":"10cdfd0dec6dd3f7adc902f89f9f298b270047be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/git/trees/10cdfd0dec6dd3f7adc902f89f9f298b270047be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/git/commits/0b8a1702cea409870f51841de9816faf4566fbff","verification":{"payload":"tree 10cdfd0dec6dd3f7adc902f89f9f298b270047be\nparent a88f4abb58eb0c97d4007c48525dd8bf04954cd4\nauthor zeynep-serban <zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr> 1783959135 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783959135 +0300\n\nfeat(tray): recording pause/resume — capture primitive + tray menu (#37) (#47)\n\ndesktop#6 follow-up: PR #35 delivered tray/notifications/auto-launch but\ndeliberately left pause/resume out because the capture pipeline had no\npause primitive. This wires it end to end:\n\n1. Capture pipeline pause primitive (src/audio/capture.ts): Recorder gains\n   pause()/resume()/isPaused(). While paused, each worklet frame is dropped\n   entirely — no gateway chunk is sent, the live-STT stream is silent, and\n   nothing is buffered, so resuming never flushes pause-gap audio and the\n   gateway chunk sequence stays contiguous. pause/resume are no-ops after\n   stop().\n2. Tray menu (electron/services/tray-manager.ts): a \"Kaydı Duraklat\" /\n   \"Kaydı Sürdür\" item appears only during an active recording, with\n   onPauseRecording/onResumeRecording callbacks and a paused tooltip;\n   stopping a recording clears the paused state. Wired through preload\n   (tray.setPaused + onPauseRequested/onResumeRequested) and main\n   (tray:set-paused + tray:pause-requested/tray:resume-requested).\n3. Renderer (src/App.tsx): paused state + handlePause/handleResume drive\n   the recorder and reflect to the tray; a Duraklat/Sürdür button sits\n   beside Bitir; paused resets on start/stop/error.\n\nTests: capture pipeline sends no chunk while paused and resumes a\ncontiguous sequence + pause/resume no-op after stop; tray menu swaps\nDuraklat<->Sürdür and fires the callbacks; App-level tray pause/resume\ndrives the recorder and toggles the UI. typecheck/lint/format clean,\n33 files / 306 tests pass, build ok.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVQ5fCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAygIQAA4manlWqpLujzt5eNBUoXki\najcusVc7K4N8AHbEayolDJRqgN2rMUtQ+qT3avdFt/nJxuUBW8pIevNtdHZvXPCl\nZVn6MBoYqoCwjKWtcPgyo+nIYMRrdtLFO/r4yfYf1eiw5rK/FKQ6ln7udhCXResx\nWaNkpUc/2rMgNFQ/32ETir6TWzYzK/AozmT2Zag4HjI3BLQKnrM8GYCaSC9AIF9Z\ny/3p79uWJ+AqLhtUxapFJ6q8jamrmDYaGiqGA9x5ZFbLcVLUc86xrLjvQ9YrGcnf\nZCBD75NrwFPmvIE7h50gSfUAlGb4oRljMbEqu5m0EIWwHpEBG8r9qg4jau8TYF4n\nB0yvIoIkU3dn1QClJNynk+5pjSFBUFdpnULk8diENkAW471jK/PStgUzPsmfPk9l\nkmnsJ8zMWO0z/UGpA7q6KmqH8U/PbYvCgXWYUA8zaTaZq93zN8hOoPKLbDpps51O\n6LVFQskbH3JRXsiGomsz2zXfdjRGMkriDLfcGGdL024Ht7iONCz4ymFnMt+UExrX\no/OGXQL1jqdalHP/XexCL7QwdcHcbzq5JE7ckM+WnvEM5ekqyovX3XdXePUNIkrI\nqePgoSvD6NlP5nJFEswgxBGPVEJq/5DP/jIokxujHllMZpWrY5e6xa4fEWJfLG0T\nohhRNFcYdvZVNyJm2azS\n=shvH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-13T16:12:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https: