Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/commits/d44a5a55a7e3759fbdb58787755ca0c27f0a6879/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T09:46:37Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T09:46:37Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"message":"fix(recording): single-finalization stop guard + outcome-aware tray notifications\n\nCodex cross-AI review (REVISE, session 019f4b63) found two behavioral defects\nin the merged tray <-> recorder interaction surface:\n\n1. Re-entrant handleStop: recorderRef cleared only in finally; while the first\n   stop() awaits upload tail, a second UI/tray invocation returned immediately\n   (capture.stop is idempotent) and prematurely declared ''Kayıt tamamlandı'',\n   finished the transcript and moved Meeting AI to waiting.\n   -> stopInFlightRef guard (single finalization) + stopping state disables\n   the Bitir button (''Bitiriliyor...'') while stop is in flight.\n\n2. False success notification: every tray active->inactive transition\n   unconditionally fired notifyRecordingFinished(), so error paths (recorder\n   onError, failed stop) showed an OS-level ''Kayıt tamamlandı'' while the\n   renderer showed an error. Tray state sync and outcome notification are now\n   separate concepts: setRecordingActive(active, outcome?, errorMessage?) —\n   ''finished'' -> notifyRecordingFinished, ''error'' -> notifyRecordingError\n   (previously defined but never used), no outcome -> silent state sync.\n\nTests: +2 behavioral cases (concurrent UI+tray stop => exactly one\nfinalization + no premature success; failed stop => tray receives\n(false,''error'',message)). Suite: 29 files / 264 tests pass; tsc renderer +\nelectron clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1764c3db8046a1dda2deb5a9868789b684c98190","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/git/trees/1764c3db8046a1dda2deb5a9868789b684c98190"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/git/commits/d44a5a55a7e3759fbdb58787755ca0c27f0a6879","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-desktop/commit/d44a5a55a7e3759fbdb58787755ca0c27f0a6879","node_id":"C_kwDOSvTQJ9oAKGQ0NGE1YTU1YTdlMzc1OWZiZGI1ODc4Nzc1NWNhMGMyN2YwYTY4Nzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-desktop/commit/e88a0f3708c34fb81fe8d64fa88331da9ac78cf6","sha":"e88a0f3708c34fb81fe8d64fa88331da9ac78cf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/commits/e88a0f3708c34fb81fe8d64fa88331da9ac78cf6"}],"sha":"d44a5a55a7e3759fbdb58787755ca0c27f0a6879","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/commits/d44a5a55a7e3759fbdb58787755ca0c27f0a6879"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-desktop/commits/e88a0f3708c34fb81fe8d64fa88331da9ac78cf6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T09:36:19Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T09:36:19Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"message":"fix(packaging): neutralize silent brand drift the merge guard missed + widen guard to whole manifest\n\nThe auto-merge kept branch''s vendor-neutral identity (appId/productName/author)\nbut silently retained 3 vendor-branded strings main introduced in #35/#36\npackaging surfaces the old guard never scanned: mac extendInfo\nNSMicrophoneUsageDescription + NSScreenCaptureUsageDescription (macOS\npermission dialogs) and the linux desktop entry Name (menu label).\n\n- package.json: 3 strings -> ''Meeting Intelligence''\n- product-scope.test.ts: new case scans the ENTIRE raw package.json for\n  vendor markers (narrow field-list scan provably missed packaging fields)\n\nEvidence: vitest 29 files / 262 tests pass (incl. the new guard case, which\nfails against the pre-fix manifest).\n\nCo-Authore