alildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-mobile/commits/a7744125e6aa57c8637075c1c85a90b1b5a87309/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T19:56:10Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T19:56:10Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"message":"chore(scaffold): initial repo skeleton — Faz 24 M6 Integration React Native + Expo + TypeScript\n\n3-AI mutabakat (Codex 019e879c + Mavis msg 78 + Claude AGREE) sonrası\nplatform-mobile yeni repo. Meeting Intelligence mobile client (iOS +\nAndroid). audio capture + WebSocket → audio-gateway-service → Workcube\nSTT pipeline.\n\n## Yeni dosyalar\n\n- README.md: Workcube ekosistem haritası + Stack + Mimari akış + 10-slice\n  Faz 24 M6 roadmap (PR-mobile-01..PR-mobile-10)\n- CLAUDE.md: agent kılavuzu — global ⊕ repo-specific HARD RULE (PII/KVKK\n  boundary + audio API discipline + background mode iOS/Android +\n  permission just-in-time + EAS Build + cross-platform parity + cross-AI\n  Codex review)\n- AGENTS.md: repo giriş yüzeyi + HARD RULE özet\n- package.json: Expo SDK 52 + React Native 0.76 + TypeScript 5.7 +\n  expo-audio + expo-auth-session + expo-secure-store + expo-sqlite +\n  expo-notifications + expo-local-authentication + Redux Toolkit +\n  i18next + Detox + Jest\n- app.json: Expo config — bundle IDs (com.workcube.meeting) + permissions\n  (RECORD_AUDIO + FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MICROPHONE + POST_NOTIFICATIONS) +\n  iOS UIBackgroundModes=audio + NSMicrophoneUsageDescription Türkçe KVKK\n  rationale + Android adaptive icon + Expo Router plugin + EAS Update\n  policy\n- tsconfig.json: expo/tsconfig.base extends + strict + path alias @/\n- babel.config.js: babel-preset-expo + react-native-reanimated plugin\n- eas.json: 3 profile (development simulator + preview internal +\n  production autoIncrement + iOS Release/Android app-bundle) + Submit\n  config placeholder\n- app/_layout.tsx: Expo Router root layout (dark theme baseline)\n- app/index.tsx: Initial screen skeleton\n- expo-env.d.ts: Expo types reference\n\n## Stack disipliner\n\n- Expo SDK 52+ (Managed workflow start; bare migration future need)\n- TypeScript strict + path alias\n- Expo Router file-based routing (app/ dizini)\n- expo-secure-store + expo-sqlite (KVKK encrypted audio buffer)\n- expo-audio PCM streaming + just-in-time permission\n- expo-auth-session Keycloak OAuth2 PKCE\n- expo-notifications FCM + APNs (Faz 23 entegre)\n- expo-local-authentication Face ID + Touch ID\n- React Native 0.76+ + Reanimated 3.16\n- EAS Build + EAS Submit + EAS Update OTA\n- Detox + Maestro e2e (Tarayıcıdan Doğrulanmadan HARD RULE mobile\n  uyarlaması)\n\n## KVKK + Permission disiplini\n\n- NSMicrophoneUsageDescription Türkçe KVKK rationale (Info.plist)\n- POST_NOTIFICATIONS Android 13+ runtime request\n- Background audio yalnız capture aktif iken (user-visible indicator)\n- iOS background mode = audio only when needed\n- Android foreground service persistent notification\n- Permission request just-in-time (just-launch''ta değil) + rationale\n- SecureStore token + SQLite encrypted offline buffer + TTL auto-purge\n\n## Cross-AI Mutabakat\n\n- Codex 019e879c (plan-time Faz 24 AGREE)\n- Mavis msg 78 (AGREE final)\n- Claude (implementer)\n\n## Project Board (yeni HARD RULE)\n\nSıradaki: Project #4 Hedef Repo field''a \"platform-mobile\" option ekle +\nM6 Integration scope''una platform-mobile için 10 issue (PR-mobile-01..\nPR-mobile-10 + EAS Build + cross-platform parity + Detox/Maestro e2e).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e62c364fc7f18ebfc6a46ef9e0a0e24d80bfb8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-mobile/git/trees/8e62c364fc7f18ebfc6a46ef9e0a0e24d80bfb8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-mobile/git/commits/a7744125e6aa57c8637075c1c85a90b1b5a87309","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-mobile/commit/a7744125e6aa57c8637075c1c85a90b1b5a87309","node_id":"C_kwDOSvTj09oAKGE3NzQ0MTI1ZTZhYTU3Yzg2MzcwNzVjMWM4NWE5MGIxYjVhODczMDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-mobile/commit/3a0363ded8c651d3ec956b024b310e2663a71cf5","sha":"3a0363ded8c651d3ec956b024b310e2663a71cf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-mobile/commits/3a0363ded8c651d3ec956b024b310e2663a71cf5"}],"sha":"a7744125e6aa57c8637075c1c85a90b1b5a87309","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-mobile/commits/a7744125e6aa57c8637075c1c85a90b1b5a87309"},{"author":{"avatar_url":