/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhargavchippada/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhargavchippada/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhargavchippada/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhargavchippada/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhargavchippada","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyanpen/code-graph-rag/commits/13cc48775c46db1ed924595f7d1a0989b8bc885c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-01T11:45:37Z","email":"bhargav.chippada19@gmail.com","name":"Bhargav Chippada"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T19:07:20Z","email":"eheva87@gmail.com","name":"vitali87"},"message":"fix(graph-updater): prune orphan nodes from graph on startup\n\nGraphUpdater._process_files only cleared in-memory state for deleted\nfiles but never issued Cypher DELETE to Memgraph. Files/folders deleted\nbefore the hash cache existed were invisible to the diff logic entirely.\n\n- Add _prune_orphan_nodes() to GraphUpdater that queries all File,\n  Module, and Folder paths from the graph, checks filesystem existence,\n  and deletes stale nodes via CYPHER_DELETE_* queries\n- Fix _process_files to issue CYPHER_DELETE_MODULE + CYPHER_DELETE_FILE\n  for hash-cache-detected deletions (not just in-memory cleanup)\n- Add CYPHER_DELETE_FOLDER and CYPHER_ALL_*_PATHS query constants\n- Add PRUNE_* log message constants\n- Add 10 unit tests covering pruning logic, edge cases, and integration\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9325c31733513abd50f1180bd4376c6bb043749c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyanpen/code-graph-rag/git/trees/9325c31733513abd50f1180bd4376c6bb043749c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyanpen/code-graph-rag/git/commits/13cc48775c46db1ed924595f7d1a0989b8bc885c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null