:"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add npm cooldown to dependabot for pnpm minimumReleaseAge (#22)\n\npnpm 11 enables minimumReleaseAge (1440 min / 24h) by default, so\ndependabot PRs for releases younger than 24h fail CI install with\nERR_PNPM_MINIMUM_RELEASE_AGE_VIOLATION. A 1-day cooldown holds npm\nbump PRs until the version clears the gate, keeping the pnpm default on.","tree":{"sha":"b84747edbfe44f92217f1a96a12f7d2c3e15b694","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djbender/micro-frontends-demo/git/trees/b84747edbfe44f92217f1a96a12f7d2c3e15b694"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djbender/micro-frontends-demo/git/commits/d65e1a9ddda8392469522ac8f9e16e3517870379","verification":{"payload":"tree b84747edbfe44f92217f1a96a12f7d2c3e15b694\nparent fe89a1f9b9a343cbb3a8b7c1e1c0b30c35049ec0\nauthor Derek Bender <170351+djbender@users.noreply.github.com> 1781018864 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781018864 +0000\n\nAdd npm cooldown to dependabot for pnpm minimumReleaseAge (#22)\n\npnpm 11 enables minimumReleaseAge (1440 min / 24h) by default, so\ndependabot PRs for releases younger than 24h fail CI install with\nERR_PNPM_MINIMUM_RELEASE_AGE_VIOLATION. A 1-day cooldown holds npm\nbump PRs until the version clears the gate, keeping the pnpm default on.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKDDwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+mkQAD9OMJK/fx/+9587VceOz4ie\nuJMyh7rZOFFODcljf3ONAT9YAiwh1EerlmXCT2JZjNX80fZ5ra7Is5GCWL/4JlRI\nS1XggQAmk53ZopU112OYL3uYbuHD4vVJBIpWU9qFCYwLz07nqzoJ+0YADMOL8YN4\n3FPCFdW1p31zoRnzrpUXF7VfkwBJHt73a7j56JCVJi0TIGDvZ+jigRejRa64l8PN\njyv4XEteG2JqUsWWSbn7vGpXltiDTIp7Z86wdJyyOBGhiOFJrYl7zlOCj5cRTr9b\n9KFfHffCZvRE4L4fFQNQOTRgX7KcMn3OUt2tbli9gEYlX/clPYGSn0/aLv2EenoF\nq7/s9Jzkixq/9wvS6ZwdEhw+bmnCHSI5ORPtG0SorPotixQ65AszdFjadB9w0TL+\n73dHf09QU8grobXp3asHSFCXrOsM+CtSLXw0vV4f6nkC4Dn8ziu4IqTET2KEaCEj\nh37bDwfz95XG0m/p9Sv9yWN9rw7aJyza0j6pIKTQcf/MaJEjjngJxMYUx4G/6NDy\n/nDI/LtLa75jUHZHLoHTxLkp0Q54ryKy8nZge48e+YCCzKlPL