s.noreply.github.com","name":"Derek Bender"},"message":"Mount widget-filter in two slots, kept in sync via a shared store\n\nAdd a \"single MFE in multiple places\" demo: widget-filter now mounts\ntwice from one manifest entry — a full interactive bar in the toolbar\nand a compact read-only \"Filter Mirror\" in the side slot. The two copies\nstay in sync through a module-scope store (apps/widget-filter/src/store.js),\nnot the bus: the remote is loaded once and mount() is called per slot, so\nthe store singleton is shared. setFilter() notifies every copy internally\nand emits FILTER_CHANGE on the bus exactly once (structural echo guard);\nkpi/trends keep working unchanged.\n\nMigrate the manifest schema extras.slot (string) -> extras.slots (array\nof { slot, variant? }) across validation, the manifest, the shell mount\nloop, and all tests. Reorder manifest keys so the filter''s mini copy\nrenders below trends in the side slot.\n\nReformat every widget version badge to \"<app-name>: <version>\" and update\nthe affected unit/e2e assertions.","tree":{"sha":"fe9e0949ab22c4a4115c188eae9d2591c496c1f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djbender/micro-frontends-demo/git/trees/fe9e0949ab22c4a4115c188eae9d2591c496c1f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djbender/micro-frontends-demo/git/commits/cb0e8d6733cc81a35d08bff274f330d0569f87ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/170351?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djbender","id":170351,"login":"djbender","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDM1MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/