,"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djbender","id":170351,"login":"djbender","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDM1MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djbender/micro-frontends-demo/commits/a45656299a15b3eec991ee18c47a1c9529e5f3f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T18:12:46Z","email":"170351+djbender@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Derek Bender"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T18:12:46Z","email":"170351+djbender@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Derek Bender"},"message":"Fix test warnings, act() correctness, and discovery manifest\n\n- Silence CSS files and Svelte config warnings in test output: exclude\n  CSS from vitest coverage, add svelte.config.js, import act from\n  @testing-library/react in mount contract tests so IS_REACT_ACT_ENVIRONMENT\n  is set without a manual global\n- Fix React act() warnings in Shell.test.jsx by wrapping render() in\n  await act(async () => {}), which flushes the full async boot sequence\n  (fetch → init → setNavRoutes/setStatus → renderRoute → loadRemote)\n  inside a single act boundary\n- Fix infinite re-render loop in Shell.jsx: hoisted DEFAULT_USER outside\n  the component so useEffect([currentUser]) gets a stable reference instead\n  of a new object literal on every render\n- Consolidate discovery manifest: remove discovery/ directory, canonical\n  file lives at apps/shell/public/discovery.local.json; update to the\n  correct AWS Frontend Discovery Service schema that validateManifest expects\n- Remove unused imports flagged by oxlint","tree":{"sha":"04a83d88f6a1ec3dea9d7e717d430a929f1a4a7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djbender/micro-frontends-demo/git/trees/04a83d88f6a1ec3dea9d7e717d430a929f1a4a7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djbender/micro-frontends-demo/git/commits/a45656299a15b3eec991ee18c47a1c9529e5f3f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/170351?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djbender","id":170351,"login":"djbender","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDM1MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/djbender","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/djbender/micro-frontends-demo/commit/a45656299a15b3eec991ee18c47a1c9529e5f3f9","node_id":"C_kwDOSvh62toAKGE0NTY1NjI5OWExNWIzZWVjOTkxZWUxOGM0N2ExYzk1MjllNWYzZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/djbender/micro-frontends-demo/commit/f7901f58895927bd7de5597df7768814a0d0a7cd","sha":"f7901f58895927bd7de5597df7768814a0d0a7cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djbender/micro-frontends-demo/commits/f7901f58895927bd7de5597df7768814a0d0a7cd"}],"sha":"a45656299a15b3e