ayanMukherjee91@users.noreply.github.com","name":"SayanMukherjee91"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T07:15:30Z","email":"125153440+SayanMukherjee91@users.noreply.github.com","name":"SayanMukherjee91"},"message":"Initial commit: SQL RAG assistant\n\nNatural-language-to-SQL pipeline over a public MariaDB database using\nLangChain, OpenAI GPT-4o, and Streamlit.\n\nModules:\n- db_config: database connection settings\n- sql_query: connection + schema extraction\n- sql_retriever: natural language to SQL (GPT-4o)\n- sql_executer: SQL execution with error handling\n- generator_llm: SQL result to natural language answer (GPT-4o)\n- app: Streamlit frontend orchestrating the pipeline\n- smoke_test: end-to-end tests (6 questions)\n\nIncludes README, SKILL.md, and per-module skill docs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87f8ba0a02e7ddd1d915a2cde0b3edfcabe57456","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SayanMukherjee91/RAG_Day4_SQL/git/trees/87f8ba0a02e7ddd1d915a2cde0b3edfcabe57456"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SayanMukherjee91/RAG_Day4_SQL/git/commits/c9ccb479705b591c46977dbc166af6a9f1a1be91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125153440?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SayanMukherjee91/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SayanMukherjee91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SayanMukherjee91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SayanMukherjee91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SayanMukherjee91","id":125153440,"login":"SayanMukherjee91","node_id":"U_kgDOB3WwoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SayanMukherjee91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SayanMukherjee91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saya