x: add order by name desc to products query\n\nwithout an explicit order by, postgres returns rows in non-deterministic\norder. widget a (starting with w) sorts after all product * names\n(starting with p) alphabetically, so it ends up on page 2 under index\nscan order. ordering by name desc puts widget a first on page 1, making\nthe e2e tests that depend on it finding the product in the table reliable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38b5174e6a96723aea18f43bbe584c579d3bdeff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bwolak94/micro-frontend/git/trees/38b5174e6a96723aea18f43bbe584c579d3bdeff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bwolak94/micro-frontend/git/commits/c7d296f2b68fa6815a87d16a6b39cb3677f99f5e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229752121?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwolak-lab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwolak-lab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwolak-lab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwolak-lab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bwolak-lab","id":229752121,"login":"bwolak-lab","node_id":"U_kgDODbG9OQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwolak-lab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwolak-lab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwolak-lab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwolak-lab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwolak-lab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwolak-lab","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bwolak94/micro-frontend/commit/c7d296f2b68fa6815a87d16a6b39cb3677f99f5e","node_id":"C_kwDOSvvoX9oAKGM3ZDI5NmYyYjY4ZmE2ODE1YTg3ZDE2YTZiMzljYjM2Nzdm