:false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/aa998c3ccfc9fc16c4db8755ffa519262247c484","node_id":"C_kwDOSv1t4doAKGFhOTk4YzNjY2ZjOWZjMTZjNGRiODc1NWZmYTUxOTI2MjI0N2M0ODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/363a2def24d5354b14c8e6cf62c24801989ee88a","sha":"363a2def24d5354b14c8e6cf62c24801989ee88a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/363a2def24d5354b14c8e6cf62c24801989ee88a"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/1cc0ed9241db88b66511f9a997b38899444e0ff0","sha":"1cc0ed9241db88b66511f9a997b38899444e0ff0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/1cc0ed9241db88b66511f9a997b38899444e0ff0"}],"sha":"aa998c3ccfc9fc16c4db8755ffa519262247c484","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/aa998c3ccfc9fc16c4db8755ffa519262247c484"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/1cc0ed9241db88b66511f9a997b38899444e0ff0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T18:20:43Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T18:20:43Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"docs(packages): bring nexus-cli reference in sync with 1.0 surface\n\nAdds the four commands shipped in nexus-cli@1.0:\n- bnx init       multi-stack workspace bootstrap\n- bnx generate host       scaffold a host shell\n- bnx generate component  scaffold a defineNexusComponent file\n- bnx dev --env <name>    pick which gateway stack each run targets\n\nAlso adds the catalog summary to bnx publish (entry count + sample),\npoints the page at the new dev-mode walkthrough as the guided tour,\nand refreshes the nexus.config.json example with three environments\n(local + staging + prod) so the multi-stack story is visible.","tree":{"sha":"f5e3db4815583f96e45163094137959514198a4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/trees/f5e3db4815583f96e45163094137959514198a4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/commits/1cc0ed9241db88b66511f9a997b38899444e0ff0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/1cc0ed9241db88b66511f9a997b38899444e0ff0","node_id":"C_kwDOSv1t4doAKDFjYzBlZDkyNDFkYjg4YjY2NTExZjlhOTk3YjM4ODk5NDQ0ZTBmZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/853f9793c02d400e83e36afe47bf502eb2d2265a","sha":"853f9793c02d400e83e36afe47bf502eb2d2265a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/853f9793c02d400e83e36afe47bf502eb2d2265a"}],"sha":"1cc0ed9241db88b66511f9a997b38899444e0ff0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/1cc0ed9241db88b66511f9a997b38899444e0ff0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/853f9793c02d400e83e36afe47bf502eb2d2265a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T18:10:54Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T18:10:54Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"docs(workflows): step-by-step dev-mode with portal screenshots and diagrams\n\nRewrites the local dev guide so a developer joining a Nexus stack can go\nfrom empty directory to a published remote in one read.\n\n* workflows/dev-mode.md - eight-step walkthrough:\n  1. bnx init (multi-stack workspace config)\n  2. bnx generate host (shell app)\n  3. bnx generate remote (micro frontend)\n  4. bnx generate component (per-feature, the only step that repeats)\n  5. bnx dev (the local proxy)\n  6. bnx dev --env (switch gateway stacks)\n  7. bnx publish (register with the registry)\n  8. see it in the portal\n\n  Adds three Mermaid diagrams: high-level flow, a sequence diagram of\n  what bnx dev does on startup, and the traffic-split diagram that\n  shows which paths go to localhost vs the gateway stack. Replaces the\n  old single-Mermaid + bash-output page.\n\n* infrastructure/infra-portal.md - inlines portal screenshots for the\n  Hosts, Gates, Remotes, and Catalog pages (table + detail). The\n  earlier ASCII layout box is replaced by the actual Component Catalog\n  screenshot so a reader sees the real UI density before reading the\n  page-by-page tour.\n\n* intro.md - promotes the new dev-mode walkthrough to the first link\n  in \"Where to next\" and expands the CLI scaffolding card to mention\n  bnx init and --env.\n\nScreenshots live under static/img/dev-flow/. Captured against the\nrunning stack (gateway :8668, portal :8669) at 1440x900 @ 2x DPR.","tree":{"sha":"3afc8f7bc020dd9f3d34622f55ad5448c7f8acf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/trees/3afc8f7bc020dd9f3d34622f55ad5448c7f8acf8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/commits/853f9793c02d400e83e36afe47bf502eb2d2265a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/853f9793c02d400e83e36afe47bf502eb2d2265a","node_id":"C_kwDOSv1t4doAKDg1M2Y5NzkzYzAyZDQwMGU4M2UzNmFmZTQ3YmY1MDJlYjJkMjI2NWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/b11761a740e55f2686d3cf5409e7df0a95086376","sha":"b11761a740e55f2686d3cf5409e7df0a95086376","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/b11761a740e55f2686d3cf5409e7df0a95086376"}],"sha":"853f9793c02d400e83e36afe47bf502eb2d2265a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/853f9793c02d400e83e36afe47bf502eb2d2265a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/206919871?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svp-bimo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svp-bimo/followers