964a3817b06db559aec4a270d9a017423a0d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/b11761a740e55f2686d3cf5409e7df0a95086376","sha":"b11761a740e55f2686d3cf5409e7df0a95086376","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/b11761a740e55f2686d3cf5409e7df0a95086376"}],"sha":"363a2def24d5354b14c8e6cf62c24801989ee88a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/363a2def24d5354b14c8e6cf62c24801989ee88a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/b11761a740e55f2686d3cf5409e7df0a95086376/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T12:50:57Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T12:50:57Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"docs(intro): link the cross-framework guide\n\nAdds two pointers from the front-page to the new BYOF guide — a short\nparagraph in the snippet section and a new Features card next to the\nComponent Catalog one. Keeps the intro page honest about what is\nimplemented today and gives a single landing point for the\ncross-framework story.","tree":{"sha":"8ec95140d26d000d2608f6b51d476b1b4d1ea54b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/trees/8ec95140d26d000d2608f6b51d476b1b4d1ea54b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/commits/b11761a740e55f2686d3cf5409e7df0a95086376","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/b11761a740e55f2686d3cf5409e7df0a95086376","node_id":"C_kwDOSv1t4doAKGIxMTc2MWE3NDBlNTVmMjY4NmQzY2Y1NDA5ZTdkZjBhOTUwODYzNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/4a929dd41d2583a1aa8f8ba2516e6537e9c8f084","sha":"4a929dd41d2583a1aa8f8ba2516e6537e9c8f084","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/4a929dd41d2583a1aa8f8ba2516e6537e9c8f084"}],"sha":"b11761a740e55f2686d3cf5409e7df0a95086376","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/b11761a740e55f2686d3cf5409e7df0a95086376"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/4a929dd41d2583a1aa8f8ba2516e6537e9c8f084/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T12:50:15Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T12:50:15Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"docs(guide): cross-framework BYOF mount(el) pattern\n\nAdds /guides/guide-cross-framework — the missing piece between the\nintro''s promise of \"Angular host loading Vue and React remotes\" and\nthe actual mechanism that makes it work in 2026 across mismatched\nruntimes:\n\n- Why same-runtime sharing breaks the moment you mix Vue and React\n  (the useState dispatcher bug, the Vue reactivity context bug)\n- The one-function contract every Nexus remote ships:\n  `mount(el: HTMLElement): () => void`\n- Per-framework recipes for the remote side (Vue createApp, React\n  createRoot, Angular bootstrapApplication-in-a-host-element)\n- How NexusComponent in each host adapter detects mount() and falls\n  back to the legacy default-export path when not present\n- Multi-component remotes via nexusVite multi-expose plus per-component\n  catalog entries\n- Honest \"when this does not apply\" section: shared application state,\n  and the open Angular-remote-into-non-Angular-host shared-deps issue\n  tracked as B-22\n\nThe intro page picks up two pointers to the new guide — a paragraph\nunder the \"Without Nexus vs. with Nexus\" example and a new Features\ncard next to the Component Catalog card. Keeps the front page honest\nabout what is implemented today vs the roadmap for nexus-build.","tree":{"sha":"0e4c4745990cdb038480b5518a63cdd1763166f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/trees/0e4c4745990cdb038480b5518a63cdd1763166f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/commits/4a929dd41d2583a1aa8f8ba2516e6537e9c8f084","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/4a929dd41d2583a1aa8f8ba2516e6537e9c8f084","node_id":"C_kwDOSv1t4doAKDRhOTI5ZGQ0MWQyNTgzYTFhYThmOGJhMjUxNmU2NTM3ZTljOGYwODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/41dd65bf78bfbb2cbd083295f0e62696e6fdf1c6","sha":"41dd65bf78bfbb2cbd083295f0e62696e6fdf1c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/41dd65bf78bfbb2cbd083295f0e62696e6fdf1c6"}],"sha":"4a929dd41d2583a1aa8f8ba2516e6537e9c8f084","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/4a929dd41d2583a1aa8f8ba2516e6537e9c8f084"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/41dd65bf78bfbb2cbd083295f0e62696e6fdf1c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T11:38:24Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T11:38:24Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"docs: health endpoints, React host, Postgres in install path\n\nThree drifts from what the live platform actually does:\n\n- /getting-started/ports-and-urls had no health-endpoint table. Every\n  service ships /health and the gateway also serves /metrics on the\n  public port; operators wiring readiness probes had nothing to point\n  at. Added a \"Health endpoints\" section + working curl examples and\n  added React to the dev-server port table next to Angular and Vue.\n  (D-2)\n\n- /getting-started/installation listed Angular + Vue host repos and\n  all three remote repos but skipped nexus-host-template-react. A\n  React deployment failed at docker compose up with a missing build\n  context. Added it to the sibling-repo tree. (B-5)\n\n- The install page only showed DATABASE_URL=sqlite:/data/portal.db\n  even though both the registry (sqlx::Any) and the portal (Knex)\n  support Postgres / MySQL / MariaDB out of the box. Added a \"Picking\n  a database\" subsection with copy-pasteable URL examples per driver\n  and a pointer at reference/environment for the full matrix. (G-3)","tree":{"sha":"bdb4baa89e4583a76413343bd9fc8bc61953a802","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/trees/bdb4baa89e4583a76413343bd9fc8bc61953a802"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/commits/41dd65bf78bfbb2cbd083295f0e62696e6fdf1c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/41dd65bf78bfbb2cbd083295f0e62696e6fdf1c6","node_id":"C_kwDOSv1t4doAKDQxZGQ2NWJmNzhiZmJiMmNiZDA4MzI5NWYwZTYyNjk2ZTZmZGYxYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/24db725607728676255784df88b17c06451669e1","sha":"24db725607728676255784df88b17c06451669e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/24db725607728676255784df88b17c06451669e1"}],"sha":"41dd65bf78bfbb2cbd083295f0e62696e6fdf1c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/41dd65bf78bfbb2cbd083295f0e62696e6fdf1c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/206919871?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svp-bimo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svp-bimo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svp-bimo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svp-bimo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/svp-bimo","id":206919871,"login":"svp-bimo","node_id":"U_kgDODFVYvw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svp-bimo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svp-bimo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svp-bimo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svp-bimo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svp-bimo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/svp-bimo","u