rs.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/d1c3964a3817b06db559aec4a270d9a017423a0d","node_id":"C_kwDOSv1t4doAKGQxYzM5NjRhMzgxN2IwNmRiNTU5YWVjNGEyNzBkOWEwMTc0MjNhMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/dc9709770797d538e245082f938dc895d34acd78","sha":"dc9709770797d538e245082f938dc895d34acd78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/dc9709770797d538e245082f938dc895d34acd78"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/24db725607728676255784df88b17c06451669e1","sha":"24db725607728676255784df88b17c06451669e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/24db725607728676255784df88b17c06451669e1"}],"sha":"d1c3964a3817b06db559aec4a270d9a017423a0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/d1c3964a3817b06db559aec4a270d9a017423a0d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/24db725607728676255784df88b17c06451669e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:14:54Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:14:54Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"docs: add business-value and operational workflows; tune SEO and mobile\n\nTwo business-facing additions to the docs site that the CTO\nconversation kept asking for: a productivity / time-to-market page\ngrounded in real repo extracts (97-line angular remote template,\n9479-line rust registry, 3044-line rust gateway, 7 bnx command\ngroups), and a \"What Nexus gives your business\" section in\nwhy-nexus with a sprint-level reclaim table.\n\nTwo operational workflow pages that match new platform features:\ngate-host-swap (PUT a new hostId, hot route-table rebuild) and\nrollback (registry-level config rollback, distinct from kubernetes\ncontainer rollback). Rollback flags the underlying endpoints as\nshipping in 1.0.\n\ninfra-high-availability gains a \"Deployment shapes\" section that\nspells out single-node vs replicated vs multi-region as the three\ndefault shapes the same binaries support - HA is the default, not\na future migration.\n\nSEO: expand DESCRIPTION + KEYWORDS in docusaurus.config with\ncluster, multi-database, productivity, time-to-market, rollback,\ngate-host-swap. Each new and substantially expanded page gets\nfrontmatter keywords that match its actual content.\n\nMobile: custom.css gained two @media blocks. Tables overflow-x\non narrow viewports, custom grids collapse to single column on\nphones, headings scale down, mermaid containers scroll horizontally\nrather than blowing out the layout.\n\nsidebars: productivity slotted into Getting started, gate-host-swap\nand rollback slotted into Workflows in operational order.","tree":{"sha":"0e4e212356b40984e942ab48a6213774ddc2918b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/trees/0e4e212356b40984e942ab48a6213774ddc2918b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/commits/24db725607728676255784df88b17c06451669e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/24db725607728676255784df88b17c06451669e1","node_id":"C_kwDOSv1t4doAKDI0ZGI3MjU2MDc3Mjg2NzYyNTU3ODRkZjg4YjE3YzA2NDUxNjY5ZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/2f4d1dad4c3f41c6ea55c78a6e46f23e529242da","sha":"2f4d1dad4c3f41c6ea55c78a6e46f23e529242da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/2f4d1dad4c3f41c6ea55c78a6e46f23e529242da"}],"sha":"24db725607728676255784df88b17c06451669e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/24db725607728676255784df88b17c06451669e1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/2f4d1dad4c3f41c6ea55c78a6e46f23e529242da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:14:42Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:14:42Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"docs: clarify portal is browser-accessed but not public\n\nThe trust-boundary diagram and the ports-and-urls table framed the\nportal as \"public, lock down at the edge\", which conflated\nbrowser-accessed with public-internet exposed. The portal IS a\nweb UI but operators reach it from inside the trust boundary\n(corporate LAN, VPN, bastion) - its port is not bound to the\npublic internet. Update the diagram to put the trust boundary\nbetween gateway and everything else, including the portal. Update\nthe ports-and-urls table header from \"Visible to browser\" to\n\"Reachable from\" so the row can spell out the boundary correctly.","tree":{"sha":"787a1a83b5cb329448e20de7398f8ec0994181bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/trees/787a1a83b5cb329448e20de7398f8ec0994181bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/commits/2f4d1dad4c3f41c6ea55c78a6e46f23e529242da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.co