 a healthy deployment, only between\nservices on the internal network. Soften the \"on the roadmap\" note\nfor per-identity tokens accordingly.","tree":{"sha":"c2c2495b1653948c3486b0199fcb302ffca0986e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/trees/c2c2495b1653948c3486b0199fcb302ffca0986e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/commits/68bdf9b4230139f815e2fb4f0f429a5baa104c1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/68bdf9b4230139f815e2fb4f0f429a5baa104c1f","node_id":"C_kwDOSv1t4doAKDY4YmRmOWI0MjMwMTM5ZjgxNWUyZmI0ZjBmNDI5YTViYWExMDRjMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/8f9b0e5c47c7a7f2c6ea34191ee41222c106c1e8","sha":"8f9b0e5c47c7a7f2c6ea34191ee41222c106c1e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/8f9b0e5c47c7a7f2c6ea34191ee41222c106c1e8"}],"sha":"68bdf9b4230139f815e2fb4f0f429a5baa104c1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/68bdf9b4230139f815e2fb4f0f429a5baa104c1f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/8f9b0e5c47c7a7f2c6ea34191ee41222c106c1e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T09:07:13Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T09:07:13Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"docs(portal): document multi-database support and npmjs migration\n\nUpdate portal service and infra-portal pages to reflect Knex replacing\nbetter-sqlite3, DATABASE_URL replacing DATABASE_PATH, and the four\nsupported engines (SQLite, Postgres, MySQL, MariaDB).\n\nRemove all BuildKit secret / NODE_AUTH_TOKEN references from docker build\nexamples across quick-starts, guides, and workflow pages — @bimo-dk/*\npackages are now public on npmjs.com.\n\nExpand deployment.md database backup section to cover the portal DB.","tree":{"sha":"97319032