ub.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/be35648d767e62ffdc7a80a29fa8800db554bd46","node_id":"C_kwDOSv1t4doAKGJlMzU2NDhkNzY3ZTYyZmZkYzdhODBhMjlmYTg4MDBkYjU1NGJkNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/55c560e93ae186ede72a17c6972c2803ec68ca2e","sha":"55c560e93ae186ede72a17c6972c2803ec68ca2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/55c560e93ae186ede72a17c6972c2803ec68ca2e"}],"sha":"be35648d767e62ffdc7a80a29fa8800db554bd46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/be35648d767e62ffdc7a80a29fa8800db554bd46"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/55c560e93ae186ede72a17c6972c2803ec68ca2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T09:02:30Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T09:02:30Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"docs(gateway): remove nginx configuration section\n\nThe nginx.conf proxy listing is no longer operator-facing — remote routes\nare generated dynamically and the static /api, /ws, /host routes are an\nimplementation detail. How remote routes work already covers the relevant\nbehaviour.","tree":{"sha":"497d9123929ab4b94a815cfb3e4b9c2db861541c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/trees/497d9123929ab4b94a815cfb3e4b9c2db861541c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/commits/55c560e93ae186ede72a17c6972c2803ec68ca2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/55c560e93ae186ede72a17c6972c2803ec68ca2e","node_id":"C_kwDOSv1t4doAKDU1YzU2MGU5M2FlMTg2ZWRlNzJhMTdjNjk3MmMyODAzZWM2OGNhMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/0c31a3626bd4f0c5ba2a55d708dcc299dbfd2d0e","sha":"0c31a3626bd4f0c5ba2a55d708dcc299dbfd2d0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/0c31a3626bd4f0c5ba2a55d708dcc299dbfd2d0e"}],"sha":"55c560e93ae186ede72a17c6972c2803ec68ca2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/55c560e93ae186ede72a17c6972c2803ec68ca2e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/0c31a3626bd4f0c5ba2a55d708dcc299dbfd2d0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T08:59:10Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T08:59:10Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"docs: fix stale nginx.conf references in example-playground and architecture\n\nexample-playground: replace ''extend gateway image'' step with env-var\nservice definition, update ''How the gateway routes'' to describe dynamic\ndiscovery, drop ''pinned to two remotes by build'' claim\n\narchitecture: correct deployment topology paragraph to say gateway reads\nUPSTREAM_URL from the registry, not the Docker service name","tree":{"sha":"d8d50d8544f0c6aac553276ecff23957f0df31e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/trees/d8d50d8544f0c6aac553276ecff23957f0df31e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/commits/0c31a3626bd4f0c5ba2a55d708dcc299dbfd2d0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/0c31a3626bd4f0c5ba2a55d708dcc299dbfd2d0e","node_id":"C_kwDOSv1t4doAKDBjMzFhMzYyNmJkNGYwYzViYTJhNTVkNzA4ZGNjMjk5ZGJmZDJkMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/e181ac75d255e3739e4f6d8825977ef2095c5a67","sha":"e181ac75d255e3739e4f6d8825977ef2095c5a67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/e181ac75d255e3739e4f6d8825977ef2095c5a67"}],"sha":"0c31a3626bd4f0c5ba2a55d708dcc299dbfd2d0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/0c31a3626bd4f0c5ba2a55d708dcc299dbfd2d0e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/commits/e181ac75d255e3739e4f6d8825977ef2095c5a67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T08:24:07Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T08:24:07Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"docs: update docs to reflect dynamic gateway remote discovery\n\nGateway no longer uses hardcoded nginx proxy blocks. At startup it\ngenerates remotes.conf from the registry and subscribes to remotes_changed\nover WebSocket, reloading nginx on every change.\n\nUpdated files:\n- overview: two new \"not needed\" bullets + gateway discovery flow section\n- architecture: corrected request flow step 5, added discovery explanation,\n  updated Two HTTP layers description, added nginx-reload-fails failure mode\n- gateway: replaced \"Adding a route\" with \"How remote routes work\",\n  removed hardcoded nginx blocks, added REGISTRY_INTERNAL_URL env-var,\n  updated when-to-change table\n- remotes: updated bootstrap configDefaults to Docker-internal URL,\n  added Environment variables section with docker-compose example,\n  added Dockerfile env-var comment block, corrected workflow 3 description\n- proxy: updated \"How it works\" diagram and nexus.dev.json example to\n  reflect auto-discovery, added note about not needing to list other remotes\n- create-remote: replaced :::important nginx.conf warning with :::tip,\n  documented upstreamUrl in \"Via the runtime\" flow, replaced step 7\n  comment with full docker-compose example, updated troubleshooting table\n- installation: replaced step 5 with automatic + manual flows","tree":{"sha":"12e1d0f731b347bf683199f59878cd2b5c75116b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/trees/12e1d0f731b347bf683199f59878cd2b5c75116b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus/git/commits/e181ac75d255e3739e4f6d8825977ef2095c5a67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus/commit/e181