pos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/git/commits/87f8e9f8f308ecd43afbda95ae55f7544d4095fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commit/87f8e9f8f308ecd43afbda95ae55f7544d4095fe","node_id":"C_kwDOSv6iZdoAKDg3ZjhlOWY4ZjMwOGVjZDQzYWZiZGE5NWFlNTVmNzU0NGQ0MDk1ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commit/e6537e2a18fc78bc91eb38c2d026ea65b87a28ad","sha":"e6537e2a18fc78bc91eb38c2d026ea65b87a28ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/e6537e2a18fc78bc91eb38c2d026ea65b87a28ad"}],"sha":"87f8e9f8f308ecd43afbda95ae55f7544d4095fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/87f8e9f8f308ecd43afbda95ae55f7544d4095fe"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/e6537e2a18fc78bc91eb38c2d026ea65b87a28ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T19:58:32Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T19:58:32Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"chore: relicense to AGPL-3.0-or-later + author attribution\n\nSwitches license from MIT to GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or\nany later version. Adds Steffen Vitten Pedersen <svp@bimo.dk> (Bimo) as\nauthor of record. A commercial license is available for organisations\nthat cannot adopt AGPL - contact svp@bimo.dk. See nexus.bimo.dk/about\nand nexus.bimo.dk/commercial-license for the story and dual-licensing\nexplainer.","tree":{"sha":"b27a40167c56c806b672dd9d0aed68cee7399ddb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/git/trees/b27a40167c56c806b672dd9d0aed68cee7399ddb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/git/commits/e6537e2a18fc78bc91eb38c2d026ea65b87a28ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commit/e6537e2a18fc78bc91eb38c2d026ea65b87a28ad","node_id":"C_kwDOSv6iZdoAKGU2NTM3ZTJhMThmYzc4YmM5MWViMzhjMmQwMjZlYTY1Yjg3YTI4YWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commit/8b4aaa55e6b23790a32fd533fa99e6f2a171f95f","sha":"8b4aaa55e6b23790a32fd533fa99e6f2a171f95f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/8b4aaa55e6b23790a32fd533fa99e6f2a171f95f"}],"sha":"e6537e2a18fc78bc91eb38c2d026ea65b87a28ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/e6537e2a18fc78bc91eb38c2d026ea65b87a28ad"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/8b4aaa55e6b23790a32fd533fa99e6f2a171f95f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T19:34:21Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T19:34:21Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"fix(build): nexusViteAuto E2E for Vue/React remotes (B-28)\n\nValidated end-to-end with a clean Vue project + bnx generate component.\nTwo issues blocked the auto-discovery flow as shipped:\n\n1. The plugin pre-seeded rollupOptions.input with `index: ''./index.html''`,\n   which conflicted with Vite''s own SPA index resolution and caused the\n   build to abort with \"Could not resolve entry module index.html\"\n   before any module transform ran. Drop it - Vite handles index.html\n   itself when present.\n\n2. The \"wrapper around nexusVite()\" pattern delegated generateBundle\n   and closeBundle through an internal underlying plugin object. Vite\n   only fires lifecycle hooks on the plugin it registered, so the\n   underlying delegations never ran - the build emitted no\n   remoteEntry.json and no catalog.json. Inline the hooks on the\n   plugin Vite actually sees.\n\nAlso normalize Windows path matching in generateBundle: facadeModuleId\ncomparisons now lowercase + forward-slash both sides and fall back to\nrelative-suffix match so a drive-letter casing difference doesn''t drop\nchunks from the exposes array.\n\nVerified on D:\\tmp\\b28-vue:\n  + dist/remoteEntry.json with both exposed components\n  + dist/catalog.json with full metadata (title, description, category, tags)\n  + Adding a second component via `bnx generate component` rebuilds\n    with both auto-discovered, no vite.config.ts edit.","tree":{"sha":"3e543443f2ed4e8f2f35dfd8714cbf8a0a7938f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/git/trees/3e543443f2ed4e8f2f35dfd8714cbf8a0a7938f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/git/commits/8b4aaa55e6b23790a32fd533fa99e6f2a171f95f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commit/8b4aaa55e6b23790a32fd533fa99e6f2a171f95f","node_id":"C_kwDOSv6iZdoAKDhiNGFhYTU1ZTZiMjM3OTBhMzJmZDUzM2ZhOTllNmYyYTE3MWY5NWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commit/c5194d6537755494a23517699a0a05cdf9ccb0f3","sha":"c5194d6537755494a23517699a0a05cdf9ccb0f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/c5194d6537755494a23517699a0a05cdf9ccb0f3"}],"sha":"8b4aaa55e6b23790a32fd533fa99e6f2a171f95f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/8b4aaa55e6b23790a32fd533fa99e6f2a171f95f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/c5194d6537755494a23517699a0a05cdf9ccb0f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T15:58:35Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T15:58:35Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"feat(build): auto-discovery for Vue/React remotes (B-28)\n\nBrings parity with the Angular @NexusComponent + scanForRemotes()\ndiscovery story to function-component frameworks. Three pieces:\n\n1. `defineNexusComponent(meta, comp)` HOF (new module\n   define-nexus-component.ts, re-exported from the public\n   @bimo-dk/nexus-build entry). Use at the call site:\n\n       export const Cart = defineNexusComponent(\n         { title: ''Cart'', category: ''commerce'', tags: [''cart''] },\n         defineComponent({ ... }),\n       );\n\n   Returns the component unchanged so types and runtime behavior are\n   intact. Stamps the metadata on the component via\n   Symbol.for(''nexus.component'') for runtime introspection.\n\n2. `scanForDefineNexusComponent()` scanner (new module auto-scanner.ts,\n   exported from the Node-only ./scanner entry). Walks src/ with the\n   TypeScript compiler API and finds every export bound to a\n   defineNexusComponent(...) call — handles named exports\n   (`export const X = defineNexusComponent(...)`), default exports\n   (`export default defineNexusComponent(...)`) and Vue SFCs (scrubs\n   <script> blocks before parsing). Returns DiscoveredFunctionComponent\n   records with the metadata extracted straight from the AST literal.\n   Also exports a discoveredToCatalogEntries() helper for the\n   catalog.json shape the portal already consumes.\n\n3. `nexusViteAuto({ name })` plugin (new export on\n   @bimo-dk/nexus-build/vite). Replaces the hand-written\n   exposes/rollupOptions.input/catalog triple in a remote''s\n   vite.config.ts. The plugin scans on first hook invocation, builds\n   the same payload nexusVite() accepts, and delegates every Vite\n   lifecycle hook through to it. After this change a remote''s whole\n   vite.config.ts is:\n\n       import { defineConfig } from ''vite'';\n       import vue from ''@vitejs/plugin-vue'';\n       import { nexusViteAuto } from ''@bimo-dk/nexus-build/vite'';\n       export default defineConfig({\n         plugins: [vue(), nexusViteAuto({ name: ''shop'' })],\n       });\n\n   Developer adds a new annotated component → portal Component Catalog\n   picks it up on next build, no other file touched.\n\nThe existing nexusVite() factory is unchanged so legacy templates and\nprojects that prefer explicit configuration keep working.","tree":{"sha":"ee9370b091a21aeb97d57b99da3d25c5123d91d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/git/trees/ee9370b091a21aeb97d57b99da3d25c5123d91d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/git/commits/c5194d6537755494a23517699a0a05cdf9ccb0f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commit/c5194d6537755494a23517699a0a05cdf9ccb0f3","node_id":"C_kwDOSv6iZdoAKGM1MTk0ZDY1Mzc3NTU0OTRhMjM1MTc2OTlhMGEwNWNkZjljY2IwZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commit/d405180689a21e0ee08e94163f1870dc69083c2d","sha":"d405180689a21e0ee08e94163f1870dc69083c2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/d405180689a21e0ee08e94163f1870dc69083c2d"}],"sha":"c5194d6537755494a23517699a0a05cdf9ccb0f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/c5194d6537755494a23517699a0a05cdf9ccb0f3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/d405180689a21e0ee08e94163f1870dc69083c2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T07:52:35Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T07:52:35Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"feat(runtime): Angular dynamic-nexus supports remote mount(el)\n\nAdds NexusByofWrapperComponent — a tiny standalone Angular component\nthat renders a div and hands it to a remote''s `mount(el)` function on\nngAfterViewInit, then calls the returned teardown on ngOnDestroy.\n\ndynamic-nexus.service.registerRoute now inspects the loaded module:\n- if it exports `mount` we route to a subclass of the BYOF wrapper that\n  feeds mount-fn through. The host''s Angular router happily renders\n  the wrapper component, the wrapper hands the div to the (Vue / React\n  / vanilla) remote, and the remote bootstraps its own framework\n  inside that div.\n- otherwise the existing Angular-component path is used unchanged.\n\nLets an Angular host load a Vue or React remote out of the box without\nthe developer wiring anything special in the host template. Same\npattern the Vue and React templates ship today; this brings parity to\nAngular hosts. (B-27)","tree":{"sha":"c974a3df850156ecf67afb57b7477ddb7a3286b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/git/trees/c974a3df850156ecf67afb57b7477ddb7a3286b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/git/commits/d405180689a21e0ee08e94163f1870dc69083c2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commit/d405180689a21e0ee08e94163f1870dc69083c2d","node_id":"C_kwDOSv6iZdoAKGQ0MDUxODA2ODlhMjFlMGVlMDhlOTQxNjNmMTg3MGRjNjkwODNjMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commit/633c72e7dad23885d9f0b22908eba4a5556f0d25","sha":"633c72e7dad23885d9f0b22908eba4a5556f0d25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/633c72e7dad23885d9f0b22908eba4a5556f0d25"}],"sha":"d405180689a21e0ee08e94163f1870dc69083c2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/d405180689a21e0ee08e94163f1870dc69083c2d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/633c72e7dad23885d9f0b22908eba4a5556f0d25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:14:02Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T22:14:02Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"fix(client): RegistryClient browser-safe (token optional, no /api/api)\n\nTwo regressions surfaced from browser hosts:\n\nThe constructor threw \"RegistryClient: token is required\" on empty\ninput. The trust-boundary model in CLAUDE.md forbids shipping\nNEXUS_TOKEN into the browser, so every Vue/React host built from the\ntemplates failed to bootstrap. The gateway injects the token on the\nserver-to-server hop; clients legitimately have no token. Replaced\nthe throw with a one-time console.warn and store an empty string.\n(token requirement bug)\n\nAUDIT_REPORT SEC-4 added /api to every endpoint URL. That was correct\nfor service-to-service callers using registryUrl=''http://registry:3000'',\nbut every browser host calls registryUrl=''/api'' (because the gateway\nproxies /api/* to the registry). The result was double-prefix URLs\nlike /api/api/remotes returning 404 on every page load.\n\nConstructor now stores apiUrl always with /api (appending if missing)\nand the endpoint helpers drop their own /api prefix. Both browser and\nservice-to-service callers now produce the correct URL. (B-23)","tree":{"sha":"0a578b08704a895c6b40bce69bfd42f317e9146a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/git/trees/0a578b08704a895c6b40bce69bfd42f317e9146a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/git/commits/633c72e7dad23885d9f0b22908eba4a5556f0d25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commit/633c72e7dad23885d9f0b22908eba4a5556f0d25","node_id":"C_kwDOSv6iZdoAKDYzM2M3MmU3ZGFkMjM4ODVkOWYwYjIyOTA4ZWJhNGE1NTU2ZjBkMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commit/8c348a9600c27fa51f4b1742c3355566ecefe108","sha":"8c348a9600c27fa51f4b1742c3355566ecefe108","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/8c348a9600c27fa51f4b1742c3355566ecefe108"}],"sha":"633c72e7dad23885d9f0b22908eba4a5556f0d25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/633c72e7dad23885d9f0b22908eba4a5556f0d25"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/8c348a9600c27fa51f4b1742c3355566ecefe108/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T21:52:54Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T21:52:54Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"fix(build): nexusVite emits exposes as array, not object\n\n@bimo-dk/nexus-runtime and @angular-architects/native-federation both\nexpect the native-federation manifest shape:\n\n  exposes: [{ key: ''./X'', outFileName: ''X-abc.js'' }]\n  shared:  []\n\nThe vite plugin previously emitted:\n\n  exposes: { ''./X'': ''./X-abc.js'' }\n\nwhich tripped the host runtime with \"t.exposes is not iterable\" on\nevery Vue/React remote load. Angular remotes worked because the\nAngular CLI federation plugin emits the array form directly.\n\nUpdated generateBundle to push { key, outFileName } objects and also\nadd the `shared: []` field so the manifest is fully native-federation\ncompatible. This change requires republishing @bimo-dk/nexus-build to\nnpm; until then, consumers may add a postbuild step that rewrites the\nJSON (see nexus-remote-templat-{react,vue}/Dockerfile).","tree":{"sha":"c8b9943b0325bc320b7fe727084dec456d619d6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/git/trees/c8b9943b0325bc320b7fe727084dec456d619d6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/git/commits/8c348a9600c27fa51f4b1742c3355566ecefe108","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commit/8c348a9600c27fa51f4b1742c3355566ecefe108","node_id":"C_kwDOSv6iZdoAKDhjMzQ4YTk2MDBjMjdmYTUxZjRiMTc0MmMzMzU1NTY2ZWNlZmUxMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commit/d444443760d60cfe38b8278044802d5fbf9c14c2","sha":"d444443760d60cfe38b8278044802d5fbf9c14c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/d444443760d60cfe38b8278044802d5fb