repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/667a0dda5c298fc8b50b6c80180c76f5da25743b"}],"sha":"3a00c9bb210fc73925203d98078f389da22d08f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/3a00c9bb210fc73925203d98078f389da22d08f8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/commits/667a0dda5c298fc8b50b6c80180c76f5da25743b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T13:11:16Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T13:11:16Z","email":"svp@socialcard.dk","name":"svp"},"message":"feat: multi-framework runtimes (Angular, Vue, React) + nexusVite\n\n- runtime-core: framework-agnostic federation loader, self-registration,\n  fallback chain, reconnect manager extracted from the Angular runtime\n  so the same engine powers every framework adapter.\n- runtime-vue: Vue 3 adapter — createNexusPlugin, useNexusHost,\n  useNexusRemote, NexusComponent, nexusRoute, VueNexusRemotePlugin.\n- runtime-react: React 18 adapter — NexusProvider, useNexusComponent,\n  useNexusHost, useNexusRemote, NexusComponent, createNexusRoute,\n  registerNexusRemote.\n- build: add nexusVite plugin for Vue/React; expose defineNexusConfig.\n- runtime (Angular): adopt runtime-core under the hood; add\n  useNexusGatewayConfig helper and gateway-config types.\n- cli: restructured into commands/dev/*, commands/hosts.ts, commands/gates.ts.\n- core, client, testing: small extensions for the new entity shapes\n  (Host, Gate) and gateway config payload.\n- README: list all ten packages and their roles.","tree":{"sha":"648ee24beb8ce6127271c391258b92c3cb2e45a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/git/trees/648ee24beb8ce6127271c391258b92c3cb2e45a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bimo-dk/nexus-packages/git/commits/667a0dda5c298fc8b50b6c80180c76f5da25743b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url