:"fix(carousel): don''t scroll the page on auto-rotate; v0.1.2\n\ngo() advanced slides with `slide.scrollIntoView()`, which scrolls every\nancestor scroll container including the document. When the user had scrolled\ndown past the banner, the auto-rotate (and arrows/dots) yanked the viewport\nback up to it. Scroll only the internal `.track` horizontally via\n`track.scrollTo({ left: index * track.clientWidth })`, which never moves the\npage while still snapping to the right slide.\n\nBump @bion-mfe-ui/core to 0.1.2 (published to npm).","tree":{"sha":"c0914ee84a6ed96a3549f821bbf51500932fad2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GDGoC-BiOn/bion-mfe-ui/git/trees/c0914ee84a6ed96a3549f821bbf51500932fad2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GDGoC-BiOn/bion-mfe-ui/git/commits/a815257c76c5415a6261b686e914793c544904a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56493086?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ilham89","id":56493086,"login":"ilham89","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NDkzMDg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GDGoC-BiOn/bion-mfe-ui/commit/a815257c76c5415a6261b686e914793c544904a8","node_id":"C_kwDOSv9TCtoAKGE4MTUyNTdjNzZjNTQxNWE2MjYxYjY4NmU5MTQ3OTNjNTQ0OTA0YTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GDGoC-BiOn/bion-mfe-ui/commit/3c9067021a6ea451132b02ce13e6e0d6d76690b2","sha":"3c9067021a6ea451132b02ce13e6e0d6d76690b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GDGoC-BiOn/bion-mfe-ui/commits/3c9067021a6ea451132b02ce13e6e0d6d76690b2"}],"sha":"a815257c76c5415a6261b686e914793c544904a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GDGoC-BiOn/bion-mfe-ui/commits/a815257c76c5415a6261b686e914793c544904a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56493086?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ilham89","id":56493086,"login":"ilham89","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NDkzMDg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GDGoC-BiOn/bion-mfe-ui/commits/3c9067021a6ea451132b02ce13e6e0d6d76690b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T15:12:24Z","email":"ilhamkukuhprakosa@gmail.com","name":"ilham89"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T15:12:24Z","email":"ilhamkukuhprakosa@gmail.com","name":"ilham89"},"message":"fix(core): resolve empty tokens and duplicate registration; v0.1.1\n\nhostTokens previously redeclared every token on :host as a self-referential\n`--bion-x: var(--bion-x, default)` fallback. Chromium treats that as a cycle\nand resolves it to the guaranteed-invalid (empty) value, wiping all --bion-*\ntokens inside component shadow DOM (transparent backgrounds, dead hover\ntransitions) at every nesting depth. Removed it; tokens now inherit from\n:root for free, which is the correct mechanism.\n\nAlso make customElements.define idempotent so multiple copies of core (e.g.\na React remote and a Vue remote each pulling core in one page) no longer\nthrow `NotSupportedError: \"bion-...\" has already been used`.\n\nBump @bion-mfe-ui/core to 0.1.1 (published to npm).","tree":{"sha":"06d182060908e294d999cb19147ea8a9bdf8ee5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GDGoC-BiOn/bion-mfe-ui/git/trees/06d182060908e294d999cb19147ea8a9bdf8ee5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GDGoC-BiOn/bion-mfe-ui/git/commits/3c9067021a6ea451132b02ce13e6e0d6d76690b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56493086?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ilham89","id":56493086,"login":"ilham89","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NDkzMDg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilham89","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GDGoC-BiOn/bion-mfe-ui/commit/3c9067021a6ea451132b02ce13e6e0d6d76690b2","node_id":"C_kwDOSv9TCtoAKDNj