) and the FAIR bundle checksums it; the workflow commit\nlanded without regenerating them, so the full-tree staleness test failed on\nCI. The drift-gates-after-any-file-add rule applies to workflow files too.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"413e63b74c4ecbd08b138c4c14900546de3a42e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/git/trees/413e63b74c4ecbd08b138c4c14900546de3a42e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/git/commits/30275a5730a8e99a4b700f92a8d0cb357aec6f69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-mif-core/commit/30275a5730a8e99a4b700f92a8d0cb357aec6f69","node_id":"C_kwDOSwL0LtoAKDMwMjc1YTU3MzBhOGU5OWE0YjcwMGY5MmE4ZDBjYjM1N2FlYzZmNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-mif-core/commit/f53cb338338e2947ebbbb0050e1f772d8a2f065d","sha":"f53cb338338e2947ebbbb0050e1f772d8a2f065d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/commits/f53cb338338e2947ebbbb0050e1f772d8a2f065d"}],"sha":"30275a5730a8e99a4b700f92a8d0cb357aec6f69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/commits/30275a5730a8e99a4b700f92a8d0cb357aec6f69"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/commits/f53cb338338e2947ebbbb0050e1f772d8a2f065d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T03:34:10Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T03:34:10Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(studio-web): pin typescript-eslint 8.62.1 and scope the undici override\n\nThe merged Dependabot PR (#62) re-resolved during rebase and landed\ntypescript-eslint 8.63.0 - published 2026-07-06T17:52Z, inside the\nminimumReleaseAge window - so the Studio web job on main failed the\nsupply-chain age gate. Pin the manifest to the vetted, aged 8.62.1 (the\nversion the PR title named) and rebuild the lockfile from a fresh\nresolution; 8.63.0 can arrive through the normal flow once it ages out.\n\nThe fresh resolution exposed a second latent problem: the blanket\n`undici: ''>=7.28.0''` security override replaces jsdom''s own `^7.25.0`\nrange, forcing jsdom onto undici 8.x, and undici 8 removed\nlib/handler/wrap-handler.js which jsdom 29.1.1 requires directly (the old\nincrementally-grown lockfile happened to keep jsdom on 7.28.0, so this\nnever showed). Scope a `jsdom>undici: ''>=7.28.0 <8.0.0''` override so the\njsdom subtree stays on the secured 7.x line; the resolved pair\n(7.28.0 + 8.5.0) matches the previously CI-proven lockfile exactly.\n\nLocal gates: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile, build, 41/41 vitest, eslint\nall green.\n\nVerified: https://registry.npmjs.org/typescript-eslint\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"329992aee36fa598e9a2997fc2120d4d7c3be729","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/git/trees/329992aee36fa598e9a2997fc2120d4d7c3be729"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/git/commits/f53cb338338e2947ebbbb0050e1f772d8a2f065d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"h