ll-rate floor\n\nSOTA-11 remainder. Nightly (03:17 UTC) cargo-mutants 26.0.0 run over the\nRust decision core and probability surfaces (streaming trigger, merge\nwindow, safety certificate, trigger probability, vendored erfc), failing\nwhen the kill-rate over viable mutants drops below 90%. Advisory to merges\n(nothing gates on a nightly), binding as a red-nightly signal; missed\nmutants are printed and the mutants.out workspace is uploaded on failure.\nMeasured baseline 99+% with every survivor a documented value-equivalent\nmutant, so the floor flags real regressions, not noise. Pinned to 26.0.0\n(27.x needs rustc >= 1.88; repo pins 1.85; MSRV 1.78).\n\nVerified: https://crates.io/api/v1/crates/cargo-mutants/26.0.0\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"1512dd87cd34f1cec57dbf3ce6176514a959a86e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/git/trees/1512dd87cd34f1cec57dbf3ce6176514a959a86e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/git/commits/c360615bac6c9a9306dc8fd6c5b9fceb960eb616","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-mif-core/commit/c360615bac6c9a9306dc8fd6c5b9fceb960eb616","node_id":"C_kwDOSwL0LtoAKGMzNjA2MTViYWM2YzlhOTMwNmRjOGZkNmM1YjlmY2ViOTYwZWI2MTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-mif-core/commit/54b95e1e4200e318d88ddbf47928ae0a8de9dc73","sha":"54b95e1e4200e318d88ddbf47928ae0a8de9dc73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/commits/54b95e1e4200e318d88ddbf47928ae0a8de9dc73"}],"sha":"c360615bac6c9a9306dc8fd6c5b9fceb960eb616","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/commits/c360615bac6c9a9306dc8fd6c5b9fceb960eb616"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/commits/54b95e1e4200e318d88ddbf47928ae0a8de9dc73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T03:18:09Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T03:18:19Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"feat(fpga): 77/70 proven formal properties - specification target met\n\nSOTA-14 remainder. The MIF-010 property set now MEASURES past the\ndevelopment-plan P6 target: 77 proven asserts (safety 33/30, liveness\n28/25, timing 16/15) across 11 SymbiYosys tasks, meets_specification_target\nflips TRUE in the formal manifest, all tasks proven locally (11/11 sby\ngreen, Yosys + z3).\n\nNew properties, all against the existing RTL (no device changes):\n- trigger fabric: exact fire instant (final debounce step with the one-shot\n  clear), disarm reload+clear, broken-lock debounce reload, and monotone\n  countdown under sustained lock.\n- fast-veto lane: unarmed lane is dead (no permit, no fire) and a\n  not-ready bank blocks the permit.\n- quantiser: AER address legality (only the two configured event codes can\n  ever be presented), valid falls only through an accept, and the address\n  never moves without a live presentation.\n- CDC synchroniser: the first stage is a pure registered sample of the\n  asynchronous input (no combinational bypass past the first flop).\n- three NEW timing tasks through the vendored NEU-C.2 monitors: zero-cycle\n  veto/disarm response of the fast lane (a registered veto path would\n  violate the bound), <=1-cycle disarm/veto reload of the fabric, and the\n  per-stage advance bound of the CDC synchroniser (end-to-end crossing\n  <= 2 destination cycles).\n\ntiming_evidence_package regenerated (timing_task_count 1 -> 4, pin\nupdated); capability/dashboard/FAIR artifacts regenerated and drift-gated.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"ac44a4da11a90dc84ca2adcf0efc9485637ace68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/git/trees/ac44a4da11a90dc84ca2adcf0efc9485637ace68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/git/commits/54b95e1e4200e318d88ddbf47928ae0a8de9dc73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-mif-core/commit/54b95e1e4200e318d88ddbf47928ae0a8de9dc73","node_id":"C_kwDOSwL0LtoAKDU0Yjk1ZTFlNDIwMGUzMThkODhkZGJmNDc5MjhhZTBhOGRlOWRjNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-mif-core/commit/82c1d401af5aef2482660b14d5a6c62ebfc1df27","sha":"82c1d401af5aef2482660b14d5a6c62ebfc1df27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/commits/82c1d401af5aef2482660b14d5a6c62ebfc1df27"}],"sha":"54b95e1e4200e318d88ddbf47928ae0a8de9dc73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/commits/54b95e1e4200e318d88ddbf47928ae0a8de9dc73"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/commits/82c1d401af5aef2482660b14d5a6c62ebfc1df27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T03:17:53Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T03:18:19Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(kinematic): vendored fdlibm erfc + mutation-hardened propagation\n\nThe bit-exact cross-backend claim for the probabilistic trigger propagation\ndid not hold universally: glibc''s erfc (Python math.erfc) and the\nmusl-derived Rust libm crate differ by one ulp on real inputs, first caught\nat x = 0.5/sqrt(2) by a mutation-hardening fixture. Both backends now call\nthe same vendored fdlibm erfc (kinematic/_erfc.py and\nmif-kinematic/src/erfc.rs, ported operation-for-operation from the libm\ncrate 0.2.16 / FreeBSD msun s_erf.c with the Sun notice preserved); the\nonly transcendental either port calls is exp, which both languages bind to\nthe platform libm, so equal inputs give equal bits by construction. The\nlibm crate dependency is removed again. A parity regression fixture pins\nthe divergence input.\n\ncargo-mutants over the new surfaces:\n- trigger_probability.rs: 17 missed -> 0 (pinned-value tests on a generic\n  asymmetric fixture; the earlier boundary fixtures used z = 0 and were\n  blind to CDF-argument mutations; FIRE+ABORT+HOLD == 1 is a tautology by\n  construction and is documented as non-discriminating).\n- erfc.rs: 60 missed -> 6, all six verified value-equivalent by\n  whole-family scans and documented in the test; kill-rate 321/327 with\n  branch pins at every range cut (scan-chosen boundary-family arguments\n  where neighbouring approximations differ in the last bit) plus one-sided\n  dense-grid checksums shared with the Python port (the symmetric grid\n  telescopes to exactly N and hides sign-symmetric divergence).\n\nThe pure-Python floor pays for reproducibility: re-measured and\nre-promoted honestly (rust 151 us vs python 548 us median on the\n64-sample call; 25.3 ms vs 97.0 ms on 4096; rust-first ranking unchanged,\nnotes record the trade).\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"24b54741dc159a6632457ec08e80f73b42eaa764","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/git/trees/24b54741dc159a6632457ec08e80f73b42eaa764"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-mif-core/git/commits/82c1d401af5aef2482660b14d5a6c62ebfc1df27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url