ser","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanitaravel/Real-Time-Chat/commits/7f9bd13fb4c1baa44253b29c3d141b9aaddab1b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T09:44:43Z","email":"alexander.koshcheev.msk@gmail.com","name":"sanitaravel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T09:44:43Z","email":"alexander.koshcheev.msk@gmail.com","name":"sanitaravel"},"message":"[user-service] Implement deleteAccount mutation with Redis denylist and event\n\nImplements task 6.1 — Requirements 14.1, 14.2, 14.3, 14.4, 14.5.\n\n- Add DeleteAccountInput DTO (password field, class-validator guards)\n- Add deleteAccount mutation to UsersResolver (JwtAuthGuard, derives user\n  from JWT only, no userId argument)\n- Add deleteAccount method to UsersService:\n  - Verifies current password via bcrypt; returns UNAUTHENTICATED on mismatch\n  - Permanently deletes UserEntity from the database\n  - Adds userId to Redis denylist via authService.revokeUser (Req 14.5)\n  - Publishes user:deleted:{userId} event on Redis for Chat_Service (Req 14.4)\n- Fix users.service.spec.ts: add missing REDIS_CLIENT, revokeUser, and remove\n  mocks that caused all 79 existing tests to fail\n- Add 14 unit tests covering Req 14.1–14.5 (correct deletion, wrong password,\n  user-not-found, Redis event channel format, operation order)","tree":{"sha":"1d558ca49333f84d534b9db53b5757433e639af2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanitaravel/Real-Time-Chat/git/trees/1d558ca49333f84d534b9db53b5757433e639af2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanitaravel/Real-Time-Chat/git/commits/7f9bd13fb4c1baa44253b29c3d141b9aaddab1b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58359823?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s