ents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanitaravel/Real-Time-Chat/commits/99a09b601a799232b79625ef18566828266e36b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T09:14:16Z","email":"alexander.koshcheev.msk@gmail.com","name":"sanitaravel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T09:14:16Z","email":"alexander.koshcheev.msk@gmail.com","name":"sanitaravel"},"message":"[user-service] Add changePassword mutation (authenticated)\n\nImplements requirements 13.12-13.18 (Task 5.4).\n\nValidation order (strict, per spec):\n1. New password length (8-72 chars) checked before any DB access (Req 13.15)\n2. User loaded from DB by JWT-derived userId; NOT_FOUND if absent (Req 13.18)\n3. Current password verified via bcrypt.compare; UNAUTHENTICATED if wrong (Req 13.14)\n4. New password checked not equal to current; BAD_USER_INPUT if same (Req 13.13)\n5. New password hashed (bcrypt cost 12) and persisted (Req 13.12)\n\nResolver protected by JwtAuthGuard; userId derived exclusively from JWT\nsubject claim with no userId arg accepted (Req 13.16, 13.17).\n\n19 new unit tests added covering all requirements and validation order.","tree":{"sha":"66daef74e2e38a307f495c1a1c308da6025dec1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanitaravel/Real-Time-Chat/git/trees/66daef74e2e38a307f495c1a1c308da6025dec1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanitaravel/Real-Time-Chat/git/commits/99a09b601a799232b79625ef18566828266e36b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u