/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanitaravel/Real-Time-Chat/commits/4f19a9a9c4a21a9c1aa1a19eea8d54b4b398610d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T08:19:28Z","email":"alexander.koshcheev.msk@gmail.com","name":"sanitaravel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T08:19:28Z","email":"alexander.koshcheev.msk@gmail.com","name":"sanitaravel"},"message":"[user-service] Add PasswordModule, EmailModule, and fix Jest ESM config\n\nImplements task 5.1 — requestPasswordReset mutation with rate limiting\nand email dispatch.\n\n- Add EmailModule: Nodemailer SMTP service with 30-second send timeout;\n  throws SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE if email dispatch fails\n- Add PasswordService: requestPasswordReset(email, ip) with:\n  - IP-based sliding-window rate limit (5 req / 15 min) via Redis\n    sorted set ratelimit:pwreset:{ip}\n  - Case-insensitive email lookup; returns true regardless of whether\n    the email is registered (no user enumeration)\n  - Invalidates all prior unexpired reset tokens for the user\n  - Generates 32-byte cryptographically random token via crypto.randomBytes\n  - Stores bcrypt hash (cost 12) with 1-hour expiry in reset_tokens table\n  - Dispatches reset email via EmailModule; propagates SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE\n    on failure\n- Add PasswordResolver: unauthenticated requestPasswordReset mutation;\n  extracts client IP including X-Forwarded-For header\n- Wire PasswordModule and EmailModule into AppModule\n- Fix Jest config: add moduleNameMapper to stub graphql-upload ESM\n  modules with a CJS-compatible mock (test/mocks/graphql-upload.mock.js)\n- Pin nodemailer and @types/nodemailer to exact versions (no ^ ranges)\n\nAll 159 tests pass.\n\nImplements requirements 13.