s{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sanitaravel","id":58359823,"login":"sanitaravel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MzU5ODIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanitaravel/Real-Time-Chat/commits/af412d8b4d482db85e05af5ec01e65575ea29cba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T16:41:16Z","email":"alexander.koshcheev.msk@gmail.com","name":"sanitaravel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T16:41:16Z","email":"alexander.koshcheev.msk@gmail.com","name":"sanitaravel"},"message":"[chat-service] Add AuthModule with JWT validation and Redis denylist\n\nImplements task 9.1 (requirements 2.5, 14.5).\n\n- Scaffold AuthModule, AuthService, JwtAuthGuard via NestJS CLI\n- JwtStrategy validates HS256 signature using JWT_SECRET; rejects\n  expired and invalid tokens\n- DenylistService checks Redis SET denylist:{userId} on every\n  JWT validation; rejects deleted users with UNAUTHENTICATED\n- JwtAuthGuard maps all Passport failures to UNAUTHENTICATED error code\n- JwtSecretHealthService fails startup if JWT_SECRET is absent or empty\n- RedisProvider injects ioredis client from REDIS_URL config\n- AppModule updated with ConfigModule (Joi validation for JWT_SECRET,\n  DATABASE_URL) and AuthModule import\n- Install @nestjs/jwt, @nestjs/passport, passport, passport-jwt,\n  @types/passport-jwt\n- 19 unit tests including fast-check property tests (100 runs) for\n  denylist enforcement across arbitrary UUIDs","tree":{"sha":"ce38b469af01a47416f7dd8cdb89fa0ba11467e4","url":"ht