com/users/sanitaravel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanitaravel/Real-Time-Chat/commits/7b313e3b7e6b35a2766f2ae2e31b49e0f208aa07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T16:16:37Z","email":"alexander.koshcheev.msk@gmail.com","name":"sanitaravel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T16:16:37Z","email":"alexander.koshcheev.msk@gmail.com","name":"sanitaravel"},"message":"[chat-service] Add TypeORM entities and migration for database layer\n\nImplements task 8.1 (Requirements: 4.1, 5.1, 5.5).\n\nCreates five TypeORM entities:\n- ChatRoomEntity (chat_rooms): nullable owner_id for account deletion\n- RoomMembershipEntity (room_memberships): composite PK (room_id, user_id)\n- InvitationEntity (invitations): invitee_id/inviter_id as plain UUIDs\n- MessageEntity (messages): bigint sequence_number, UNIQUE(room_id, seq)\n- RoomSequenceEntity (room_sequences): per-room counter for atomic seq assignment\n\nMigration generated via TypeORM CLI against a live postgres:17-alpine\ncontainer and verified to apply cleanly. Includes:\n- messages_room_seq_idx composite index\n- UNIQUE(room_id, sequence_number) constraint\n- ON DELETE CASCADE FK constraints for all dependent tables","tree":{"sha":"61b40e5c86ec2e43f5a397d334307ea230b139c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanitaravel/Real-Time-Chat/git/trees/61b40e5c86ec2e43f5a397d334307ea230b139c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanitaravel/Real-Time-Chat/git/commits/7b313e3b7e6b35a2766f2ae2e31b49e0f208aa07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58359823?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/user