_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanitaravel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanitaravel/Real-Time-Chat/commits/edea80df09511a4a78621386589be4e1ce2c3804/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T15:49:50Z","email":"alexander.koshcheev.msk@gmail.com","name":"sanitaravel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T15:49:50Z","email":"alexander.koshcheev.msk@gmail.com","name":"sanitaravel"},"message":"[user-service] Implement register/login mutations and unit tests\n\nImplements tasks 4.1 and 4.2.\n\nTask 4.1: register and login mutations with bcrypt hashing and JWT issuance\n- UsersService: register (duplicate check via LOWER(), bcrypt hash, JWT),\n  login (case-insensitive lookup, bcrypt verify, JWT)\n- UsersResolver: register and login GraphQL mutations\n- DTOs: RegisterInput, LoginInput with class-validator decorators\n- Models: AuthPayload, User GraphQL object types\n- Wired UsersModule into AppModule\n\nTask 4.2: unit tests for registration and login validation\n- 29 tests covering Req 1.1, 1.2, 1.3, 1.5, 2.1, 2.2\n- Duplicate username (ConflictException, LOWER() check)\n- Password boundary values (8 and 72 chars)\n- Invalid credentials (UnauthorizedException, no field enumeration)\n- Bcrypt cost factor >= 12 verified\n- All dependencies mocked — no real DB connections","tree":{"sha":"27d83727b167f2a28149854c1aa8b63e2179f91c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanitaravel/Real-Time-Chat/git/trees/27d83727b167f2a28149854c1aa8b63e2179f91c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanitaravel/Real-Time-Chat/git/commits/edea80df09511a4a78621386589be4e1ce2c3804","verification":{"payload":null,"re