epos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtpio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtpio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtpio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jtpio/jupyterlab-pierre-theme/commits/fac3cb4cae34dd9473ed8efcb5d97e15947c3a36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T05:59:30Z","email":"jeremy.tuloup@gmail.com","name":"Jeremy Tuloup"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T05:59:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix CI (#1)\n\n* Trigger\n\n* Fix labextension packaging so prebuilt assets are discoverable\n\nThe build jobs failed at `jupyter labextension list | grep OK`: after\n`pip install .` the themes were not registered. The wheels shipped the\nprebuilt `labextension/` under purelib only, while shared-data mapped\njust `install.json` into share/jupyter/labextensions, so JupyterLab\nnever found the assets.\n\nThe packages were missing the `__init__.py` exposing\n`_jupyter_labextension_paths()`. Without it Hatchling did not detect the\nPython package and shared-data failed to copy the (gitignored)\n`labextension/` directory into the data dir. Add the module for both\nthemes and drop the redundant [tool.hatch.build.targets.wheel] artifacts\noverride, matching the working jupyterlab-cursor-theme layout.","tree":{"sha":"699c76a10b28a126243f10b25415b670004e3ed5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jtpio/jupyterlab-pierre-theme/git/trees/699c76a10b28a126243f10b25415b670004e3ed5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jtpio/jupyterlab-pierre-theme/git/commits/fac3cb4cae34dd9473ed8efcb5d97e15947c3a36","verification":{"payload":"tree 699c76a10b28a126243f10b25415b670004e3ed5\nparent 0bbe1308a79a953057f561b619656855e658f4bd\nauthor Jeremy Tuloup <jeremy.tuloup@gmail.com> 1780552770 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780552770 +0200\n\nFix CI (#1)\n\n* Trigger\n\n* Fix labextension packaging so prebuilt assets are discoverable\n\nThe build jobs failed at `jupyter labextension list | grep OK`: after\n`pip install .` the themes were not registered. The wheels shipped the\nprebuilt `labextension/` under purelib only, while shared-data mapped\njust `install.json` into share/jupyter/labextensions, so JupyterLab\nnever found the assets.\n\nThe packages were missing the `__init__.py` exposing\n`_jupyter_labextension_paths()`. Without it Hatchling did not detect the\nPython package and shared-data failed to copy the (gitignored)\n`labextension/` directory into the data dir. Add the module for both\nthemes and drop the redundant [tool.hatch.build.targets.wheel] artifacts\noverride, matching the working jupyterlab-cursor-theme layout.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqIRRCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFCcQAH2+V9WDNG1FhoVmBYGsRkyk\nLEdXVq9+/9U00a1m4TQKvgbIIzBI8oTPbn5OAispYC9/T2R/49rhbkBJKi9cH1eP\nJEaAO4xIWpI1OE+ch6lKwIJVj8VUQLbG2wR4CyaV4tMl07D4qAkeH+Wt+LgPVNKa\nVTk+gGPSJsbKa1U6844CO/sVD8XIRJ53gxfoAUbw1LVYUA/jt4eoeqTxqS5WLM7N\nciD1GjtdC5H8q2WEzWkm2L6FyYu/b6c73fioUzrUE5ZDdW1WZeAhlXC39SoR7hl2\nkqGuHeercbcQWkVwAguEzXrNYWLOshVsVbN+U4ooMe/H2Mv9Lrem4ePAy2L2Ka5y\n0sqAac19nAUSp4NwJjpMzkwLIjTre8sn+980M80PZHst+sSNbeBKLpFn74btkAnS\nWYRzNyfwWFNwAiO/QLjEw7Kf3oMMaKVyIPvxc7FcuczOO4XT4bDfCa1uBZGIue4T\nL6A+7o3o8BUCnHME7vGYJEQSqnicC2Sd8TUJZqDpD3lbX+Nag+qy9cz+pYBdgsPa\n47peg2BknihRBaFUMfmg/ERYsYcbxhUCyTSYhapLojbZAoEwTmflYHaum2B9xMjj\niWxJCBjr5DuBUlAM8dQcVAzmtMU0Q2WPuyZZn0SDC4yfARaV51ZV5gVCrLKdt/IR\nFGjnr+3dW+WPDLFDjWGH\n=dAdv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-04T05:59:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.