e): make Irminsul opt-in; nitobot setup asks + states AGPL\n\nPer the chosen licensing path: the knowledge feature is now OFF by default so the standard build\nis MIT-clean. Irminsul is moved from a core dependency to an optional extra ([knowledge]); removed\nfrom requirements.txt; config irminsul.enabled defaults False and ''knowledge'' is no longer a\ndefault module.\n\n- cli.py: ''nitobot setup'' now shows an AGPL-3.0 notice, ASKS whether to enable the knowledge\n  feature, and only then enables it (config) + installs irminsul. Declining keeps NitoBot MIT-only.\n  _enable_knowledge() helper is pure/tested (test_ops O4).\n- README: modules row, Knowledge section and Dependencies & licensing updated to opt-in.\nAll 13 suites green.","tree":{"sha":"391c0acca174dd4886754ede9dc3169fcc4b43b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/trees/391c0acca174dd4886754ede9dc3169fcc4b43b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/commits/7d0d5a3c60cdb5de826e3690c99bd250b35dea13","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ari