26-06-04T22:01:37Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"message":"docs(license): document Irminsul AGPL-3.0 dependency + make knowledge cog optional-safe\n\nThe default knowledge feature depends on Irminsul (AGPL-3.0). README now states clearly that a\nbuild shipped/served WITH Irminsul makes the combined work AGPL-3.0 (unless a commercial Irminsul\nlicense is held), and how to keep an MIT-only build (disable irminsul + drop the knowledge module).\nThe knowledge cog now disables itself gracefully if irminsul isn''t installed, so no AGPL code is\npulled in unless explicitly installed.","tree":{"sha":"7f54d0da97715b8b1b8d04ceeb029bcb8f3afa0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/trees/7f54d0da97715b8b1b8d04ceeb029bcb8f3afa0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/commits/9fae1a451068f8f74091ba9cf7d8172e615b154c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},