): integrate Irminsul + Akasha by default\n\nNitoBot now ships with the Irminsul holographic knowledge engine wired in by default.\n\n- dependency: irminsul @ git+https://github.com/ArisRhiannon/Irminsul (pyproject + requirements).\n- knowledge.py: thread-safe Knowledge wrapper around irminsul.Engine (per-guild scope), all\n  engine access serialized (sqlite connections are shared across threads).\n- cogs/knowledge.py: remembers every non-trivial message per guild and consolidates on a 30-min\n  background loop — both run in a thread executor so they never block Discord''s event loop.\n  Exposes bot.knowledge. Default on via irminsul.enabled.\n- cogs/llm.py: injects an Akasha knowledge card (fetched off-loop) into the prompt alongside the\n  persona + HoloPersona style card + transcript; sized to the model''s free context.\n- config: irminsul defaults + ''knowledge'' added to default modules.\n- tests/test_knowledge.py 3/3 (real Engine: remember->grow->card, immunity, empty/no-raise).\n  All 13 offline suites green. persona.md untouched; knowledge failures never break a reply.","tree":{"sha":"ed51cac93daec850d3e1ae59b0e8552974c629a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/trees/ed51cac93daec850d3e1ae59b0e8552974c629a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/commits/e75cb0b88e98c11001654dcffb3c20664d5599f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_