event_vec per event (auto-migrates old DBs); event_vectors()\n  + consolidate() now reports HDC consistency in each snapshot.\n- respond.py: trace mode — the SAME LLM call returns {reply, holo_trace} (no extra classifier);\n  reply is surfaced, the hardened trace feeds bounded learning. Opt-in via holopersona.trace.\n- cogs/llm.py: branches to trace mode when enabled and records the trace as weak (0.25) evidence.\n- tests: H12 (HDC binding/recovery/consistency), test_trace_mode TR1/TR2 (mock server). 12 suites green.\n\nHonest scope: only session + per-user relationship layers learn; server/global layers, follow-up\noutcome shaping, and HDC-clustering-driven promotion remain future.","tree":{"sha":"090104883d839851c4a02049e9385a958e68ecca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/trees/090104883d839851c4a02049e9385a958e68ecca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/commits/97183a0bc768e0c280fa03bf9259ffe70452deb7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commit/97183a0bc768e0c280fa03bf9259ffe70452deb7","node_id":"C_kwDOSwbdLNoAKDk3MTgzYTBiYzc2OGUwYzI4MGZhMDNiZjkyNTlmZmU3MDQ1MmRlYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commit/5fa549f0d583cec22ff467b4b410a18ab269de82","sha":"5fa549f0d583cec22ff467b4b410a18ab269de82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/5fa549f0d583cec22ff467b4b410a18ab269de82"}],"sha":"97183a0bc768e0c280fa03bf9259ffe70452deb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/97183a0bc768e0c280fa03bf9259ffe70452deb7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/5fa549f0d583cec22ff467b4b410a18ab269de82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T04:31:32Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T04:31:32Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"message":"feat(holopersona): F3 — enforce drift cap + periodic consolidation with snapshots\n\n- Drift cap is now ENFORCED, not just reported: relationship_means clamps every learned trait\n  to within ±cap (0.35) of the core before it influences a reply, so no trait can run away from\n  who Nito is. drift still reports the raw belief delta vs core.\n- consolidate(): periodic pass that promotes stable, well-evidenced (capped) shifts into a\n  holo_snapshots row and returns an auditable report {user: [(trait, capped_delta)]}.\n- ledger: save_snapshot / snapshot_count / latest_snapshot.\n- cli: ''nitobot persona consolidate''; status now shows snapshots + cap.\n- tests: H10 (cap enforced on influence, not just reported), H11 (consolidation promotes\n  stable shifts + writes a snapshot). 11/11 holopersona; all 11 suites green.","tree":{"sha":"26e6d056b95a83157ac18cf1303dd92bf496a239","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/trees/26e6d056b95a83157ac18cf1303dd92bf496a239"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/commits/5fa549f0d583cec22ff467b4b410a18ab269de82","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commit/5fa549f0d583cec22ff467b4b410a18ab269de82","node_id":"C_kwDOSwbdLNoAKDVmYTU0OWYwZDU4M2NlYzIyZmY0NjdiNGI0MTBhMThhYjI2OWRlODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commit/6f0bedbabb68f59bae9ecdf324aa0285208b0ee2","sha":"6f0bedbabb68f59bae9ecdf324aa0285208b0ee2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/6f0bedbabb68f59bae9ecdf324aa0285208b0ee2"}],"sha":"5fa549f0d583cec22ff467b4b410a18ab269de82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/5fa549f0d583cec22ff467b4b410a18ab269de82"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/6f0bedbabb68f59bae9ecdf324aa0285208b0ee2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T04:23:53Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T04:23:53Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"message":"feat(holopersona): wire into the live LLM cog (bounded) + make style card learning-sensitive\n\n- cogs/llm.py: the per-user style card is injected into the prompt and every turn is recorded\n  as bounded evidence (deterministic signals). Opt-in via holopersona.enabled (default on with\n  the LLM). persona.md is never touched; any HoloPersona error is swallowed so it can''t break a\n  reply. Learning is from deterministic text signals only for now (the cog uses tool-calling, so\n  the holo_trace JSON path stays unwired).\n- card.render: fixed a short-circuit where Nito''s core depth>=0.6 made the brevity branch\n  unreachable — learned preferences (e.g. ''sé breve'') now actually change the injected card.\n  Each trait renders independently.\n- config: holopersona.enabled flag (default True).\n- tests: H9 asserts learning visibly changes the style card (9/9). All 11 suites green.","tree":{"sha":"e2175f64c6aececcb943513a8e61b0abc21a33a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/trees/e2175f64c6aececcb943513a8e61b0abc21a33a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/commits/6f0bedbabb68f59bae9ecdf324aa0285208b0ee2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commit/6f0bedbabb68f59bae9ecdf324aa0285208b0ee2","node_id":"C_kwDOSwbdLNoAKDZmMGJlZGJhYmI2OGY1OWJhZTllY2RmMzI0YWEwMjg1MjA4YjBlZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commit/a195e640910b1b5364e53cfaf5d39af4ed38f07b","sha":"a195e640910b1b5364e53cfaf5d39af4ed38f07b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/a195e640910b1b5364e53cfaf5d39af4ed38f07b"}],"sha":"6f0bedbabb68f59bae9ecdf324aa0285208b0ee2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/6f0bedbabb68f59bae9ecdf324aa0285208b0ee2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/a195e640910b1b5364e53cfaf5d39af4ed38f07b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T04:18:29Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T04:18:29Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"message":"feat(holopersona): bounded, replayable adaptive personality layer (F0-F2 + immunity)\n\nImplements the HoloPersona v3 plan as a discord-free, tested package. Stable at the core,\nadaptive at the edges; persona.md is never rewritten.\n\n- bounds.py: 12-trait style genome + identity bounds; project() clamps every learned style\n  into character (emoji<=0.10, ornamentation/playfulness/directness ranges, warmth floor).\n- immunity.py: deterministic refusal to learn prompt injection, abuse, secrets or persona\n  hijacking (learned with weight 0).\n- signals.py: cheap LLM-free text signals (es+en) with evidence weights — trusted (0.70) vs\n  the LLM''s self-reported holo_trace (0.25). Silence is neutral, never punishment.\n- trace.py: parse_response + validate_trace — clamps all ranges, drops unknown traits,\n  immunity-scrubs memory candidates; bad JSON never blocks the visible reply.\n- genome.py: TraitBelief + update_trait with evidence-decaying learning rate (1/sqrt), seeded\n  at the core prior so learning moves away from core, not toward 0.5.\n- mood.py: SessionMood, ~0.85 decay per 10 min, RAM-only.\n- card.py: active style card (blend core+relationship+mood, project to bounds, render).\n- ledger.py: sqlite holo_events; current_persona = replay(events), deterministic + auditable.\n- controller.py: HoloPersona facade (record/style_for/explain/drift/freeze/reset/export).\n- cli.py: ''nitobot persona status|explain|drift|freeze|unfreeze|reset|export|replay''.\n- tests/test_holopersona.py 8/8 (trace, personality, immunity, drift/bounds/freeze).\n\nShadow mode: not yet wired into the live LLM cog. Next: F3 consolidation + drift-cap\nenforcement, F4 full HDC event-vector binding, live style-card injection. All 11 suites green.","tree":{"sha":"1dee5e19aa98176d398459e75d4b20967a5c3289","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/trees/1dee5e19aa98176d398459e75d4b20967a5c3289"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/commits/a195e640910b1b5364e53cfaf5d39af4ed38f07b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commit/a195e640910b1b5364e53cfaf5d39af4ed38f07b","node_id":"C_kwDOSwbdLNoAKGExOTVlNjQwOTEwYjFiNTM2NGU1M2NmYWY1ZDM5YWY0ZWQzOGYwN2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commit/6c67bcff4a8c0d2627fc1a65e5373157209299a6","sha":"6c67bcff4a8c0d2627fc1a65e5373157209299a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhi