annon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/e534ab0276de45ad7e19f2276c2238c369f14c84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T03:45:42Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T03:45:42Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"message":"fix(packaging): include llm, social_store, activity_store in py-modules\n\nA non-editable install (pipx/pip from git) omitted these three top-level modules, so\n''nitobot run'' from outside the repo failed to import them (the cogs depend on all three).\nRoot-cause fix: declare them in [tool.setuptools] py-modules. Verified with a real\nnon-editable install — llm.py / social_store.py / activity_store.py now land in\nsite-packages and ''nitobot'' runs. (This is the proper fix; a sys.path workaround isn''t\nneeded and doesn''t help a true non-editable install.)","tree":{"sha":"e1144b54e4c80f62585827367989a8980f009ae6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/trees/e1144b54e4c80f62585827367989a8980f009ae6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/commits/e534ab0276de45ad7e19f2276c2238