following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/26f9c8e2e8e738ed72c29d2835abf699e86b2b33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T03:37:47Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T03:37:47Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"message":"feat(cli): installable ''nitobot'' CLI with self-update + 300-msg chat context\n\n- pyproject.toml + cli.py: pip/pipx-installable, exposes a ''nitobot'' command\n  (run | update | setup | version). Verified the entry point installs and runs.\n- ''nitobot update'': git fast-forward that NEVER touches user settings — persona.md\n  (the soul), data/ (config, wallet key, memory) and .env are gitignored; persona is\n  split into a tracked persona.default.md template + a user-owned persona.md created\n  once. Refuses to clobber local/diverged tracked changes.\n- Channel context: the agent now reads up to history_limit (default 300) recent\n  messages — INCLUDING bots and Nito herself — as a compact transcript (context.py),\n  so she follows the whole conversation. config/paths anchored to the repo root.\n- tests/test_ops.py 3/3 (real-git update preserves user files; non-git refusal;\n  transcript budgeting/bot-tagging). All 10 offline suites green.","tree":{"sha":"c4a551d12f0f3018f75414c93c05e64402d71cf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/trees/c4a551d12f0f3018f75414c93c05e64402d71cf3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/commits/26f9c8e2e8e738ed72c29d2835abf699e86b2b33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commit/26f9c8e2e8e738ed72c29d2835abf699e86b2b33","node_id":"C_kwDOSwbdLNoAKDI2ZjljOGUyZThlNzM4ZWQ3MmMyOWQyODM1YWJmNjk5ZTg2YjJiMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commit/0ae459a7a0d785fcd608e1aa809999424d31aa31","sha":"0ae459a7a0d785fcd608e1aa809999424d31aa31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/0ae459a7a0d785fcd608e1aa809999424d31aa31"}],"sha":"26f9c8e2e8e738ed72c29d2835abf699e86b2b33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/26f9c8e2e8e738ed72c29d2835abf699e86b2b33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/0ae459a7a0d785fcd608e1aa809999424d31aa31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T23:46:20Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T23:46:20Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"message":"feat(agent): OpenAI-compatible tool-calling for conversation + guarded admin\n\n- agent.py: tool schemas (get_balance/leaderboard/recall_memory + admin\n  timeout_member/purge_messages/set_slowmode), a guarded async dispatcher, and a\n  tool-calling loop (model -> tool_calls -> execute -> feed back -> reply, max 4 steps).\n  Admin tools are gated on is_admin in dispatch AND by Discord permission/role-hierarchy\n  guards in the cog handlers — the model proposes, the code authorizes; no privilege escalation.\n- llm.py: chat_full() with tools/tool_choice (kept chat()); shared _post().\n- cogs/llm.py: now agentic — builds a ToolContext from the interaction (admin = any mod\n  perm), wires real economy/memory/moderation handlers; Nito only claims actions a tool confirmed.\n- tests/test_agent.py 3/3 (schemas, admin guardrails, full loop via mock OpenAI server).\n- README: documents the agentic OpenAI-compatible function calling + all features.\nAll 9 offline suites green.","tree":{"sha":"62cb51b824dae2124f9d1ba1fcdf401b745e1c22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/trees/62cb51b824dae2124f9d1ba1fcdf401b745e1c22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/commits/0ae459a7a0d785fcd608e1aa809999424d31aa31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commit/0ae459a7a0d785fcd608e1aa809999424d31aa31","node_id":"C_kwDOSwbdLNoAKDBhZTQ1OWE3YTBkNzg1ZmNkNjA4ZTFhYTgwOTk5OTQyNGQzMWFhMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commit/a5a773893fc8960621a90c65b0a6752528a4ac26","sha":"a5a773893fc8960621a90c65b0a6752528a4ac26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/a5a773893fc8960621a90c65b0a6752528a4ac26"}],"sha":"0ae459a7a0d785fcd608e1aa809999424d31aa31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/0ae459a7a0d785fcd608e1aa809999424d31aa31"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/a5a773893fc8960621a90c65b0a6752528a4ac26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T23:25:36Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T23:25:36Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"message":"perf(memory): vectorized recall (10k+) + native C reference; correct speed claims\n\n- Vectorized recall: vectors kept as a packed (N, DIM/8) uint8 matrix; Hamming to all\n  memories via a popcount LUT in one numpy op. ~55 ms over 10k memories.\n- native/holo.c: self-contained C reference (bundled SHA-256 + HDC encoder) that\n  produces BYTE-IDENTICAL hypervectors to memory.py — proving the encoding is a portable,\n  numpy-free, microcontroller-capable cross-language spec. tests/test_native.py compiles\n  it and verifies conformance (skips if no compiler).\n- HONESTY FIX: my earlier ''sub-microsecond in native uint64'' was wrong. Measured: native\n  C reference ≈2.3 ms, Python/numpy ≈2.6 ms for a 70-char message at DIM=8192 — cost is\n  O(len*DIM), not sub-µs. Corrected memory.py, README, and HOLO_SPEC.md to the real\n  numbers; the native build''s value is portability, not raw speed. Also fixed HOLO_SPEC\n  symbol expansion (the u32 counter is in every block, incl. ctr=0) to match the reference.\nSuites 8/8 incl. native conformance.","tree":{"sha":"b6db3d96cf633663819c280292bb6c946fc8f749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/trees/b6db3d96cf633663819c280292bb6c946fc8f749"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/commits/a5a773893fc8960621a90c65b0a6752528a4ac26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commit/a5a773893fc8960621a90c65b0a6752528a4ac26","node_id":"C_kwDOSwbdLNoAKGE1YTc3Mzg5M2ZjODk2MDYyMWE5MGM2NWIwYTY3NTI1MjhhNGFjMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commit/39b1b8092f4baaa7c0670eab3c82045bc178f10f","sha":"39b1b8092f4baaa7c0670eab3c82045bc178f10f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/39b1b8092f4baaa7c0670eab3c82045bc178f10f"}],"sha":"a5a773893fc8960621a90c65b0a6752528a4ac26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/a5a773893fc8960621a90c65b0a6752528a4ac26"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/39b1b8092f4baaa7c0670eab3c82045bc178f10f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T22:55:58Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T22:56:30Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"message":"feat(memory): real holographic memory via hyperdimensional computing (HDC/VSA)\n\nReplaces the keyword placeholder with a genuine holographic associative memory:\n- Text -> one 8192-bit hypervector via byte-trigram bind (XOR + circular shift) and\n  majority bundle; recall by Hamming distance. Information is distributed across all\n  dimensions (holographic, robust to noise).\n- Language- and script-agnostic (byte n-grams over any UTF-8), robust to typos and\n  morphology (similarity, not exact match) — proven in tests.\n- Bitwise, no model/GPU; numpy backend measured at ~2.6 ms/encode and ~8 ms to scan\n  1000 memories (was 459 ms in the naive pure-Python pass — corrected, not claimed).\n  Algorithm ports to native uint64 / microcontrollers at sub-microsecond cost.\n- Fixed cross-language encoding spec (HOLO_SPEC.md) + conformance fixture so any port\n  produces identical, interoperable vectors. Same remember/recall API (drop-in).\n- tests/test_holo.py 6/6 (determinism, typo/morphology, multilingual, recall, cost,\n  conformance). numpy added to requirements.","tree":{"sha":"de963f2c80012c831808a91c6781b7e3a7203f7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/trees/de963f2c80012c831808a91c6781b7e3a7203f7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/commits/39b1b8092f4baaa7c0670eab3c82045bc178f10f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}",