thub.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commits/915a7bb7c990786645649ea3cc5ad8ad9deca3ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T22:21:38Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T22:21:38Z","email":"arisrhiannon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arisrhiannon"},"message":"feat(admin,voice): moderation with best practices + voice bridge\n\n- cogs/admin.py: /kick /ban /timeout /purge /slowmode. Every action passes a\n  permission + role-hierarchy guard (no self, never the owner, actor AND bot must\n  outrank the target), a per-moderator token-bucket rate limit (anti-saturation),\n  bulk caps (purge <= 100), audit reasons; ephemeral replies. Enabled by default.\n- modutil.py: discord-free RateLimiter + can_moderate guard (unit-tested).\n- cogs/voice.py + voice_core.py: /join /leave out of the box (PyNaCl, optional);\n  speech->command via an EXTERNAL STT service calling handle_transcript() — capture\n  is intentionally not bundled. Wake-word-gated parser is unit-tested. Opt-in.\n- tests/test_admin_voice.py 3/3 (rate limiter, moderation guard, voice parser).\nAll six offline suites green: economy 5, gossip 4, social 3, automod 2, llm 3, admin/voice 3.","tree":{"sha":"f607fe3ac00c160582201deb7b79e75171c69a55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/trees/f607fe3ac00c160582201deb7