ssage count + distinct active days — goodfaith''s\n  core trust signal, fed from NitoBot''s own activity (harder to farm than raw count).\n- requirements add goodfaith (optional, via git); config gains automod.mode.\n- tests/test_automod.py: activity store + grounded goodfaith behavior (acts on raids,\n  never touches an established regular). Skips cleanly if goodfaith isn''t installed.\nAll offline suites green: economy 5/5, gossip 4/4, social 3/3, automod 2/2.","tree":{"sha":"e26748a4e946ac5402252c000deb71f8f2705d7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/trees/e26748a4e946ac5402252c000deb71f8f2705d7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/git/commits/e41efec94cb634ba77582086ffa155de34e9a5c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220097246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon","id":220097246,"login":"ArisRhiannon","node_id":"U_kgDODR5q3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArisRhiannon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArisRhiannon/NitoBot/commit/e41efec94cb634ba77582086ffa155de34e9a5c5","node_id":"C_kwDOSwbdLNoAKGU0MWVmZWM5NGNiNjM0YmE3NzU4MjA4Nm