"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/dc8e4f445e825d3eb1ceabf0e4d6aefae637a043/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T02:38:27Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T02:38:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Revert \"ci: dedupe push+pull_request runs for the same commit\" (#41)\n\nCancelling the redundant run left a dangling cancelled status under\nthe same required-check context name as the surviving run''s success\n— GitHub''s branch protection blocked merge on the cancelled one\neven though the other run of the same name passed. The dedup-time\nsavings aren''t worth a merge block on every PR; revisit with a\nproper skip-if-PR-exists check instead of cancel-in-progress.","tree":{"sha":"6a8a44e506516264c0da4062a20692cfe7e64e18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/6a8a44e506516264c0da4062a20692cfe7e64e18"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/dc8e4f445e825d3eb1ceabf0e4d6aefae637a043","verification":{"payload":"tree 6a8a44e506516264c0da4062a20692cfe7e64e18\nparent c18d2f40a06a5f7d811fa904d1b28089b701d9c1\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783737507 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783737507 +0000\n\nRevert \"ci: dedupe push+pull_request runs for the same commit\" (#41)\n\nCancelling the redundant run left a dangling cancelled status under\nthe same required-check context name as the surviving run''s success\n— GitHub''s branch protection blocked merge on the cancelled one\neven though the other run of the same name passed. The dedup-time\nsavings aren''t worth a merge block on every PR; revisit with a\nproper skip-if-PR-exists check instead of cancel-in-progress.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUayjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOb0QAEEPWjiw4u65wy3LtThE9b4T\nLYu56dnBQX4ejr/NT3xQJxGZKYih5F++NnBNY4CejkBgPIFJ+KCoUWrBAcyoRgXr\nmW/KMSP2mUAXIJOqzfoMSB4fsx9VVDXzzZ7bawrBtSmie+gAjqBiZBRoToDhZwYt\nf/6WiCOpW/YQnDDn1UEJUhaMa5llegHHOWiaBSN3ea9Arg9FZbO3J0Pj+wb+R1dX\nJ/BnTFGVMgBb9HRbAA93ibRbwznmnljLu+R0y6oISC9iYeK4SF6nf/BmMNd8InkH\nR/GwJ/zXyLvfzP99uvCoOdohpI0WsEoIMV4VEpejcl8kBGSio+KUt0IJ/SEB6DPz\ngCMopIkaSD4K/bX3++EXleArqtsK1d95IDbqOWi/Ijmfp4weMoGahAe9i5V3GYAF\nkPUhuLwpL40yVZU1Srr6B+3KDvFx+rKJ3jrYE2S2u3dwAFoygIfV6Rbzqb0PoLHf\nXtNA695nkUSX6qyRkA/du2u5SiUHQq/Mm5ZwBUmRvg5dFezCwsqDBYK9aBYjpzna\n3WgHgQcIN/UmrSNhkPxmaQ2fUhnCJw4LgUICzMzA7ziLFZNTLSazIh4q11XWDR86\ncgX7hu75az+X9Nk+L8IJ8sC+Nzf6kCUoP/xDYadU+vwEPQ1iqaQaylkLaTL9/QoX\n864yRKobj1kHD46Hp9ll\n=jaZZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-11T02:38:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/dc8e4f445e825d3eb1ceabf0e4d6aefae637a043","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKGRjOGU0ZjQ0NWU4MjVkM2ViMWNlYWJm