n-progress: false queues instead of killing a deploy\nmid-flight.","tree":{"sha":"8ae0898459d081c14bbf9d20ccaaff1ffc37d89a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/8ae0898459d081c14bbf9d20ccaaff1ffc37d89a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/c18d2f40a06a5f7d811fa904d1b28089b701d9c1","verification":{"payload":"tree 8ae0898459d081c14bbf9d20ccaaff1ffc37d89a\nparent cd74e71b6711d9bef9e6e8554f98cd44512b3066\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783736885 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783736885 -0300\n\nci: queue overlapping deploy runs instead of racing (#40)\n\nmain.yml runs pulumi up + pushes images; two overlapping runs (fast\nsuccessive merges, or workflow_dispatch overlapping a push-triggered\nrun) could race on Pulumi state or a half-pushed image.\ncancel-in-progress: false queues instead of killing a deploy\nmid-flight.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUao1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATHgQAEVJQmO0IG6X0iIyO8yniqXG\npsaGvJ+aMV3fYUZEuhfmswzNOGsl/xjQBHZLS7y69J5XXSPDKcezLB4d8rhsr81j\nD/hnopDn9IwFg/+EPwoccNjrccQdmSAj61gwwDj5joNVZq1tR5DXctkDXenwBlCc\nuxk+/uvZ89qt4un/OArEP6tsr7QNtvR8TNSf8prtu6JaC/6EyX6whxn9A1T3SlVQ\nC6TLiqGPiZmrZbFmBVMI1PHhlHb9B+FUArudhbWCyNyS3Okm/Dgo067tOY+Tw/dx\nGMUMKqgPzt1fQgejt9M4DI/4SAhtnPxG9oJmtHBZypilDSlk1ya3R3BMCW0UfPZl\nwBLHHy/1fkZjNBYvUPAqBI6ik9yDVSsB8FIIIuL4ScF1gmGO5R6kZiW6X0ZkFTY7\nqzrwNYQejEpLk/u4LOycSL3qJ8hbiA73sNbmJ2t60jEmoAMF5Sv5r3Nfo8BN2DN/\nG9O8IjhwAPT4HIDbBovTNbzBMirBF5/tB1mmWLvWTNKrCSCLyipxUQEBVPMZmYZ/\nUbmEdkGUlnmWz4JTEv1Qo7GkHZM5YRQnUj+yDmjGhjlYlTZ6StGVRtH7qlFU25iw\nDu+gL08Ex06Tq2JAI8Fwfw6in4cDv8jaRa7ZFCKLdGcbNbpsI93AjbRPFVVmmGfo\nx/CKEiZwb1vgXL6kqM1M\n=s6A9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-11T02:28:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"