ommits/cd74e71b6711d9bef9e6e8554f98cd44512b3066"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/92a7de018a57021f08c523e6e46b1eeda02b640d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T01:05:22Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T01:05:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(wanderlust): catalog batch + Valkey cache, flag flip (#38)\n\n* build(wanderlust-catalog): add Valkey deps + cache config\n\nspring-boot-starter-data-redis + testcontainers-junit-jupiter.\nCatalogProperties.Weather gains cacheTtl/cacheCoordPrecision.\n\n* feat(wanderlust-catalog): Valkey-backed weather cache\n\nWeatherCache wraps a RedisTemplate<String,Weather> for bulk get/put,\nkeyed by coordinate rounded to cache-coord-precision. A Valkey\noutage degrades to a no-op rather than failing the request.\n\n* feat(wanderlust-catalog): batched Open-Meteo client\n\nfetchBatch(List<Coord>) — one request for many coordinates via\ncomma-joined lat/lon. Delegates a single-coordinate batch to\nfetchOne, since Open-Meteo returns a bare object (not a 1-element\narray) for exactly one coordinate — confirmed against the live API.\n\n* feat(wanderlust-catalog): batch aggregation behind catalog.aggregation.batched\n\nWeatherService.weatherForAll does one bulk lookup instead of a\nper-destination fan-out; the flag picks naive (N Open-Meteo calls)\nvs batched (cache multi-get + one call for the misses).\nDestinationService now calls it once for the whole list.\n\n* fix(wanderlust-catalog): remove duplicated flags.json, force HTTP/1.1\n\nBundled fallback copy in src/main/resources meant keeping two\nflags.json files in sync by hand — dropped it; an unreachable flags\nURL now fails startup loudly instead (single source of truth stays\napps/homepage/public/flags.json). Also forces HttpClient.Version\n.HTTP_1_1 on the flags fetch: the default HTTP/2-upgrade-attempt\nbehavior over plaintext hung indefinitely against a local Vite dev\nserver (curl succeeded instantly against the same URL) on both JVM\nand native.\n\n* test(wanderlust-catalog): Valkey integration test for batch + cache\n\nReal Valkey via Testcontainers, a local HTTP stub standing in for\nOpen-Meteo (deterministic call counts). Proves: naive = N calls,\nbatched-cold = 1 call, batched-warm = 0 calls, and the\nsingle-cache-miss case exercises Open-Meteo''s bare-object (not\narray) response shape for exactly one coordinate.\n\n* docs: wanderlust-catalog flag-toggle workflow + HTTP/1.1 footgun\n\nHow to point CATALOG_FLAGS_FLAGSURL at a local homepage instance to\nexercise a flag value without touching the deployed file, and the\nVite-dev-server HTTP/1.1 hang this hit while writing this doc.","tree":{"sha":"8c9c3fd9a955c2a48cfa4e02303bbeb562b49cdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/8c9c3fd9a955c2a48cfa4e02303bbeb562b49cdc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/92a7de018a57021f08c523e6e46b1eeda02b640d","verification":{"payload":"tree 8c9c3fd9a955c2a48cfa4e02303bbeb562b49cdc\nparent ee8b20d1bbd52ef810d9afe7d2816510e8de19f5\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783731922 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783731922 +0000\n\nfeat(wanderlust): catalog batch + Valkey cache, flag flip (#38)\n\n* build(wanderlust-catalog): add Valkey deps + cache config\n\nspring-boot-starter-data-redis + testcontainers-junit-jupiter.\nCatalogProperties.Weather gains cacheTtl/cacheCoordPrecision.\n\n* feat(wanderlust-catalog): Valkey-backed weather cache\n\nWeatherCache wraps a RedisTemplate<String,Weather> for bulk get/put,\nkeyed by coordinate rounded to cache-coord-precision. A Valkey\noutage degrades to a no-op rather than failing the request.\n\n* feat(wanderlust-catalog): batched Open-Meteo client\n\nfetchBatch(List<Coord>) — one request for many coordinates via\ncomma-joined lat/lon. Delegates a single-coordinate batch to\nfetchOne, since Open-Meteo returns a bare object (not a 1-element\narray) for exactly one coordinate — confirmed against the live API.\n\n* feat(wanderlust-catalog): batch aggregation behind catalog.aggregation.batched\n\nWeatherService.weatherForAll does one bulk lookup instead of a\nper-destination fan-out; the flag picks naive (N Open-Meteo calls)\nvs batched (cache multi-get + one call for the misses).\nDestinationService now calls it once for the whole list.\n\n* fix(wanderlust-catalog): remove duplicated flags.json, force HTTP/1.1\n\nBundled fallback copy in src/main/resources meant keeping two\nflags.json files in sync by hand — dropped it; an unreachable flags\nURL now fails startup loudly instead (single source of truth stays\napps/homepage/public/flags.json). Also forces HttpClient.Version\n.HTTP_1_1 on the flags fetch: the default HTTP/2-upgrade-attempt\nbehavior over plaintext hung indefinitely against a local Vite dev\nserver (curl succeeded instantly against the same URL) on both JVM\nand native.\n\n* test(wanderlust-catalog): Valkey integration test for batch + cache\n\nReal Valkey via Testcontainers, a local HTTP stub standing in for\nOpen-Meteo (deterministic call counts). Proves: naive = N calls,\nbatched-cold = 1 call, batched-warm = 0 calls, and the\nsingle-cache-miss case exercises Open-Meteo''s bare-object (not\narray) response shape for exactly one coordinate.\n\n* docs: wanderlust-catalog flag-toggle workflow + HTTP/1.1 footgun\n\nHow to point CATALOG_FLAGS_FLAGSURL at a local homepage instance to\nexercise a flag value without touching the deployed file, and the\nVite-dev-server HTTP/1.1 hang this hit while writing this doc.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUZbSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARUoQAAy87kGfDkSeDlduMSsEl5rR\ns/p4sut66mbZbO2WRfx1h7sO+CAYNNqIM4JNBacKOgCLxIY6i3U4jPhXvclirqOU\nK0hoU+v9PUyQeBj46d7Yso8ja80OWAyD+eCdjORxlRDiTpgjRvqqdDNy4/0q2NYH\nLeNHSmb4Lqw3ek/awfthaWVSwwNEsJ9hqXGv7ApLZxO4Mmk4x7BcmpkOL38dPhtD\nz625M5JjWT7nnb8kEPbiWj2qDlkAqUm5sVTGmXCh5jJTQ8e4Hze/oXUpCn7rWwm6\nG0tXfQbEJI2ajpzO9f6kaH5YofjpXC3REbreKBIqPRs8ZXeq3ErgYc/a3xkEUHU4\nXuhjASTI8Wi58sGAjFpqIA3TRFEGSmE/MTxRm7iPzufoaEwJ70ooRurY4mULHWnG\nOTPAPClLCjw0EPuZ/X5DNfnwUYNMUPk4b6LXatdQbQ/4j7PtcEknciWXC/3LTs0B\nmlUZPUAiHzo2bbzgMk+b4uJZw7ZibzHXhtAuLfW4OmVkgbb4lXcyXT3q9HhApZ8n\n0vCZMzYTO4dZ07DlhgWaR690bhbWXkTKMr3YlpJ8gGXu0ufCaEQmttqzxF2JsLZ6\nFvX9H8OGTFv6pDf2ar1bxZCGebkfHJlsSsbXB+6K87oVt/zTIAKm5xuddNM4j6VB\n+Mvt6y87AkjM3Bm2QRnY\n=XA1S\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-11T01:05:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5