"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/ee8b20d1bbd52ef810d9afe7d2816510e8de19f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T23:05:42Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T23:05:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: native-build/docker-build smoke test for tag:lang:java (#37)\n\n* ci: native-build/docker-build smoke test for tag:lang:java\n\nnative-build was never exercised in CI for any Java app — only\nmain.yml''s deploy-relay job compiles natively, gated to relay-service,\nonly post-merge. Two real GraalVM-native-only bugs slipped through\nundetected this way in wanderlust-catalog. Adds a parallel native-smoke\njob: docker-build (Paketo, no new JDK setup needed) + boot/health check\nfor every affected tag:lang:java project, pushed to ghcr.io on success.\n\n* docs(wanderlust-catalog): fix inaccurate javadoc on CatalogProperties.weather\n\nRecord only holds outbound HTTP client config, not aggregation\nstrategy — ''client settings'' is accurate, ''aggregation settings'' isn''t.","tree":{"sha":"0085612daf7fdc7483262c7c413f04a53b13429c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/0085612daf7fdc7483262c7c413f04a53b13429c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/ee8b20d1bbd52ef810d9afe7d2816510e8de19f5","verification":{"payload":"tree 0085612daf7fdc7483262c7c413f04a53b13429c\nparent aa19274d2ce7e2096086c038bf286fe58e4ab3f6\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783724742 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783724742 +0000\n\nci: native-build/docker-build smoke test for tag:lang:java (#37)\n\n* ci: native-build/docker-build smoke test for tag:lang:java\n\nnative-build was never exercised in CI for any Java app — only\nmain.yml''s deploy-relay job compiles natively, gated to relay-service,\nonly post-merge. Two real GraalVM-native-only bugs slipped 