s://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/045a9ea9e4717be21a7c15bc1ff92decaff4f630/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T23:25:41Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T23:25:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(wanderlust): destination weather — contract + frontend (#35)\n\n* feat(wanderlust-contracts): add weather + coords to Destination\n\nlatitude/longitude/weather optional so degradation can omit them\nwithout breaking the contract.\n\n* feat(wanderlust-web): render weather on destination cards\n\nSwap MSW seed to a South-American set (Fernando de Noronha, Machu\nPicchu, Tierra del Fuego) and render each destination''s weather.","tree":{"sha":"94fccda7de5ea74bbd08a2bf91bf0144f3919dcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/94fccda7de5ea74bbd08a2bf91bf0144f3919dcb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/045a9ea9e4717be21a7c15bc1ff92decaff4f630","verification":{"payload":"tree 94fccda7de5ea74bbd08a2bf91bf0144f3919dcb\nparent b9a286580c257a8c792294b6caaac0c26d7dd645\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783639541 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783639541 +0000\n\nfeat(wanderlust): destination weather — contract + frontend (#35)\n\n* feat(wanderlust-contracts): add weather + coords to Destination\n\nlatitude/longitude/weather optional so degradation can omit them\nwithout breaking the contract.\n\n* feat(wanderlust-web): render weather on destination cards\n\nSwap MSW seed to a South-American set (Fernando de Noronha, Machu\nPicchu, Tierra del Fuego) and render each destination''s weather.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUC31CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtVMQAJN/NYCSM0NcXAQFrZa0/VYX\naWQM142fr5A//Vkmm/Zh3vE8Cjzw7x2iPCkdzdc2PZjGlv4LpoTTWv