and CLI flags. Other pulumi/actions inputs (refresh,\nexpect-no-changes, comment-on-pr) are deploy-semantics or verbosity\ntrade-offs, not logging/caching/speed wins — left alone.","tree":{"sha":"5424723c1037b282f92d2c102bc28dc82a26ea59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/5424723c1037b282f92d2c102bc28dc82a26ea59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/b9a286580c257a8c792294b6caaac0c26d7dd645","verification":{"payload":"tree 5424723c1037b282f92d2c102bc28dc82a26ea59\nparent adbdafe1b935437dc6f48015d99f1e9848b70fe8\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783615784 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783615784 -0300\n\nchore(ci): leaner logs + safe maven cache on main\n\nmain.yml had two setup-java steps (verify, deploy-relay) with no maven\ncache — ci.yml already caches it, so every push to main was\nre-downloading the full ~/.m2 tree twice. Add it to both; read-mostly\nand safe.\n\nAlso suppress Pulumi stack outputs from logs and skip its update-check\nnetwork call on all three deploy jobs, per the documented pulumi/actions\ninput and CLI flags. Other pulumi/actions inputs (refresh,\nexpect-no-changes, comment-on-pr) are deploy-semantics or verbosity\ntrade-offs, not logging/caching/speed wins — left alone.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBJKuGgUc0XphJFKdjL+NxrexWJ2H8YptB6tK2HjD/O747h4JkuGVBa+4CG6VXh/eR\nsmeGY59cj3dxmY565n6gg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-09T16:50:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/b9a286580c257a8c792294b6caaac0c26d7dd645","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKGI5YTI4NjU4MGMyNTdhOGM3OTIyOTRiNmNhYWFjMGMyNmQ3ZGQ2NDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/adbdafe1b935437dc6f48015d99f1e9848b70fe8","sha":"adbdafe1b935437dc6f48015d99f1e9848b70fe8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/adbdafe1b935437dc6f48015d99f1e9848b70fe8"}],"sha":"b9a286580c257a8c792294b6caaac0c26d7dd645","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/b9a286580c257a8c792294b6caaac0c26d7dd645"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/adbdafe1b935437dc6f48015d99f1e9848b70fe8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:41:47Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:41:47Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"fix(e2e): gate auto-retry on explicit flag, never on main\n\nretries() keyed off process.env.CI, which GitHub Actions sets in every\nworkflow including main.yml — so main.yml was silently auto-retrying\ne2e failures. Retry is a flake-detection tool, not a way to paper over\na real regression on main.\n\nGate it on E2E_FLAKE_RETRY instead, set only by ci.yml and\nsynthetic-monitor.yml. Both also now flag (not silently swallow) a\nretried-then-passed run via ::warning:: + a step summary. main.yml sets\nneither: a red main.yml must mean something real.","tree":{"sha":"357cdafd6038af3a37897ad539b1e22a06a4a012","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/357cdafd6038af3a37897ad539b1e22a06a4a012"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/adbdafe1b935437dc6f48015d99f1e9848b70fe8","verification":{"payload":"tree 357cdafd6038af3a37897ad539b1e22a06a4a012\nparent abb40adbfa371bdd04633e38d373463f8ffd1252\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783615307 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783615307 -0300\n\nfix(e2e): gate auto-retry on explicit flag, never on main\n\nretries() keyed off process.env.CI, which GitHub Actions sets in every\nworkflow including main.yml — so main.yml was silently auto-retrying\ne2e failures. Retry is a flake-detection tool, not a way to paper over\na real regression on main.\n\nGate it on E2E_FLAKE_RETRY instead, set only by ci.yml and\nsynthetic-monitor.yml. Both also now flag (not silently swallow) a\nretried-then-passed run via ::warning:: + a step summary. main.yml sets\nneither: a red main.yml must mean something real.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQM8/tTwNjUXb6rKpKyfshe/BweXDPdxW6tAHAgPC5hXlNSQ5ef0olhF3g1eaIioyc8\nqpjbJZWFL9TGivj9THuwk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-09T16:50:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/adbdafe1b935437dc6f48015d99f1e9848b70fe8","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKGFkYmRhZmUxYjkzNTQzN2RjNmY0ODAxNWQ5OWYxZTk4NDhiNzBmZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/abb40adbfa371bdd04633e38d373463f8ffd1252","sha":"abb40adbfa371bdd04633e38d373463f8ffd1252","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/abb40adbfa371bdd04633e38d373463f8ffd1252"}],"sha":"adbdafe1b935437dc6f48015d99f1e9848b70fe8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/adbdafe1b935437dc6f48015d99f1e9848b70fe8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/abb40adbfa371bdd04633e38d373463f8ffd1252/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:03:29Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:03:29Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"fix(ci): serialize Java test after build to end target/ race\n\nrelay-service and the 5 wanderlust-* Java services shared no ordering\nbetween their test and build Nx targets, both mutating the same Maven\ntarget/ dir. build''s `mvn clean` could delete target/ mid-test, causing\nintermittent NoSuchFileException / @SpringBootConfiguration-not-found\nfailures that rotated across services depending on scheduling luck.\n\nAdd test.dependsOn=[build] per project so Nx never runs them\nconcurrently. Also add -B (batch mode) to all mvnw invocations and -q\nto build (packaging output only, -DskipTests) for quieter CI logs, and\npin nx.json parallel to 3 to match the actual GitHub-hosted runner\n(4 vCPU/16GB on this public repo).","tree":{"sha":"334e11cb829e76c0ec09c42c35b4f293babf9b3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/334e11cb829e76c0ec09c42c35b4f293babf9b3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/abb40adbfa371bdd04633e38d373463f8ffd1252","verification":{"payload":"tree 334e11cb829e76c0ec09c42c35b4f293babf9b3b\nparent 29769c4f33811335328d9258cc06f694bd1240e5\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783613009 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783613009 -0300\n\nfix(ci): serialize Java test after build to end target/ race\n\nrelay-service and the 5 wanderlust-* Java services shared no ordering\nbetween their test and build Nx targets, both mutating the same Maven\ntarget/ dir. build''s `mvn clean` could delete target/ mid-test, causing\nintermittent NoSuchFileException / @SpringBootConfiguration-not-found\nfailures that rotated across services depending on scheduling luck.\n\nAdd test.dependsOn=[build] per project so Nx never runs them\nconcurrently. Also add -B (batch mode) to all mvnw invocations and -q\nto build (packaging output only, -DskipTests) for quieter CI logs, and\npin nx.json parallel to 3 to match the actual GitHub-hosted runner\n(4 vCPU/16GB on this public repo).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNRRiiJTfgPtWxTf6JcH80LF5X0iAZNHzbXm+SbTL9C6hXaMx5eSgFcf1qPQxcTel1\nXiudu2lJN1qMosIQQQTQM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-09T16:03:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","foll