ollowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/1c600cfb5cd95d52f80387e24b59a95fba6faf10/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T21:20:12Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T21:20:12Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"fix(e2e): give CI runs retries too, not just prod\n\nThe verify job''s dev-server-backed e2e runs are more flake-prone than\nprod (Next dev compiles routes on demand under concurrent workers on a\nshared runner) yet had zero retries — only isProd() granted them. Gate\nretries/traceMode on CI as well, matching Playwright''s own convention.","tree":{"sha":"e7ff41238c10e34c9111b9c0560490ed8cbce03f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/e7ff41238c10e34c9111b9c0560490ed8cbce03f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/1c600cfb5cd95d52f80387e24b59a95fba6faf10","verification":{"payload":"tree e7ff41238c10e34c9111b9c0560490ed8cbce03f\nparent c079a4bee1f8d62e7ae823e008521aa3e5f2dc06\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783459212 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783459212 -0300\n\nfix(e2e): give CI runs retries too, not just prod\n\nThe verify job''s dev-server-backed e2e runs are more flake-prone than\nprod (Next dev compiles routes on demand under concurrent workers on a\nshared runner) yet had zero retries — only isProd() granted them. Gate\nretries/traceMode on CI as well, matching Playwright''s own convention.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIj0zFyiu0fdZjovGg0kTTxZwkuQqkmx1aGkvUg15ebF4LBNX6FL/ui+if9WED+oDR\n0VVGO78QyX2415YxipWQw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-07T21:20:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/1c600cfb5cd95d52f80387e24b59a95fba6faf10","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKDFjNjAwY2ZiNWNkOTVkNTJmODAzODdlMjRiNTlhOTVmYmE2ZmFmMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/c079a4bee1f8d62e7ae823e008521aa3e5f2dc06","sha":"c079a4bee1f8d62e7ae823e008521aa3e5f2dc06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/c079a4bee1f8d62e7ae823e008521aa3e5f2dc06"}],"sha":"1c600cfb5cd95d52f80387e24b59a95fba6faf10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/1c600cfb5cd95d52f80387e24b59a95fba6faf10"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/c079a4bee1f8d62e7ae823e008521aa3e5f2dc06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T20:45:48Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T20:45:48Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"fix(e2e): harden synthetic monitor against flags.json re-render race\n\nContact submit test raced main.js''s async flags.json re-render, which\ntears down the form mid-interaction — root cause of intermittent\nnightly-monitor failures. Demote the stubbed variant to @dev-only, wait\nfor flags.json before interacting, add prod retries + retain-on-failure\ntraces, and drop hardcoded blog slug coupling.","tree":{"sha":"781aacaf650547a4a67c28f44c19b01071c430bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/781aacaf650547a4a67c28f44c19b01071c430bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/c079a4bee1f8d62e7ae823e008521aa3e5f2dc06","verification":{"payload":"tree 781aacaf650547a4a67c28f44c19b01071c430bf\nparent 0f94d9de91b8f6337998ba4dea6e998b0aaa81fd\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783457148 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783457148 -0300\n\nfix(e2e): harden synthetic monitor against flags.json re-render race\n\nContact submit test raced main.js''s async flags.json re-render, which\ntears down the form mid-interaction — root cause of intermittent\nnightly-monitor failures. Demote the stubbed variant to @dev-only, wait\nfor flags.json before interacting, add prod retries + retain-on-failure\ntraces, and drop hardcoded blog slug coupling.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQImPU5WB5ZNj2zMh+/OxfL6KoVXiK86buT5W4wdwJS25HhBgUMOWK1eaEiO8bnPE3q\nuDP1/v5qxyeSacqotvxAc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-07T20:46:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/c079a4bee1f8d62e7ae823e008521aa3e5f2dc06","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKGMwNzlhNGJlZTFmOGQ2MmU3YWU4MjNlMDA4NTIxYWEzZTVmMmRjMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/0f94d9de91b8f6337998ba4dea6e998b0aaa81fd","sha":"0f94d9de91b8f6337998ba4dea6e998b0aaa81fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/0f94d9de91b8f6337998ba4dea6e998b0aaa81fd"}],"sha":"c079a4bee1f8d62e7ae823e008521aa3e5f2dc06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/c079a4bee1f8d62e7ae823e008521aa3e5f2dc06"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/0f94d9de91b8f6337998ba4dea6e998b0aaa81fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T19:00:46Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T19:00:46Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"docs(observability): rewrite setup guide for Grafana Cloud rollout\n\nOld doc only covered the retired CloudWatch RUM setup. Replaces it with\nthe full Grafana Cloud stack: Faro (frontend), OTel (contact-api +\nrelay-service), the /o11y proxy, datasources-as-code, sampling knobs,\nand the GraalVM native + Spring AOT conditional-bean footgun anyone\ntouching relay-service''s OTel config needs to know about.","tree":{"sha":"42b6a7f8a561815fc26e8d9082c208d8236d7b89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/42b6a7f8a561815fc26e8d9082c208d8236d7b89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/0f94d9de91b8f6337998ba4dea6e998b0aaa81fd","verification":{"payload":"tree 42b6a7f8a561815fc26e8d9082c208d8236d7b89\nparent 36511bca440a884c812f41d636f3169067830849\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783450846 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783450846 -0300\n\ndocs(observability): rewrite setup guide for Grafana Cloud rollout\n\nOld doc only covered the retired CloudWatch RUM setup. Replaces it with\nthe full Grafana Cloud stack: Faro (frontend), OTel (contact-api +\nrelay-service), the /o11y proxy, datasources-as-code, sampling knobs,\nand the GraalVM native + Spring AOT conditional-bean footgun anyone\ntouching relay-service''s OTel config needs to know about.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGJF9mHMArSB8+y/Sa1/y1uWScz5aXPXJeVXG19zHbLaV0D0SmCmY9lNPeXfB2meNK\nukhsdCJzceLrpYit5IvAc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-07T20:46:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/0f94d9de91b8f6337998ba4dea6e998b0aaa81fd","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKDBmOTRkOWRlOTFiOGY2MzM3OTk4YmE0ZGVhNmU5OThiMGFhYTgxZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/36511bca440a884c812f41d636f3169067830849","sha":"36511bca440a884c812f41d636f3169067830849","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/36511bca440a884c812f41d636f3169067830849"}],"sha":"0f94d9de91b8f6337998ba4dea6e998b0aaa81fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/0f94d9de91b8f6337998ba4dea6e998b0aaa81fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/36511bca440a884c812f41d636f3169067830849/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T18:19:33Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T18:19:33Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"fix(relay-service): wire real OTLP endpoint for metrics, not just traces\n\nmanagement.otlp.metrics.export.url defaulted to localhost:4318 in prod —\nnever set — so OtlpMeterRegistry has been failing to publish every minute\nsince iteration 7. Unlike the trace exporter, this bean isn''t excluded from\nthe native image by AOT (matchIfMissing=true, config presence never gated\nbean registration); it just needed the same Cloud Run env wiring tracing\nalready has, reusing the same Grafana OTLP gateway and auth token.","tree":{"sha":"92f1297ef6ff1d0cb36af1c750bc54f158b38d11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/92f1297ef6ff1d0cb36af1c750bc54f158b38d11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/36511bca440a884c812f41d636f3169067830849","verification":{"payload":"tree 92f1297ef6ff1d0cb36af1c750bc54f158b38d11\nparent a08cb7e8cb44c05531d77b43c7ec3d1924eb78c2\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783448373 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783448373 -0300\n\nfix(relay-service): wire real OTLP endpoint for metrics, not just traces\n\nmanagement.otlp.metrics.export.url defaulted to localhost:4318 in prod —\nnever set — so OtlpMeterRegistry has been failing to publish every minute\nsince iteration 7. Unlike the trace exporter, this bean isn''t excluded from\nthe native image by AOT (matchIfMissing=true, config presence never gated\nbean registration); it just needed the same Cloud Run env wiring tracing\nalready has, reusing the same Grafana OTLP gateway and auth token.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJPx5rr2W35BcC7cnQ+1stdZhD8TfXz5sVKvgeoBLoeonaEYKcbf6LShFMm7UjN7PF\n8c12wx9QnxLlqVgsHZhQA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-07T18:19:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/36511bca440a884c812f41d636f3169067830849","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKDM2NTExYmNhNDQwYTg4NGM4MTJmNDFkNjM2ZjMxNjkwNjc4MzA4NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/a08cb7e8cb44c05531d77b43c7ec3d1924eb78c2","sha":"a08cb7e8cb44c05531d77b43c7ec3d1924eb78c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/a08cb7e8cb44c05531d77b43c7ec3d1924eb78c2"}],"sha":"36511bca440a884c812f41d636f3169067830849","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/36511bca440a884c812f41d636f3169067830849"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/a08cb7e8cb44c05531d77b43c7ec3d1924eb78c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T17:45:41Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T17:45:41Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"fix(relay-service): bypass Spring''s OTLP span processor, broken under native\n\nRoot cause: OpenTelemetryTracingAutoConfiguration.otelSpanProcessor\nwraps the OTLP exporter behind @ConditionalOnProperty (endpoint) and\n@ConditionalOnBean (connection details) chains. Spring''s AOT engine\nevaluates those at native-image *build* time, and our endpoint is only\never set via a Cloud Run runtime env var, never present in\napplication.yaml during CI build — so the condition was always false\nat AOT time and the real exporter bean was silently excluded from\nevery native image, permanently, regardless of what env vars Cloud Run\nsets at runtime. Confirmed by inspecting the AOT-generated\n__BeanDefinitions source directly: no entry existed for it.\n\nDirectOtlpTracingConfig registers the same BatchSpanProcessor bean\ntype so Spring''s own backs off, but builds it unconditionally and does\nthe endpoint-presence check as a plain runtime `if` instead of a\nconditional annotation — sidesteps the AOT-baking issue entirely.\nVerified with a throwaway webhook.site endpoint: zero requests ever\narrived under native before this fix, real protobuf payloads arrive\nimmediately after.\n\nGates the SpanProcessor-lifecycle diagnostics that found this (added\nacross several earlier commits) behind relay.diagnostics.otel-enabled,\nchecked live via Environment rather than @ConditionalOnProperty — for\nthe same AOT-baking reason, an annotation-gated diagnostic flag would\nnever be flippable at runtime without a redeploy.","tree":{"sha":"7c95431b9044615bc997074c9becafc3b4952328","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/7c95431b9044615bc997074c9becafc3b4952328"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/a08cb7e8cb44c05531d77b43c7ec3d1924eb78c2","verification":{"payload":"tree 7c95431b9044615bc997074c9becafc3b4952328\nparent 8d4729b62ab12b55f9344c751b25a2596c6a03b0\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783446341 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783446341 -0300\n\nfix(relay-service): bypass Spring''s OTLP span processor, broken under native\n\nRoot cause: OpenTelemetryTracingAutoConfiguration.otelSpanProcessor\nwraps the OTLP exporter behind @ConditionalOnProperty (endpoint) and\n@ConditionalOnBean (connection details) chains. Spring''s AOT engine\nevaluates those at native-image *build* time, and our endpoint is only\never set via a Cloud Run runtime env var, never present in\napplication.yaml during CI build — so the condition was always false\nat AOT time and the real exporter bean was silently excluded from\nevery native image, permanently, regardless of what env vars Cloud Run\nsets at runtime. Confirmed by inspecting the AOT-generated\n__BeanDefinitions source directly: no entry existed for it.\n\nDirectOtlpTracingConfig registers the same BatchSpanProcessor bean\ntype so Spring''s own backs off, but builds it unconditionally and does\nthe endpoint-presence check as a plain runtime `if` instead of a\nconditional annotation — sidesteps the AOT-baking issue entirely.\nVerified with a throwaway webhook.site endpoint: zero requests ever\narrived under native before this fix, real protobuf payloads arrive\nimmediately after.\n\nGates the SpanProcessor-lifecycle diagnostics that found this (added\nacross several earlier commits) behind relay.diagnostics.otel-enabled,\nchecked live via Environment rather than @ConditionalOnProperty — for\nthe same AOT-baking reason, an annotation-gated diagnostic flag would\nnever be flippable at runtime without a redeploy.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGtdhE80LxYEWSXa83FpGwZla2Bg6B94U3+Jr1k25bRkga/1/5ATb3orDXLvWdCmuj\ne4IXrRrW0ICxawkXOolwM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-07T17:45:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/a08cb7e8cb44c05531d77b43c7ec3d1924eb78c2","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKGEwOGNiN2U4Y2I0NGMwNTUzMWQ3N2I0M2M3ZWMzZDE5MjRlYjc4YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/8d4729b62ab12b55f9344c751b25a2596c6a03b0","sha":"8d4729b62ab12b55f9344c751b25a2596c6a03b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/8d4729b62ab12b55f9344c751b25a2596c6a03b0"}],"sha":"a08cb7e8cb44c05531d77b43c7ec3d1924eb78c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/a08cb7e8cb44c05531d77b43c7ec3d1924eb78c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/8d4729b62ab12b55f9344c751b25a2596c6a03b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T16:11:51Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T16:11:51Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"debug(relay-service): add independent SpanProcessor lifecycle diagnostics\n\nRegisters a second SpanProcessor (via the documented\nSdkTracerProviderBuilderCustomizer hook, purely additive — doesn''t touch\nthe real auto-configured exporter) with a logging-only SpanExporter.\nLogs onStart/onEnd/export/forceFlush for every span directly via SLF4J,\nproving whether real span data reaches the pipeline at all, decoupled\nfrom whether the real export to Grafana succeeds. Verified locally on\nboth JVM and native: full correct lifecycle with real trace IDs.","tree":{"sha":"7ee3af349fb50e0f3ccb62a1b422ae1b188a1fa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/7ee3af349fb50e0f3ccb62a1b422ae1b188a1fa1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/8d4729b62ab12b55f9344c751b25a2596c6a03b0","verification":{"payload":"tree 7ee3af349fb50e0f3ccb62a1b422ae1b188a1fa1\nparent a3728f134baa6e1185fc86e2eba16c3642dd9a4c\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783440711 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783440711 -0300\n\ndebug(relay-service): add independent SpanProcessor lifecycle diagnostics\n\nRegisters a second SpanProcessor (via the documented\nSdkTracerProviderBuilderCustomizer hook, purely additive — doesn''t touch\nthe real auto-configured exporter) with a logging-only SpanExporter.\nLogs onStart/onEnd/export/forceFlush for every span directly via SLF4J,\nproving whether real span data reaches the pipeline at all, decoupled\nfrom whether the real export to Grafana succeeds. Verified locally on\nboth JVM and native: full correct lifecycle with real trace IDs.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDFPSNBo4Wfc2c6aAcWzIbcTGz3/u6cVDGNsh5t3OduzNEnCNcMo1JFvgIockViqKX\nJQyO+2cM5/NRO9QNvXMgw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-07T16:11:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/8d4729b62ab12b55f9344c751b25a2596c6a03b0","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKDhkNDcyOWI2MmFiMTJiNTVmOTM0NGM3NTFiMjVhMjU5NmM2YTAzYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/a3728f134baa6e1185fc86e2eba16c3642dd9a4c","sha":"a3728f134baa6e1185fc86e2eba16c3642dd9a4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/a3728f134baa6e1185fc86e2eba16c3642dd9a4c"}],"sha":"8d4729b62ab12b55f9344c751b25a2596c6a03b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/8d4729b62ab12b55f9344c751b25a2596c6a03b0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/a3728f134baa6e1185fc86e2eba16c3642dd9a4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T15:32:04Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T15:32:04Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"fix(relay-service): flush after the tracing filter ends the span, not before\n\nConfirmed in spring-boot-webmvc''s source: ServerHttpObservationFilter\n(which ends the request''s span) registers at HIGHEST_PRECEDENCE + 1.\nOur filter had no explicit order, defaulting to innermost/LOWEST_PRECEDENCE\n— its finally block (the flush) ran before that filter''s own finally\nended the current span, so every flush only ever caught the previous\nrequest''s span, one request late. Ordering us at HIGHEST_PRECEDENCE\nmakes our finally run last, after the span is actually ended.","tree":{"sha":"c7e45622484bfbbefc564ca34fe897f60ff07329","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/c7e45622484bfbbefc564ca34fe897f60ff07329"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/a3728f134baa6e1185fc86e2eba16c3642dd9a4c","verification":{"payload":"tree c7e45622484bfbbefc564ca34fe897f60ff07329\nparent 10d69a8e8d2967488f34116996db97931292c4e5\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783438324 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783438324 -0300\n\nfix(relay-service): flush after the tracing filter ends the span, not before\n\nConfirmed in spring-boot-webmvc''s source: ServerHttpObservationFilter\n(which ends the request''s span) registers at HIGHEST_PRECEDENCE + 1.\nOur filter had no explicit order, defaulting to innermost/LOWEST_PRECEDENCE\n— its finally block (the flush) ran before that filter''s own finally\nended the current span, so every flush only ever caught the previous\nrequest''s span, one request late. Ordering us at HIGHEST_PRECEDENCE\nmakes our finally run last, after the span is actually ended.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIT5f7HtBG8XOvbF4c0CTOTsBjYM2ziqcCcMLJ1zKJZp2F3OPQVGl0926QJjz3hyF2\nDzZ7OW7pVy57rL+bcqngk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-07T15:32:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/a3728f134baa6e1185fc86e2eba16c3642dd9a4c","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKGEzNzI4ZjEzNGJhYTZlMTE4NWZjODZlMmViYTE2YzM2NDJkZDlhNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/10d69a8e8d2967488f34116996db97931292c4e5","sha":"10d69a8e8d2967488f34116996db97931292c4e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/10d69a8e8d2967488f34116996db97931292c4e5"}],"sha":"a3728f134baa6e1185fc86e2eba16c3642dd9a4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/a3728f134baa6e1185fc86e2eba16c3642dd9a4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/10d69a8e8d2967488f34116996db97931292c4e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T14:46:51Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T14:46:51Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"debug(relay-service): surface OTLP export diagnostics\n\nBridge java.util.logging into SLF4J (OTel''s own exporter/BatchSpanProcessor\nlog via JUL, invisible in our Logback output otherwise) and raise the\nrelevant loggers to DEBUG. Log forceFlush''s result code and the bound\nOTLP headers config (lengths only, never secret values) at startup.\nTemporary: to be gated behind a property once we''ve used this to find\nwhy relay-service spans aren''t reaching Tempo.","tree":{"sha":"7b56d775196069d425f2e319606973a3d4562cdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/7b56d775196069d425f2e319606973a3d4562cdb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/10d69a8e8d2967488f34116996db97931292c4e5","verification":{"payload":"tree 7b56d775196069d425f2e319606973a3d4562cdb\nparent cfc0f98acd94f439031686a9c5267b869eb15d16\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783435611 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783435611 -0300\n\ndebug(relay-service): surface OTLP export diagnostics\n\nBridge java.util.logging into SLF4J (OTel''s own exporter/BatchSpanProcessor\nlog via JUL, invisible in our Logback output otherwise) and raise the\nrelevant loggers to DEBUG. Log forceFlush''s result code and the bound\nOTLP headers config (lengths only, never secret values) at startup.\nTemporary: to be gated behind a property once we''ve used this to find\nwhy relay-service spans aren''t reaching Tempo.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNk8vh/imptiSKZTtnjpENkNrxJ0d+1mvV/UBAo6RRO1L4jwW0isbo1tmUtcobbLZd\nQG/uadkPhW6gYLzSnNjQI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-07T14:46:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/10d69a8e8d2967488f34116996db97931292c4e5","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKDEwZDY5YThlOGQyOTY3NDg4ZjM0MTE2OTk2ZGI5NzkzMTI5MmM0ZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/cfc0f98acd94f439031686a9c5267b869eb15d16","sha":"cfc0f98acd94f439031686a9c5267b869eb15d16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/cfc0f98acd94f439031686a9c5267b869eb15d16"}],"sha":"10d69a8e8d2967488f34116996db97931292c4e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/10d69a8e8d2967488f34116996db97931292c4e5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/cfc0f98acd94f439031686a9c5267b869eb15d16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T14:02:25Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T14:02:25Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"fix(faro): tag spans with app.name to survive Grafana''s app-key stamping\n\nhomepage/blog/todo share one Frontend Observability app-key, so\nGrafana''s ingest stamps service.name (and Faro''s own gf.feoIly.app.name\nattribute) to that shared app''s registered name, not whichever app\nactually sent the beacon — traces from all three were indistinguishable\nin Tempo by service name alone. app.name is a plain custom resource\nattribute Grafana doesn''t touch, so it survives per-trace.","tree":{"sha":"23c3581fcef71028bdb7cd41d687256d26848020","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/23c3581fcef71028bdb7cd41d687256d26848020"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/cfc0f98acd94f439031686a9c5267b869eb15d16","verification":{"payload":"tree 23c3581fcef71028bdb7cd41d687256d26848020\nparent b8aff707ce29ea570daba37022b3ddff36bd21a3\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783432945 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783432945 -0300\n\nfix(faro): tag spans with app.name to survive Grafana''s app-key stamping\n\nhomepage/blog/todo share one Frontend Observability app-key, so\nGrafana''s ingest stamps service.name (and Faro''s own gf.feoIly.app.name\nattribute) to that shared app''s registered name, not whichever app\nactually sent the beacon — traces from all three were indistinguishable\nin Tempo by service name alone. app.name is a plain custom resource\nattribute Grafana doesn''t touch, so it survives per-trace.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQA3+IsZlP/qWZ0p+JQs8dxfuWrYRjUDLK06RL9DdBub13cPLyndFgdX6AZnPCKRoW4\nh3SPpv2nnkB8lpDi81KQw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-07T14:02:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/cfc0f98acd94f439031686a9c5267b869eb15d16","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKGNmYzBmOThhY2Q5NGY0MzkwMzE2ODZhOWM1MjY3Yjg2OWViMTVkMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/com