.\nFlushing in a Filter''s finally block runs while the request''s CPU\nallocation is still guaranteed, at no infra cost change.","tree":{"sha":"9119cd61dfa0a4ad22baf0ba5d5ccb5760a9c80c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/9119cd61dfa0a4ad22baf0ba5d5ccb5760a9c80c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/b8aff707ce29ea570daba37022b3ddff36bd21a3","verification":{"payload":"tree 9119cd61dfa0a4ad22baf0ba5d5ccb5760a9c80c\nparent 34aaa38321d68e684d97356e740657e53e80bfa8\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783432920 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783432920 -0300\n\nfix(relay-service): force-flush traces synchronously per request\n\nCloud Run''s cpuIdle:true throttles CPU the moment a response is sent,\nso BatchSpanProcessor''s background export timer may never get\nscheduled between requests — spans were being created (confirmed via\nmatching trace IDs in structured logs) but never reaching Tempo.\nFlushing in a Filter''s finally block runs while the request''s CPU\nallocation is still guaranteed, at no infra cost change.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBDDgHgKGqczzPE4LyHnQAWVsGN7mKvu5BV+wzSDtujgJP91/OJE4gX0S8IoakuoZB\nNTRFH3Tk36Qipu3afrkQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-07T14:02:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/b8aff707ce29ea570daba37022b3ddff36bd21a3","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKGI4YWZmNzA3Y2UyOWVhNTcwZGFiYTM3MDIyYjNkZGZmMzZiZDIxYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/34aaa38321d68e684d97356e740657e53e80bfa8","sha":"34aaa38321d68e684d97356e740657e53e80bfa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/34aaa38321d68e684d97356e740657e53e80bfa8"}],"sha":"b8aff707ce29ea570daba37022b3ddff36bd21a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/b8aff707ce29ea570daba37022b3ddff36bd21a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/34aaa38321d68e684d97356e740657e53e80bfa8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T03:20:01Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T03:20:01Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"fix(relay-service): use the documented OTLP headers property, not a custom bean\n\nTraces were live-verifiedcompletely absent from Tempo despite a correct-looking endpoint/auth setup and no export errors logged at all (unlike metrics, which do log\\failures) — suspecting the custom bean interfered with rather than\\composed with the auto-configured exporter. Removing it in favor of the\\documented property is simpler and removes that whole class of doubt.","tree":{"sha":"4abd74361e1512db02473d57f329bce2e6b1a9e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/4abd74361e1512db02473d57f329bce2e6b1a9e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/34aaa38321d68e684d97356e740657e53e80bfa8","verification":{"payload":"tree 4abd74361e1512db02473d57f329bce2e6b1a9e3\nparent de0ff897fc4bfe150e3aacf4a708a2cb762704f4\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783394401 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783394401 -0300\n\nfix(relay-service): use the documented OTLP headers property, not a custom bean\n\nTraces were live-verifiedcompletely absent from Tempo despite a correct-looking endpoint/auth setup and no export errors logged at all (unlike metrics, which do log\\failures) — suspecting the custom bean interfered with rather than\\composed with the auto-configured exporter. Removing it in favor of the\\documented property is simpler and removes that whole class of doubt.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAAD