smoke test has a real health check\n\nVerified locally first: native:compile + running the binary confirms\n/actuator/health returns 200 UP within 2s, both on JVM and native.","tree":{"sha":"d5c2771d93e9798d2e916867b1a3db6c76324cbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/d5c2771d93e9798d2e916867b1a3db6c76324cbe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/3cd54947d99b03cdc40d44c3fbd8c8354390ddee","verification":{"payload":"tree d5c2771d93e9798d2e916867b1a3db6c76324cbe\nparent d91281c9025e478869e317bfb6cbb5ce4691dc86\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783350252 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783350252 -0300\n\nfix(relay-service): add actuator so the CI smoke test has a real health check\n\nVerified locally first: native:compile + running the binary confirms\n/actuator/health returns 200 UP within 2s, both on JVM and native.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOFiXPeQXt1h8jatZyhg2sBoiDT/y1XgjpvftWjsCd3djk8OOg+hfLe3mrQwsVauqG\ngHtbz1oO8xMnntnnxn8Ak=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-06T15:04:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/r