ng{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/dd31a3c6d2f96c93739ae80ea68f9ab85bbc7f24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T23:48:54Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T23:48:54Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"chore(ci): tag Faro events with the git SHA as release version\n\nVerified live in prod: Grafana''s Faro receiver auto-fetches our public\nsourcemaps and fully resolves minified stack frames to real source with\nzero upload step (predates the newer private-uploads feature, which\nexists to avoid publishing source — moot here, it''s already public on\nGitHub). Cuts the planned CI sourcemap-upload iteration entirely. Still\nworth tagging the release so Grafana can group/filter errors by deploy.","tree":{"sha":"4d143d4523e380126cfc30d42f3917768918c77e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/4d143d4523e380126cfc30d42f3917768918c77e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/dd31a3c6d2f96c93739ae80ea68f9ab85bbc7f24","verification":{"payload":"tree 4d143d4523e380126cfc30d42f3917768918c77e\nparent a496172257abcb330b37e2f637b81f0c6dd7cfed\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783295334 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783295334 -0300\n\nchore(ci): tag Faro events with the git SHA as release version\n\nVerified live in prod: Grafana''s Faro receiver auto-fetches our public\nsourcemaps and fully resolves minified stack frames to real source with\nzero upload step (predates the newer private-uploads feature, which\nexists to avoid publishing source — moot here, it''s already public on\nGitHub). Cuts the planned CI sourcemap-upload iteration entirely. Still\nworth tagging the release so Grafana can group/filter errors by deploy.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNAEeiuUUl0tVXZQJ8WP4/uySEXDtnur1puiFKfS2d6Ik/wbxfpHFgqv78v9I5DOO1\nMkmnVlakVQRCu//LDg+AI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-06T01:32:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/dd31a3c6d2f96c93739ae80ea68f9ab85bbc7f24","node