guably the app most\nworth observing here (offline-first CRDT sync + WebAuthn PRF passkeys).\nReuses homepage''s root flags.json (no per-app copy, same pattern as blog).\nNo routing to track (single static screen). Sets\npropagateTraceHeaderCorsUrls for the relay-service call, which is\ncross-origin (Cloud Run''s own domain) — Faro doesn''t propagate trace\nheaders cross-origin by default.","tree":{"sha":"f5651a4b682b063ca2871c31730cdfc7f8016cb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/f5651a4b682b063ca2871c31730cdfc7f8016cb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/a496172257abcb330b37e2f637b81f0c6dd7cfed","verification":{"payload":"tree f5651a4b682b063ca2871c31730cdfc7f8016cb1\nparent ba463e395265632076f1c9c0e2ed46d5e368ca5b\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783292949 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783292949 -0300\n\nfeat(todo): add Grafana Faro instrumentation, flag-gated dark launch\n\nCloses a gap from the original rollout, which only matched today''s\nCloudWatch RUM footprint (homepage+blog) — todo is arguably the app most\nworth observing here (offline-first CRDT sync + WebAuthn PRF passkeys).\nReuses homepage''s root flags.json (no per-app copy, same pattern as blog).\nNo routing to track (single static screen). Sets\npropagateTraceHeaderCorsUrls for the relay-service call, which is\ncross-origin (Cloud Run''s own domain) — Faro doesn''t propagate trace\nheaders cross-origin by default.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQP+5WSjnmjSO+4rcJg0DH2Pk3/5lAoOjFFFJs86rQr8TyIkpEWMb1kwKy0uWpBTQ2z\nPQk4gxfZOgh1kS7e1mkAY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-05T23:13:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","eve