 of duplicating it per app, mirroring the\nexisting @lean-dev-br/rum pattern. Route changes are tagged via setView() (no official Faro/Next.js router integration exists) instead of the generic\ntrackNavigation flag used on homepage''s router-less SPA.","tree":{"sha":"fd7c62a5e51c3f03602c50c5986baf04badde77e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/fd7c62a5e51c3f03602c50c5986baf04badde77e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/09e6cd2a3272313fd533c64834a0f3351940e1de","verification":{"payload":"tree fd7c62a5e51c3f03602c50c5986baf04badde77e\nparent 80f23111aa843b6ad88b1264a7f019794709ba43\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783290910 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783290910 -0300\n\nfeat(blog): add Grafana Faro instrumentation, flag-gated dark launch\n\nCentralizes Faro init into a new @lean-dev-br/faro lib (flag-gate, sampling,\ninstrumentation set) instead of duplicating it per app, mirroring the\nexisting @lean-dev-br/rum pattern. Route changes are tagged via setView() (no official Faro/Next.js router integration exists) instead of the generic\ntrackNavigation flag used on homepage''s router-less SPA.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQI7lMM8yVUxgYWDi0ZqOmYpldJYigm6KjMxv3quQ8klEkQMmr/ZM5GDPd7CoxcrrOq\nW8WnlK9Zy3fBtbL+InSQA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-05T22:35:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_