ype":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/80f23111aa843b6ad88b1264a7f019794709ba43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T21:25:03Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T21:25:03Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"fix(infra): use CloudFront''s full 7-method AllowedMethods set for /o11y/*\n\nCloudFront only accepts 3 exact AllowedMethods combinations; [GET, HEAD,\nOPTIONS, POST] isn''t one of them and the prior deploy failed with\nInvalidArgument. POST support requires the full DELETE/GET/HEAD/OPTIONS/\nPATCH/POST/PUT set, same as /api/*.","tree":{"sha":"5e601e23ff47242b6dbc751792537509ca003179","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/5e601e23ff47242b6dbc751792537509ca003179"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/80f23111aa843b6ad88b1264a7f019794709ba43","verification":{"payload":"tree 5e601e23ff47242b6dbc751792537509ca003179\nparent 0ed34f22a2e27c74e887a0fa212d45110bd033a8\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783286703 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783286703 -0300\n\nfix(infra): use CloudFront''s full 7-method AllowedMethods set for /o11y/*\n\nCloudFront only accepts 3 exact AllowedMethods combinations; [GET, HEAD,\nOPTIONS, POST] isn''t one of them and the prior deploy failed with\nInvalidArgument. POST support requires the full DELETE/GET/HEAD/OPTIONS/\nPATCH/POST/PUT set, same as /api/*.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPnTFRhO97Oy9D4B+CeCF00hogE3Wj3JFnF1phM8v0xi+hSFFL8qrvaeARipOZVvTl\njpuoN2TDsSxlnVOdXWkQE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----