dregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/0ed34f22a2e27c74e887a0fa212d45110bd033a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T21:08:18Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T21:08:18Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"feat(infra): proxy /o11y/* to the Grafana Faro collector, same-origin\n\nFrontend telemetry beacons now go through our own CloudFront distribution\ninstead of the collector hostname directly, so ad blockers/ITP that\ntarget known telemetry hosts don''t drop them. Collector host/path are\nPulumi config, not hardcoded — CloudFront Functions have no runtime\nconfig access, so the path is baked into the edge function at deploy time.","tree":{"sha":"1786e394c5acbc5b7663da026d68be171f72aa90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/1786e394c5acbc5b7663da026d68be171f72aa90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/0ed34f22a2e27c74e887a0fa212d45110bd033a8","verification":{"payload":"tree 1786e394c5acbc5b7663da026d68be171f72aa90\nparent 32a05d78e90dffe4cfe0eee0e82a62e671038d28\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783285698 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783285698 -0300\n\nfeat(infra): proxy /o11y/* to the Grafana Faro collector, same-origin\n\nFrontend telemetry beacons now go through our own CloudFront distribution\ninstead of the collector hostname directly, so ad blockers/ITP that\ntarget known telemetry hosts don''t drop them. Collector host/path are\nPulumi config, not hardcoded — CloudFront Functions have no runtime\nconfig access, so the path is baked into the edge function at deploy time.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQB/k6xR4/cmsWMm/WWvd1VKL0fIpeYDVU2ajmU5/3xhmB8oOsEq3hQjWZaOgMW58TX\nscD/l5Sopd/NUKr5mRTgA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-05T21:08:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/0ed34f22a2e27c74e887a0fa212d45110bd033a8","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKDBlZDM0ZjIyYTJlMjdjNzRlODg3YTBmYTIxMmQ0NTExMGJkMDMzYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/32a05d78e90dffe4cfe0eee0e82a62e671038d28","sha":"32a05d78e90dffe4cfe0eee0e82a62e671038d28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/32a05d78e90dffe4cfe0eee0e82a62e671038d28"}],"sha":"0ed34f22a2e27c74e887a0fa212d45110bd033a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/0ed34f22a2e27c74e887a0fa212d45110bd033a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/32a05d78e90dffe4cfe0eee0e82a62e671038d28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T19:41:05Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T19:41:05Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"feat(homepage): add Grafana Faro instrumentation, flag-gated dark launch\n\nWires @grafana/faro-web-sdk behind the observability-faro flag (default\noff) so it ships dark and can be killed instantly via flags.json if it\nmisbehaves in real browsers. Points at a same-origin /o11y/collect path\n(CloudFront proxy lands next) instead of the collector hostname directly,\nso telemetry survives ad blockers/ITP. Session sampling stays at 1 and\nbeforeSend samples non-error signals only — Faro''s built-in session\nsampler is all-or-nothing and would otherwise drop error signals too.","tree":{"sha":"b5725fe49dd38c2f7fcfcbc17e8b1b07d2b8ba06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/b5725fe49dd38c2f7fcfcbc17e8b1b07d2b8ba06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/32a05d78e90dffe4cfe0eee0e82a62e671038d28","verification":{"payload":"tree b5725fe49dd38c2f7fcfcbc17e8b1b07d2b8ba06\nparent f230bd07fd63f7ff0c8aa51bf9e44dec18e244a2\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783280465 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783280465 -0300\n\nfeat(homepage): add Grafana Faro instrumentation, flag-gated dark launch\n\nWires @grafana/faro-web-sdk behind the observability-faro flag (default\noff) so it ships dark and can be killed instantly via flags.json if it\nmisbehaves in real browsers. Points at a same-origin /o11y/collect path\n(CloudFront proxy lands next) instead of the collector hostname directly,\nso telemetry survives ad blockers/ITP. Session sampling stays at 1 and\nbeforeSend samples non-error signals only — Faro''s built-in session\nsampler is all-or-nothing and would otherwise drop error signals too.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQEE+oESWtS6L/zTEytBugWkG2kYJFSJOpTZ8T/Dc4v6oikfyBlU//fMOPHCjBxE73R\n7BCvQXOn+/3hqVgC8uWAM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-05T19:46:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","