regs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/f230bd07fd63f7ff0c8aa51bf9e44dec18e244a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T18:59:36Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T18:59:36Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"feat(build): enable public sourcemaps across all browser apps\n\nProd bundles shipped with no .map, so unhandled errors resolved to\nminified positions in devtools. First step of the Grafana observability\nrollout — legible stacktraces feed both browser devtools and Faro.","tree":{"sha":"6b9eef3fa04a0036eb179926d7ef5479598d2188","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/6b9eef3fa04a0036eb179926d7ef5479598d2188"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/f230bd07fd63f7ff0c8aa51bf9e44dec18e244a2","verification":{"payload":"tree 6b9eef3fa04a0036eb179926d7ef5479598d2188\nparent a8a679fdd99229894f3b38177211a70abbd1e163\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783277976 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783277976 -0300\n\nfeat(build): enable public sourcemaps across all browser apps\n\nProd bundles shipped with no .map, so unhandled errors resolved to\nminified positions in devtools. First step of the Grafana observability\nrollout — legible stacktraces feed both browser devtools and Faro.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPZPIgyANKMQKZti3LbM2NyfqlsezUcjXvPG9Bq5n7iJq1Hu9byVBfvrVwd4irqSX0\nt+YhJXNsh9yrlslvbnPAo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-05T19:09:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://