ttps://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/a8a679fdd99229894f3b38177211a70abbd1e163/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T01:12:33Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T01:12:33Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"docs(setup): document browser Cache-Control strategy vs CloudFront edge TTL\n\nAlso fixes a stale claim that blog HTML uses CACHING_OPTIMIZED — it''s\nCACHING_DISABLED (only /blog/_next/* assets are edge-cached).","tree":{"sha":"76f71e78e7aa5be6b97fe93721a8b9e425468262","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/76f71e78e7aa5be6b97fe93721a8b9e425468262"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/a8a679fdd99229894f3b38177211a70abbd1e163","verification":{"payload":"tree 76f71e78e7aa5be6b97fe93721a8b9e425468262\nparent be3c8d13f40ac0ebb3be4ac64ed8287c71fa30ed\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783213953 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783213953 -0300\n\ndocs(setup): document browser Cache-Control strategy vs CloudFront edge TTL\n\nAlso fixes a stale claim that blog HTML uses CACHING_OPTIMIZED — it''s\nCACHING_DISABLED (only /blog/_next/* assets are edge-cached).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLgrfnx