s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/be3c8d13f40ac0ebb3be4ac64ed8287c71fa30ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T01:07:01Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T01:07:01Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"feat(infra): serve immutable Cache-Control on hashed assets, must-revalidate on HTML\n\nCloudFront managed cache policies only govern edge TTL, not the header\nsent to browsers. S3 origin sets no Cache-Control, so browsers fell\nback to heuristic caching for fingerprinted bundles and had no\nexplicit revalidation directive for HTML/manifests/flags.json.\n\nSplit each app''s ResponseHeadersPolicy into an assets variant\n(immutable, max-age=1yr) and a document variant (must-revalidate),\nattached to the matching CACHING_OPTIMIZED/CACHING_DISABLED behaviors.","tree":{"sha":"e11106a878dff408ea5ffcf9ea9c31eb74243496","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/e11106a878dff408ea5ffcf9ea9c31eb74243496"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/be3c8d13f40ac0ebb3be4ac64ed8287c71fa30ed","verification":{"payload":"tree e11106a878dff408ea5ffcf9ea9c31eb74243496\nparent f1fe62e2d0363a144dfee9a24a153750dd9e3541\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783213621 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783213621 -0300\n\nfeat(infra): serve immutable Cache-Control on hashed assets, must-revalidate on HTML\n\nCloudFront managed cache policies only govern edge TTL, not the header\nsent to browsers. S3 origin sets no Cache-Control, so browsers fell\nback to heuristic caching for fingerprinted bundles and had no\nexplicit revalidation directive for HTML/manifests/flags.json.\n\nSplit each app''s ResponseHeadersPolicy into an assets variant\n(immutable, max-age=1yr) and a document variant (must-revalidate),\nattached to the matching CACHING_OPTIMIZED/CACHING_DISABLED behaviors.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQCMnC3HjWbHbYmdxwVmU9fp/mPUvXThKi88zo64EO5+EtydZDAXV6UsvNFSx5KRpRk\nMC7wu/B1l4wt7n24P4AQ4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-05T01:12:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/be3c8d13f40ac0ebb3be4ac64ed8287c71fa30ed","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKGJlM2M4ZDEzZjQwYWMwZWJiM2JlNGFjNjRlZDgyODdjNzFmYTMwZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/f1fe62e2d0363a144dfee9a24a153750dd9e3541","sha":"f1fe62e2d0363a144dfee9a24a153750dd9e3541","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/f1fe62e2d0363a144dfee9a24a153750dd9e3541"}],"sha":"be3c8d13f40ac0ebb3be4ac64ed8287c71fa30ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/be3c8d13f40ac0ebb3be4ac64ed8287c71fa30ed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/f1fe62e2d0363a144dfee9a24a153750dd9e3541/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T22:27:52Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T22:27:52Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"docs(federation): corroborate the stream-limit tax with real data + a causal lab\n\nanalyze-har.mjs is a reusable script readers can point at any HAR. Ran it\nagainst a real production capture (shop.lululemon.com, a confirmed MF\nadopter) showing remoteEntry.js requests blocked ~285-303ms vs ~42ms\naverage, on HTTP/3 already, not HTTP/2 — but peak concurrency there never\ncrossed the documented ceilings, so it''s suggestive, not proof.\n\napps/federation-shell/docs/stream-limit-lab/ closes that gap: a local\nnginx serving our own federation build from one origin, with\nhttp2_max_concurrent_streams as the only variable. 4 trials per cap show\na consistent ~2.2-2.6x blocked-time increase with no overlap between\nranges — causal, not circumstantial. Chrome''s own client-side cap\n(kMaxConcurrentStreamLimit = 256, confirmed in net/spdy/spdy_session.cc)\nturned out to be a compile-time constant with no override, so only the\nserver side could be varied — which is also the only side a web team\nactually controls.","tree":{"sha":"b2dfb857607ca10fbbb1029c46c8fd5ffee33239","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/b2dfb857607ca10fbbb1029c46c8fd5ffee33239"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/f1fe62e2d0363a144dfee9a24a153750dd9e3541","verification":{"payload":"tree b2dfb857607ca10fbbb1029c46c8fd5ffee33239\nparent c8b13a7c2f33066e09761782463aaa97285f3a25\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783204072 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783204072 -0300\n\ndocs(federation): corroborate the stream-limit tax with real data + a causal lab\n\nanalyze-har.mjs is a reusable script readers can point at any HAR. Ran it\nagainst a real production capture (shop.lululemon.com, a confirmed MF\nadopter) showing remoteEntry.js requests blocked ~285-303ms vs ~42ms\naverage, on HTTP/3 already, not HTTP/2 — but peak concurrency there never\ncrossed the documented ceilings, so it''s suggestive, not proof.\n\napps/federation-shell/docs/stream-limit-lab/ closes that gap: a local\nnginx serving our own federation build from one origin, with\nhttp2_max_concurrent_streams as the only variable. 4 trials per cap show\na consistent ~2.2-2.6x blocked-time increase with no overlap between\nranges — causal, not circumstantial. Chrome''s own client-side cap\n(kMaxConcurrentStreamLimit = 256, confirmed in net/spdy/spdy_session.cc)\nturned out to be a compile-time constant with no override, so only the\nserver side could be varied — which is also the only side a web team\nactually controls.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQK/WPwUVqJn+eeMJ+Mmm3IYrCnEZOo+NJFGUDJwKE2tx71QNTR0hIqT93DAp2d1Mly\noZUL+vfZL/WDAMKdaOXAo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-04T22:28:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/f1fe62e2d0363a144dfee9a24a153750dd9e3541","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKGYxZmU2MmUyZDAzNjNhMTQ0ZGZlZTlhMjRhMTUzNzUwZGQ5ZT