egs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T01:33:02Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"feat(homepage): enable labs-modulith flag\n\nTrusted Types fix verified end-to-end — safe to show the /labs card.","tree":{"sha":"04757511c7867794a8609d21b81cdfcb4d8bed47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/04757511c7867794a8609d21b81cdfcb4d8bed47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/1378718d20c0f0875e2cb21b2ed3ab09ddf1efd8","verification":{"payload":"tree 04757511c7867794a8609d21b81cdfcb4d8bed47\nparent 44999768e99d265cbd8a91fa44c3f6f69e476f2d\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783042382 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783042382 -0300\n\nfeat(homepage): enable labs-modulith flag\n\nTrusted Types fix verified end-to-end — safe to show the /labs card.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNqFwa/kyLWy/KiKuMbo+ztc2aqK2MNE1tdd9mvkMD00923QhHJYbqbQxIiUm9oDD1\nKimtQswVDogpvFBPyx8gE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-03T01:33:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/1378718d20c0f0875e2cb21b2ed3ab09ddf1efd8","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKDEzNzg3MThkMjBjMGYwODc1ZTJjYjIxYjJlZDNhYjA5ZGRmMWVmZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/44999768e99d265cbd8a91fa44c3f6f69e476f2d","sha":"44999768e99d265cbd8a91fa44c3f6f69e476f2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/44999768e99d265cbd8a91fa44c3f6f69e476f2d"}],"sha":"1378718d20c0f0875e2cb21b2ed3ab09ddf1efd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/1378718d20c0f0875e2cb21b2ed3ab09ddf1efd8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/44999768e99d265cbd8a91fa44c3f6f69e476f2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T01:25:58Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T01:25:58Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"fix(blog): allowlist relative chunk URLs in Trusted Types policy\n\nThe synthetic monitor''s blog tags test started failing this morning:\nclicking into a tag page (client-side route transition) crashed with\n\"This page couldn''t load\" — a TT violation, not a missing element.\n\nTrustedTypesBoot only allowlisted the absolute origin-prefixed form\n(https://lean.dev.br/blog/_next/). The initial page load''s own\n<script> tags resolve to that form, but Turbopack''s client-side chunk\nloader — used for route transitions — passes the raw relative path\nstraight to the script-URL sink instead, so it never matched.\n\nVerified against a local prod-CSP preview (homepage:preview-all):\nclicking a tag link from a post now transitions cleanly with zero\nconsole errors, where it previously crashed on every browser engine.","tree":{"sha":"2f5b4eb76542d3a6dbd36118e4a8b27b9a068bf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/2f5b4eb76542d3a6dbd36118e4a8b27b9a068bf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/44999768e99d265cbd8a91fa44c3f6f69e476f2d","verification":{"payload":"tree 2f5b4eb76542d3a6dbd36118e4a8b27b9a068bf9\nparent e670cc51191a296b5ae581156a037ee5ba1c76ab\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783041958 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783041958 -0300\n\nfix(blog): allowlist relative chunk URLs in Trusted Types policy\n\nThe synthetic monitor''s blog tags test started failing this morning:\nclicking into a tag page (client-side route transition) crashed with\n\"This page couldn''t load\" — a TT violation, not a missing element.\n\nTrustedTypesBoot only allowlisted the absolute origin-prefixed form\n(https://lean.dev.br/blog/_next/). The initial page load''s own\n<script> tags resolve to that form, but Turbopack''s client-side chunk\nloader — used for route transitions — passes the raw relative path\nstraight to the script-URL sink instead, so it never matched.\n\nVerified against a local prod-CSP preview (homepage:preview-all):\nclicking a tag link from a post now transitions cleanly with zero\nconsole errors, where it previously crashed on every browser engine.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHK4koJv/niChP/95Jf0XTSQ5Sdyf/s0kTpLIcH70P95rkm8wKjAzAKFfyfm92uU+I\nuYz675gH6zGrhafBiCHAs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-03T01:26:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/44999768e99d265cbd8a91fa44c3f6f69e476f2d","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKDQ0OTk5NzY4ZTk5ZDI2NWNiZDhhOTFmYTQ0YzNmNmY2OWU0NzZmMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/e670cc51191a296b5ae581156a037ee5ba1c76ab","sha":"e670cc51191a296b5ae581156a037ee5ba1c76ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/e670cc51191a296b5ae581156a037ee5ba1c76ab"}],"sha":"44999768e99d265cbd8a91fa44c3f6f69e476f2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/44999768e99d265cbd8a91fa44c3f6f69e476f2d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/e670cc51191a296b5ae581156a037ee5ba1c76ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T00:52:09Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T00:52:09Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"message":"fix(ui-modulith): register Trusted Types policy for MSW service worker\n\nProd CSP unconditionally adds require-trusted-types-for ''script'' for\nevery app, but ui-modulith never registered a policy — so MSW''s\nnavigator.serviceWorker.register() call (a TT script-URL sink) was\nblocked outright once the labs-modulith flag was flipped on in prod.\nRegisters the shared app+default policies, allowlisting the relative\nmockServiceWorker.js path MSW actually passes to the sink (not the\nresolved absolute URL).\n\nThis slipped through because two local safety nets weren''t actually\nwired up for this app: vite.config.mts sent the dev CSP (no TT\nenforcement) for `preview` too, unlike every other app''s prod-mode\npreview; and homepage''s preview-all task — the one tool that emulates\nthe real CloudFront routing + prod CSP across all apps — didn''t know\nabout ui-modulith at all. Both fixed, and verified end-to-end against\na rebuilt preview-all: MSW registers cleanly, catalog loads mocked\ndata, zero console errors.\n\nAlso standardizes ui-modulith''s build output to apps/ui-modulith/dist,\nmatching every other app, instead of the workspace-level dist/ it was\nusing — removes the path special-casing this had forced into hosting.ts\nand preview.mjs.","tree":{"sha":"8f09752dfef27cc65c9bb3b27feb0c66caed9461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/8f09752dfef27cc65c9bb3b27feb0c66caed9461"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/e670cc51191a296b5ae581156a037ee5ba1c76ab","verification":{"payload":"tree 8f09752dfef27cc65c9bb3b27feb0c66caed9461\nparent 827260b6c61a64c58b3d08a00135d068a12d6775\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783039929 -0300\ncommitter André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1783039929 -0300\n\nfix(ui-modulith): register Trusted Types policy for MSW service worker\n\nProd CSP unconditionally adds require-trusted-types-for ''script'' for\nevery app, but ui-modulith never registered a policy — so MSW''s\nnavigator.serviceWorker.register() call (a TT script-URL sink) was\nblocked outright once the labs-modulith flag was flipped on in prod.\nRegisters the shared app+default policies, allowlisting the relative\nmockServiceWorker.js path MSW actually passes to the sink (not the\nresolved absolute URL).\n\nThis slipped through because two local safety nets weren''t actually\nwired up for this app: vite.config.mts sent the dev CSP (no TT\nenforcement) for `preview` too, unlike every other app''s prod-mode\npreview; and homepage''s preview-all task — the one tool that emulates\nthe real CloudFront routing + prod CSP across all apps — didn''t know\nabout ui-modulith at all. Both fixed, and verified end-to-end against\na rebuilt preview-all: MSW registers cleanly, catalog loads mocked\ndata, zero console errors.\n\nAlso standardizes ui-modulith''s build output to apps/ui-modulith/dist,\nmatching every other app, instead of the workspace-level dist/ it was\nusing — removes the path special-casing this had forced into hosting.ts\nand preview.mjs.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoNX1QTsJGc/NYn+qL8qTQcygP0\n90pA84L/ce+2vjPvgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKZMONL+33rAojhuiN40hqU8F5DipNW+5z3WsZMHo9P9uX0PsDI8eHRzkgZsUDK1FZ\ncfvB/wK8y0JfE46mLEgws=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-03T00:53:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/e670cc51191a296b5ae581156a037ee5ba1c76ab","node_id":"C_kwDOSwhTatoAKGU2NzBjYzUxMTkxYTI5NmI1YWU1ODExNTZhMDM3ZWU1YmExYzc2YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andregs/lean-dev-br/commit/827260b6c61a64c58b3d08a00135d068a12d6775","sha":"827260b6c61a64c58b3d08a00135d068a12d6775","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/827260b6c61a64c58b3d08a00135d068a12d6775"}],"sha":"e670cc51191a296b5ae581156a037ee5ba1c76ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/e670cc51191a296b5ae581156a037ee5ba1c76ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/712092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andregs","id":712092,"login":"andregs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjA5Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andregs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/commits/827260b6c61a64c58b3d08a00135d068a12d6775/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T01:32:35Z","email":"andregs@users.noreply.github.com","name":"André Gomes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T01:32:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Frontend Modulith lab (ui-modulith) (#30)\n\nAdds a new `/labs` demo — a **frontend modulith**: the module-boundary and\nper-domain code-splitting wins of microfrontends, without runtime federation.\nBoundaries are enforced by Nx tags at lint time (a forbidden `feature→feature`\nimport fails the build, proven and documented), catalog and cart communicate\nonly through a typed `EventBus` in the shared kernel, and the whole thing runs\noffline against an OpenAPI-mocked API (MSW) — no real backend, by design.\n\n- `libs/ui-modulith/{kernel,catalog,cart}` + `apps/ui-modulith` shell (router,\n  i18n, lazy-loaded feature routes, DemoBar cart badge)\n- `EventBus` has replay-on-subscribe semantics so late-mounted consumers (the\n  lazy cart page) reconstruct state correctly; both the cart store and the\n  badge are Strict-Mode-safe (regression-tested)\n- e2e happy path (`ui-modulith-e2e`) + full unit coverage (kernel/catalog/cart/\n  DemoBar), all wired into CI''s `nx affected` gate\n- Homepage `/labs` card gated behind `labs-modulith` flag, shipped `DISABLED`\n- Deploy: dedicated S3 bucket + CloudFront behaviors under `/labs/ui-modulith/`,\n  mirroring the Todo app''s setup; extracted the repeated per-app bucket/OAC/\n  policy/sync pattern into `infra/homepage/static-site.ts` (verified via\n  `pulumi preview` that the refactor introduces zero resource replacements)\n- CODEOWNERS + `nx graph --focus` module-graph doc","tree":{"sha":"f67e0e7e87080cbdbf5439f23658931a28fcd1cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/trees/f67e0e7e87080cbdbf5439f23658931a28fcd1cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andregs/lean-dev-br/git/commits/827260b6c61a64c58b3d08a00135d068a12d6775","verification":{"payload":"tree f67e0e7e87080cbdbf5439f23658931a28fcd1cb\nparent dcd55ebf2e4616afcd886af8c9d9aa212b9ab4a4\nauthor André Gomes <andregs@users.noreply.github.com> 1782955955 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782955955 -0300\n\nfeat: Frontend Modulith lab (ui-modulith) (#30)\n\nAdds a new `/labs` demo — a **frontend modulith**: the module-boundary and\nper-domain code-splitting wins of microfrontends, without runtime federation.\nBoundaries are enforced by Nx tags at lint time (a forbidden `feature→feature`\nimport fails the build, proven and documented), catalog and cart communicate\nonly through a typed `EventBus` in the shared kernel, and the whole thing runs\noffline against an OpenAPI-mocked API (MSW) — no real backend, by design.\n\n- `libs/ui-modulith/{kernel,catalog,cart}` + `apps/ui-modulith` shell (router,\n  i18n, lazy-loaded feature routes, DemoBar cart badge)\n- `EventBus` has replay-on-subscribe semantics so late-mounted consumers (the\n  lazy cart page) reconstruct state correctly; both the cart store and the\n  badge are Strict-Mode-safe (regression-tested)\n- e2e happy path (`ui-modulith-e2e`) + full unit coverage (kernel/catalog/cart/\n  DemoBar), all wired into CI''s `nx affected` gate\n- Homepage `/labs` card gated behind `labs-modulith` flag, shipped `DISABLED`\n- Deploy: dedicated S3 bucket + CloudFront behaviors under `/labs/ui-modulith/`,\n  mirroring the Todo app''s setup; extracted the repeated per-app bucket/OAC/\n  policy/sync pattern into `infra/homepage/static-site.ts` (verified via\n  `pulumi preview` that the refactor introduces zero resource replacements)\n- CODEOWNERS + `nx graph --focus` module-graph doc","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRb+zCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5NAQAJu+tdhLktasm8k4LCUJEMoh\nlexeCxKn9preM4T9UiiyBYY1ji7B6b6G3ceYSJ2z2YWyHLiwdZGdv5CU0othmYda\nCRVVqHgpVF21TshRaHbBaFgXjqDz8T78PCqxkvDJK0hAH+1W9RinsoILqTXoqLck\nCtBsXIknzatKS2SMgpXVI4x0vHFcfyJzbi+lS+onwLdm4Ol7JTbF0ptq5yToTJxR\nC5VHjw7A0Dw6cfVYjomb9iTSPU7/fC/oNqFoZA3MlUwcx7UXiYEzSeuI4qb0tdGQ\nn6iNPTZ3McS6wHXhyQaSt3PgEOhvkGdoaI8SDvDa7hBVMZO1aHimGjWRSVD11vU2\n8irqToGmKOLaKzp9GnL62sKs3+Rh1kJyJ6z/wmlTkwOCydPHiDIy3qOg5qyXaLPT\nPbbB/0ltidX4bbu5o2NKhf20W+SpncbGvQIXTovi0xTJ1Rrf8xezcDm2d/8eXPRM\nXnyTRxlx+GX+KC0d5juVDb0qo05tJvFRFx5MEOyXW2HAQGLIc9o8TYEc1MXkdLC0\niS4rhotb3cTaFHaPWppGh9yn+i