30Z","email":"moomondi@safaricom.co.ke","name":"Mavene Omondi"},"message":"chore: retire ui-shell package; document logic-only architecture\n\nDelete packages/ui-shell entirely — Tailwind v4 build-time scanning makes it\narchitecturally unsound to ship UI components as an npm package. Only auth-client\nand shared-types remain. Update README with full rationale and the sim-platform\ncopy model as the replacement pattern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d33e95b1d016e6dc20a8b81584c9a411ef84df82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mavene1/iot-platform-packages/git/trees/d33e95b1d016e6dc20a8b81584c9a411ef84df82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mavene1/iot-platform-packages/git/commits/661896b27b6a675e370593fc247a6272288c5b18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mavene1/iot-platform-packages/commit/661896b27b6a675e370593fc247a6272288c5b18","node_id":"C_kwDOSwqeT9oAKDY2MTg5NmIyN2I2YTY3NWUzNzA1OTNmYzI0N2E2MjcyMjg4YzViMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Mavene1/iot-platform-packages/commit/b04181776a4acba2780d4f7cc54fdf4ef18f994a","sha":"b04181776a4acba2780d4f7cc54fdf4ef18f994a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mavene1/iot-platform-packages/commits/b04181776a4acba2780d4f7cc54fdf4ef18f994a"}],"sha":"661896b27b6a675e370593fc247a6272288c5b18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mavene1/iot-platform-packages/commits/661896b27b6a675e370593fc247a6272288c5b18"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mavene1/iot-platform-packages/commits/b04181776a4acba2780d4f7cc54fdf4ef18f994a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T07:24:56Z","email":"moomondi@safaricom.co.ke","name":"Mavene Omondi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T07:24:56Z","email":"moomondi@safaricom.co.ke","name":"Mavene Omondi"},"message":"chore: rename scope @mavene → @iot-platform-saf\n\nCo-Autho